(29, 12, 107, '2024-09-30', '2024-10-01', 'Dear Mr/Mrs ,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to inform you that I will be unable to attend training today 9/30/24 as I need to accompany my father to the hospital for medical attention and my presence is necessary to assist him during this time.\n\nI apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will ensure to catch up on any missed responsibilities.\n\nThank you for your understanding.\n\nSincerely,\nBalanial, Kurt Lui J.', 0, 1, '2024-09-30 11:22:58', '2024-09-30 11:22:58'),
(30, 11, 101, '2024-10-03', '2024-10-04', 'vaccination schedule', 0, 1, '2024-10-02 06:40:06', '2024-10-02 06:40:06'),
(31, 11, 100, '2024-10-07', '2024-10-09', 'Due to a severe episode of LBM, I am requesting a leave of absence from this day only. The condition has significantly impacted my ability to perform my duties effectively, and I require time to rest, recover, I apologize for any inconvenience this may cause, thank you for understanding.', 0, 1, '2024-10-07 08:54:20', '2024-10-07 08:54:20'),
