(40, 11, 93, '2024-10-24', '2024-10-25', 'I would like to request a leave of absence due to the heavy typhoon affecting our area. Unfortunately, I\'m unable to work from home as I do not have a device to use. Thank you for your understanding.', 0, 1, '2024-10-24 06:06:34', '2024-10-24 06:06:34'),
