(42, 11, 100, '2024-10-24', '2024-10-25', 'Due to the typhoon kristine, In quezon province we experience so much wind and strong rain due to this typoon I will be unable to commute safely to work and ensure the safety of my family. \nI apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and I will provide updates on my return to work as soon as possible.', 0, 1, '2024-10-24 06:19:46', '2024-10-24 06:19:46'),
(43, 12, 108, '2024-10-24', '2024-10-25', 'Request for Leave Due to Electricity and Internet Issues. \n\nI am currently facing ongoing issues with electricity and slow internet connectivity due to the storm and strong winds, which are impacting my ability to work online/join online meeting effectively. As a result, I would like to request a leave of absence today, October 24, 2024.\n\nThank you for your consideration.', 0, 1, '2024-10-24 08:15:57', '2024-10-24 08:15:57'),
(44, 11, 100, '2024-10-25', '2024-10-28', 'Due to the typoon kristine, we experience strong wind and heavy rain, flood in our brgy tagbakin, tiaong quezon, and can\'t commute because of this. thankyou for your understanding', 0, 1, '2024-10-24 20:18:14', '2024-10-24 20:18:14'),
