(116, 20, 263, '2025-02-13', '2025-02-14', 'Dear Ma\'am/Sir,\n\nI am writing to request a leave of absence for today, February 13, 2025, due to an injury to my left eye. I experienced discomfort and soreness after being poked in the eye.\n\nTo ensure proper care, I need to consult with an ophthalmologist for an examination. I will be sure to catch up on any missed work and complete all assigned tasks. I am also willing to render additional hours to compensate for my absence.\n\nThank you for your understanding and consideration.', 0, 1, '2025-02-13 03:38:59', '2025-02-13 03:38:59'),
(119, 20, 273, '2025-02-14', '2025-02-17', 'Good day!\n\nSir/Ma\'am \n\nI hope this message finds you well. I\'m Patrick John Mercado, an on-the-job trainee from LSPU-SPCC. I\'m writing this letter to formally request for a leave of absence. This is due to the need of compliance with my thesis requirements in school. I apologize for the urgency and inconvenience it may cause. However, if there\'s a pending or additional task that you need me to perform in line of my internship, I will be more than willing to comply. Hoping for your kind consideration.\n\nThank you!', 0, 1, '2025-02-13 11:36:05', '2025-02-13 11:36:05'),
(121, 20, 278, '2025-02-14', '2025-02-17', 'Will go to school to review and check the manuscript of the thesis.', 0, 1, '2025-02-13 19:13:22', '2025-02-13 19:13:22'),
