(227, 34, 437, '2026-03-09', '2026-03-10', 'Dear , Sir Johnny \n\nGood day. I would like to respectfully inform you that I will be unable to attend my internship duties on March 09 2026 because I will be participating in my scheduled graduation pictorial.\n\nThis pictorial is an important requirement for our upcoming graduation, and unfortunately the schedule conflicts with my internship hours. I sincerely apologize for any inconvenience my absence may cause.\n\nThank you for your understanding. I will make sure to catch up on any missed tasks and responsibilities.\n\nRespectfully,\nAgonia, Jervie Moises R.', 0, 1, '2026-03-06 09:26:49', '2026-03-06 09:26:49'),
