(236, 34, 378, '2026-03-24', '2026-03-25', 'Hi,\n\nGood day. I would like to respectfully request a Vacation Leave on March 24, 2025, as I will be attending my graduation pictorial, which is an important requirement for my graduation.\n\nI hope for your kind understanding and approval. Thank you very much.\n\nJhonas Sotero', 0, 1, '2026-03-16 06:56:25', '2026-03-16 06:56:25'),
(237, 34, 435, '2026-03-24', '2026-03-25', 'Good day.\n\nI would like to respectfully request a leave of absence on March 24, 2026. in order to attend my scheduled graduation picture taking for my college requirements. This activity is an important part of the graduation process at my school.', 0, 1, '2026-03-16 07:03:33', '2026-03-16 07:03:33'),
(238, 35, 434, '2026-03-16', '2026-03-17', 'Good day. I would like to respectfully inform you that I will be absent today because I passed out yesterday and was advised by the doctor to take proper rest. I sincerely apologize for my absence and appreciate your understanding. Thank you.', 0, 1, '2026-03-16 07:05:48', '2026-03-16 07:05:48'),
