(257, 34, 378, '2026-04-30', '2026-05-01', 'Dear Sir/Ma\'am,\n\nI am writing to formally request a one-day leave of absence on April 30, 2026.\n\nThe reason for my absence is that I will be attending a close friend\'s wedding on that day.\n\nI will ensure that all my responsibilities are settled before my leave. I hope for your kind understanding and approval.\n\nThank you.\n\nRespectfully yours,\nSotero, Jhonas G.', 0, 1, '2026-03-27 00:01:47', '2026-03-27 00:01:47'),
(258, 35, 392, '2026-03-27', '2026-03-30', 'Kelangan po dalahin sa Calamba ang kapatid ko dahil may urgent test po sya regarding sa liver/gallbladder nya at dahil po sa transport strike ay ako po ang kailangan sa pag hahatid pasensya napo at salamat po sa konsiderasyon', 0, 1, '2026-03-27 05:51:53', '2026-03-27 05:51:53'),
(259, 34, 426, '2026-03-31', '2026-04-01', 'Death of a family/ Interment (half-day leave / afternoon)', 0, 1, '2026-03-30 06:41:09', '2026-03-30 06:41:09'),
(260, 34, 425, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'For class pictorial', 0, 1, '2026-03-30 07:02:26', '2026-03-30 07:02:26'),
