(262, 34, 441, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'STI Class Picture', 0, 1, '2026-03-31 09:11:54', '2026-03-31 09:11:54'),
(263, 34, 427, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'Good day, Sir Jhonny. I would like to respectfully inform you that I will be unable to attend class on April 6, 2026, as we will have our class pictorial that day. I sincerely apologize for any inconvenience this may cause, and I will make sure to catch up on any missed lessons or requirements. I appreciate your understanding.', 0, 1, '2026-04-01 07:07:17', '2026-04-01 07:07:17'),
(264, 35, 434, '2026-04-01', '2026-04-06', 'Hello and good morning. I requested a leave of absence because I had to go to school to pick up our research paper for submission and bookbinding. I sincerely appreciate your understanding.', 0, 1, '2026-04-01 07:35:10', '2026-04-01 07:35:10'),
