(278, 35, 392, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'Tree Planting Activities of LSPU SPCC and as a clearance requirement of graduating students', 0, 1, '2026-04-05 21:37:48', '2026-04-05 21:37:48'),
(279, 35, 434, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'Good Day,\n\nI would like to respectfully request a leave of absence today as I will be participating in a scheduled tree planting activity. This activity is required for me to attend.\n\nI hope for your kind understanding regarding this matter. Thank you very much.', 0, 1, '2026-04-06 06:11:48', '2026-04-06 06:11:48'),
(280, 35, 423, '2026-04-06', '2026-04-07', 'Good day,\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I would like to respectfully inform you that I will not be able to attend my internship today due to a scheduled tree planting activity organized by our school, which will be held outside the campus.\n\nThis activity is part of our school program, and my participation is required. I will ensure that I complete any pending tasks or make up for the missed time as needed.\n\nThank you very much for your kind understanding.\n\n\nSincerely,\nAlvin B. Santiago', 0, 1, '2026-04-06 07:04:00', '2026-04-06 07:04:00'),
(281, 34, 393, '2026-04-07', '2026-04-08', 'tutulong po ako sa pagprepare para po sa cpe quest sa school', 0, 1, '2026-04-06 15:25:23', '2026-04-06 15:25:23'),
(282, 34, 432, '2026-04-10', '2026-04-13', 'Half-Day, for User Access Testing (UAT) for our client on Capstone Project', 0, 1, '2026-04-10 09:47:34', '2026-04-10 09:47:34'),
(283, 34, 431, '2026-04-10', '2026-04-13', 'Half-Day, for User Acceptance Testing (UAT) for our client on Capstone Project.', 0, 1, '2026-04-10 09:52:24', '2026-04-10 09:52:24'),
(284, 34, 436, '2026-04-17', '2026-04-20', 'Tribute to parents', 0, 1, '2026-04-15 19:54:34', '2026-04-15 19:54:34'),
(285, 35, 434, '2026-04-17', '2026-04-20', 'Good day,\nI woud like to inform you that I will be taking a leave today due to experiencing diarrhea. I am not feeling well and need to rest and recover.\n\nI apologize for any inconvenience  this may cause and I will make sure to resume my duties as soon as i am better.\n\nSincerly,\nDalwampo, Frenz Rainier', 0, 1, '2026-04-17 06:04:32', '2026-04-17 06:04:32'),
(286, 35, 392, '2026-04-17', '2026-04-20', 'The LSPU SPCC ojt students are being excused regarding to a congress webinar that will be conducted', 0, 1, '2026-04-17 06:15:50', '2026-04-17 06:15:50'),
(287, 35, 423, '2026-04-17', '2026-04-20', 'Request for Excusal - CCS Research Congress 2026\n\nSir:\n\nI hope this letter finds you well.\n\nWe respectfully request that the students be excused from their On-the-Job Training (OJT) or Internship duties on April 17, 2026 (Friday) to attend the CCS Research Congress 2026 via Zoom, where they will serve as audience members for their co-4th year students who will be presenting. The list of trainees/interns are as follows:\n\n1. RAFAEL, STEVEN FRANCIS A.\n\n2. SANTIAGO, ALVIN B\n\nREBONG, MIKA EMILISA C.\n\n4. YUZON, KING CRISTOPHER E\n\nThis academic activity aims to strengthen the students\' appreciation of research, improve their academic exposure, and support their learning development as members of the College of Computer Studies.\n\nIn this regard, we kindly ask for your consideration in allowing the concerned students to attend the said activity. Furthermore, we respectfully request that their rendered hours on this day be duly counted toward their required OJT/Internship hours, as this is a university-mandated academic activity. The students understand their responsibilities and will ensure that any remaining tasks or requirements will be properly completed and coordinated with their respective supervisors.\n\nYour support and understanding in this matter are highly appreciated. Thank you very much.', 0, 1, '2026-04-17 06:25:22', '2026-04-17 06:25:22'),
(288, 34, 428, '2026-04-20', '2026-04-21', 'To Settle and Process Hospital Bills and related medical finacial matters. For my tita  for her recent child birth.', 0, 1, '2026-04-19 07:22:17', '2026-04-19 07:22:17'),
(289, 35, 433, '2026-04-30', '2026-05-04', 'Our College Department will be having an event on April 30, 2026, and I have been invited to be a speaker at the said event organized by the Junior Philippine Computer Society BatstateU TNEU - Lipa Chapter, to share my insights about career paths and what to expect in our Major (Network Technology). I am asking if I can file a leave that day so I can grab the opportunity to create a meaningful experience for our sophomore students.', 0, 1, '2026-04-23 11:03:05', '2026-04-23 11:03:05'),
(290, 34, 431, '2026-04-24', '2026-04-27', 'Need to go to the University of Batangas to get our monitoring form signed by our capstone adviser.', 0, 1, '2026-04-24 02:59:12', '2026-04-24 02:59:12'),
(291, 34, 432, '2026-04-24', '2026-04-27', 'Experiencing diarrhea accompanied by severe menstrual cramps.', 0, 1, '2026-04-24 03:04:12', '2026-04-24 03:04:12'),
(292, 35, 423, '2026-04-24', '2026-04-27', 'Good morning,\n\nTo whom it may concern,\n\nPlease accept my apologies for the late notice regarding my absence today. I had initially hoped that some rest would improve my condition; however, I am not feeling well enough to attend. I am concerned that I may be at risk of losing consciousness while driving, and therefore, I believe it would be unsafe for me to travel.\n\nThank you for your understanding. I regret any inconvenience caused and appreciate your consideration.', 0, 1, '2026-04-24 04:19:01', '2026-04-24 04:19:01'),
(293, 40, 456, '2026-04-27', '2026-04-28', 'High Fever', 0, 1, '2026-04-27 10:54:53', '2026-04-27 10:54:53'),
(294, 34, 437, '2026-04-29', '2026-04-30', 'Good day Sir/Ma’am,\n\nI would like to inform you that I will be taking a half-day leave today due to my thesis defense. I will ensure that my pending tasks are managed accordingly.\n\nThank you for your understanding.\n\nBest regards,\nAgonia Jervie Moises R', 0, 1, '2026-04-28 19:30:15', '2026-04-28 19:30:15'),
(295, 34, 431, '2026-04-29', '2026-04-30', 'Capstone Defense (Half-day)', 0, 1, '2026-04-28 20:22:40', '2026-04-28 20:22:40'),
(296, 34, 432, '2026-04-30', '2026-05-01', 'Capstone defense', 0, 1, '2026-04-30 05:20:50', '2026-04-30 05:20:50'),
(297, 35, 434, '2026-05-04', '2026-05-05', 'Good day. I would like to formally request a leave today due to a fever. I am currently not feeling well today and need time to rest. Thankyou for your understanding.\n\nSincerly,\nDalwampo, Frenz Rainier', 0, 1, '2026-05-04 06:09:37', '2026-05-04 06:09:37'),
(298, 35, 433, '2026-05-05', '2026-05-06', 'Needed rest for my injuries', 0, 1, '2026-05-05 05:58:08', '2026-05-05 05:58:08'),
(299, 40, 456, '2026-05-08', '2026-05-11', 'fever caused by the injection.', 0, 1, '2026-05-08 05:47:42', '2026-05-08 05:47:42'),
(300, 35, 377, '2026-05-08', '2026-05-11', 'Good day po! I cannot attend the class po, need ko po kasi pumuntang school to pass requirements for graduation. Then, i need to go to PAG-IBIG to pass documents for my father\'s burial. Lastly, today is 30th day since my dad passed away, my mother needs me now. Thank you!', 0, 1, '2026-05-08 06:06:03', '2026-05-08 06:06:03'),
(301, 42, 460, '2026-06-03', '2026-06-04', 'We are required to go back to school for an event.', 0, 0, '2026-05-28 15:32:32', '2026-05-28 15:32:32');
