INSERT INTO `lcssv2_trainee_behavioral_evaluation` (`behavioral_evaluation_aid`, `behavioral_evaluation_is_active`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainee_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainer_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_ratings`, `behavioral_evaluation_remarks`, `behavioral_evaluation_date`, `behavioral_evaluation_created`, `behavioral_evaluation_datetime`) VALUES
(3, 1, 77, 1, 89.87, 'Mr. Bilog is really dedicated to his training and eager to learn more about website development. He\'s quite skilled in this area, but sometimes he needs a little bit of guidance to help him excel. With his determination, I\'m confident he\'ll achieve great success in the future.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 08:28:21', '2024-07-16 08:28:21'),
(4, 1, 79, 1, 85.67, 'Mr. Canoza is currently learning to take more accountability for his mistakes, and I\'m confident he\'ll keep improving in this as he gains experience. His openness to learning and adapting shows he\'s on track to develop a stronger sense of responsibility, which is key for his professional growth. When it comes to his skills, he performs well under supervision and shows great potential to handle tasks independently with further development. With continued guidance and opportunities, I believe Mr. Canoza will achieve significant progress in his career.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 08:47:33', '2024-07-16 08:47:33'),
(5, 1, 75, 1, 83.80, 'Mr. Juanillo demonstrates commendable focus during his training sessions, although occasionally his attention may be diverted due to the environment created by others. Nevertheless, he exhibits the capability to independently complete tasks under supervision, which is promising considering he is still in his first year of training. Given time and experience, I am confident that he will mature further and excel in all his endeavors, surfacing the way for a successful future ahead.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 09:16:24', '2024-07-16 09:16:24'),
(6, 1, 74, 1, 82.40, 'Mr. Roque shows promise in completing his tasks with guidance. Given more time and experience, I am confident that he will continue to develop significantly. Currently, he is in a phase of growth where he occasionally finds it challenging to discern when to be serious and when a more relaxed approach is appropriate. Nevertheless, as he gain more experience, I have no doubt that he will increasingly display focus and dedication in everything he does. This progression will certainly contribute to his future success.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 09:44:03', '2024-07-16 09:44:03'),
(7, 1, 69, 1, 90.33, 'Mr. Santiago is the type of trainee who demonstrates a remarkable ability to independently tackle tasks. In every tasks he undertakes, I observe his proactive approach and his willingness to experiment with syntax to achieve the desired output, which is highly commendable. I am optimistic that if he continues on this path, he will undoubtedly achieve success in the future. His proactive attitude and experimental nature are key attributes that will contribute significantly to his growth and accomplishments as he progresses in his career.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 10:09:31', '2024-07-16 10:09:31'),
(8, 1, 81, 1, 94.53, 'Mr. Vista\'s skills are really impressive! He consistently shows that he can handle tasks independently and efficiently. Whenever he\'s working on something, he\'s not afraid to try different approaches to get the best results, which really highlights his creativity and problem-solving abilities. What\'s even more inspiring is how he goes out of his way to help others, even while focusing on his own tasks. He\'s always there to support his colleagues who might be struggling, showing a true team spirit. With his enthusiasm and dedication to web development, I have no doubt that Mr. Vista will go far in his career. His proactive approach and supportive nature will definitely pave the way for his continued success and growth in the field.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 10:20:11', '2024-07-16 10:20:11'),
(9, 1, 80, 1, 93.60, 'Mr. Gamaro has been absolutely outstanding during the training sessions. It is evident that he possesses a strong ability to work independently and thrive under pressure. Throughout my observations, I have been impressed by his remarkable patience, particularly when resolving issues and debugging tasks. Moreover, he generously assists his fellow trainees whenever he notices they require support. I firmly believe that Mr. Gamaro will be a valuable asset to any future employer. His proactive approach to expanding his skills is evident through his eagerness to learn. Even after training hours conclude, he continues to practice at home, demonstrating a genuine commitment to personal and professional growth.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 12:35:19', '2024-07-16 12:35:19'),
(10, 1, 75, 7, 85.67, 'Mr. Juanillo is a diligent intern who pays close attention to the assignments that are assigned to him. He completes the task with little oversight and is dependable. If he can resist becoming sidetracked by other interns and split his attention occasionally, he will succeed in the future.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 12:42:23', '2024-07-16 12:42:23'),
(11, 1, 84, 1, 83.80, 'During the training, I have observed Mr. Navito diligently striving to grasp various concepts in Web Development. It\'s clear he\'s facing some initial challenges, but he\'s really putting in the effort to adapt, especially since he\'s still getting familiar with the latest fundamentals in the field. I think it would really help if he focuses on paying attention to details to make sure he achieves exactly what\'s needed. Encouraging him to try solving problems on his own before asking for help could also be beneficial. I\'m sure that as Mr. Navito gains more experience, his skills in Web Development will grow significantly. This knowledge will undoubtedly prove invaluable should he decide to pursue a career aligned with this domain in the future.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 13:01:12', '2024-07-16 13:01:12'),
(12, 1, 74, 7, 81.93, 'Patience, this is the word that describes Mr. Roque. He finishes his work at the set time with diligence. If he just continues to persevere, he will improve a lot one day.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 13:02:05', '2024-07-16 13:02:05'),
(13, 1, 69, 7, 85.20, 'I supervised with Mr. Santiago on design projects; he displays curiosity and approaches tasks diligently. He ensures timely completion of his assignments and excels as a team player, collaborating seamlessly with various interns.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 13:10:29', '2024-07-16 13:10:29'),
(14, 1, 81, 7, 94.53, 'Hardworking and creative, Mr. Vista stands out. He generously shares his knowledge with fellow interns, willingly offering help. With such a positive attitude, I believe Mr. Vista will achieve great success.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 13:28:14', '2024-07-16 13:28:14'),
(15, 1, 79, 7, 87.53, 'Mr. Canoza shows great potential as he learns from his mistakes and goes the extra mile to complete his tasks. He thrives in a focused environment without distractions. With continued skill development, his potential is limitless.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 13:56:13', '2024-07-16 13:56:13'),
(16, 1, 76, 7, 85.67, 'Mr. Alcos exhibits exceptional respect and collegiality towards his instructors and fellow interns. He possesses strong teamwork capabilities and excels in collaborative endeavors. His creativity and talent shine brightly, making him a valuable asset to any project or team.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 14:35:34', '2024-07-16 14:35:34'),
(17, 1, 76, 1, 89.87, 'Mr. Alcos demonstrates a high level of proficiency in his work during training. He consistently understands and follows the instructions for each activity. Despite his capabilities, he often mingles with others who do not share the same level of focus and dedication towards the training. This tendency can sometimes distract him from maximizing his potential and fully engaging with the training. However, I can confidently say that he has the potential to be successful in the future. As a first-year student, he has the opportunity to gain more knowledge and experience, which will benefit him in his future endeavors.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 14:37:49', '2024-07-16 14:37:49'),
(18, 1, 80, 7, 94.53, 'Mr. Gamaro is an exemplary intern who consistently delivers outstanding results, whether working independently or as part of a team. His relentless pursuit of excellence and continuous improvement sets him apart. Furthermore, his confidence in his abilities enables him to become a reliable source of support and knowledge for his peers.', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-16 14:42:23', '2024-07-16 14:42:23'),
