(43, 1, 76, 8, 88.93, 'Mr. Alcos exhibits exceptional respect and collegiality towards his instructors and fellow interns. He possesses strong teamwork capabilities and excels in collaborative endeavors. His creativity and talent shine brightly, making him a valuable asset to any project or team. ', '2024-07-22', '2024-07-19 10:10:54', '2024-07-26 13:18:55'),
(44, 1, 85, 8, 93.13, '', '2024-08-20', '2024-08-20 11:00:21', '2024-08-20 11:00:21'),
