(48, 1, 108, 8, 84.73, '', '2024-11-15', '2024-11-15 07:04:41', '2024-11-15 07:04:41'),
(49, 1, 107, 4, 89.40, 'Kurt\'s extroverted personality is one of his best assets. He is easy to work with, and a very thoughtful workmate. He is very trainable, and exerts extra effort in completing tasks. For his overall betterment, I highly recommend him to be consistent.', '2024-11-15', '2024-11-15 07:50:38', '2024-11-15 07:50:38'),
(50, 1, 106, 4, 86.60, 'Andrey\'s best asset is his ability to instantly get along with other people. It is evident that he exerts extra effort into his craft. For his overall betterment, I highly recommend him to find his best way of learning for much longer information retention. In addition to that, I also recommend him to challenge himself more.', '2024-11-15', '2024-11-15 07:54:20', '2024-11-15 07:54:20'),
(51, 1, 108, 4, 92.67, 'Zymon\'s best asset is his ability to learn quickly without close supervision. He really does stand out among his peers when it comes to task accuracy, and efficiency, For his overall improvement, I highly recommend him to socialize more.', '2024-11-15', '2024-11-15 07:59:22', '2024-11-15 07:59:22'),
(52, 1, 120, 1, 86.60, 'Mr. Babadilla is one of the trainees with a cheerful and positive attitude, which makes him a pleasure to work with. I truly admire his eagerness to learn and grow, as he consistently seeks guidance from the trainer to improve his skills. While there are times when he requests assistance without thoroughly checking for details, such as correcting minor errors like spelling or coding issues in HTML and CSS, his determination to improve and willingness to ask for help reflect his strong commitment to becoming more proficient.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-02 08:29:44', '2024-12-02 08:29:44'),
(53, 1, 140, 1, 85.20, 'Mr. Belen is a dedicated and promising trainee who consistently demonstrates potential in his work. However, I have observed that he frequently steps out of the training room, which might impact his ability to fully concentrate on his assigned tasks. Despite this, it is evident that he is putting in considerable effort to deliver the desired outcomes, and his determination to succeed is commendable.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 07:50:27', '2024-12-03 07:50:27'),
(54, 1, 138, 1, 84.73, 'Ms. Briones consistently putting in great effort to achieve her goals. While her passion and energy are evident, there are opportunities for her to approach situations with a calm and thoughtful demeanor, which could further enhance her effectiveness. Her commitment to her work is truly commendable, and with continued growth, she has the potential to excel even further.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 07:56:10', '2024-12-03 07:56:10'),
(55, 1, 118, 1, 87.53, 'Ms. Briones consistently demonstrates excellent attention to detail in her work. She proactively seeks assistance when needed, ensuring her tasks are completed efficiently and accurately. Moreover, she generously supports her fellow trainees by helping them resolve challenges related to their HTML and CSS coding.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 08:03:59', '2024-12-03 08:03:59'),
(56, 1, 146, 1, 88.47, 'I admire her strong personality, which has a consistently positive influence on her behavior. Her inner strength is evident in the courage she displays when seeking assistance, even though I have noticed that she rarely relies on others. This self-reliance is a testament to her confidence and competence. She has a remarkable ability to manage tasks independently and efficiently, requiring only minimal supervision to achieve excellent results. Her determination and proactive approach are qualities that truly set her apart and contribute to her overall effectiveness in any role she undertakes.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 08:40:54', '2024-12-03 08:40:54'),
(57, 1, 114, 1, 85.20, 'Mr. Castro is a highly skilled student in his batch, particularly in coding.  He demonstrates remarkable independence and rarely needs to seek assistance, showcasing his confidence and expertise in problem-solving.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 09:15:20', '2024-12-03 09:15:20'),
(58, 1, 122, 1, 84.73, 'I’ve observed that Mr. Celendro consistently seeks assistance, even for issues as small as a misspelled word. I believe with a bit more patience and attention to detail, he could enhance his skills even further, gaining more confidence in resolving such issues independently.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 09:35:12', '2024-12-03 09:35:12'),
(78, 1, 135, 1, 84.27, 'Mr. De Mesa consistently puts forth his best effort to complete his tasks, even when faced with challenges. Despite the evident difficulties he encounters, his determination and dedication are clear in his continued commitment to finishing the work.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 12:12:28', '2024-12-03 12:12:28'),
(79, 1, 148, 1, 84.27, 'Mr. Golmatico sometimes exhibits impatience in his work, as he tends to overlook exploring all possible solutions to a problem. However, I truly admire his determination and resilience in persevering to complete his tasks despite any challenges.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 12:18:15', '2024-12-03 12:18:15'),
(80, 1, 121, 1, 87.07, 'Mr. Javier has demonstrated a willingness to excel in his work. On the second day of their HTML-CSS coding session, it became evident that he is actively exploring creative solutions. I noticed his enthusiasm as he experimented with different approaches to achieve the desired output, showcasing his determination and innovative mindset. His proactive attitude is a positive indicator of his commitment to learning and improving.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 12:21:33', '2024-12-03 12:21:33'),
(81, 1, 116, 1, 84.27, 'Ms. Katindig is a passionate  individual who approaches tasks with heartfelt dedication. While she deeply values her work and sometimes views challenges with heightened sensitivity, this reflects her strong sense of responsibility and care. Her ability to persist and remain committed, even when faced with obstacles, highlights her resilience and unwavering drive to succeed.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 13:12:30', '2024-12-03 13:12:30'),
(82, 1, 125, 1, 86.13, 'Mr. Mongado demonstrates a strong passion for completing his tasks and actively seeks opportunities to collaborate with his co-trainees for support and learning.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:29:45', '2024-12-03 14:29:45'),
(83, 1, 132, 1, 85.20, 'Ms. Rivera is a thoughtful and reflective student who may not speak frequently, but she confidently seeks help whenever she needs it, demonstrating her willingness to grow and learn.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:33:28', '2024-12-03 14:33:28'),
(84, 1, 111, 1, 87.07, 'I admire how he consistently explores different approaches to achieve the desired outcomes. Additionally, he is always eager and willing to assist his fellow trainees, fostering a collaborative and supportive environment.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:36:22', '2024-12-03 14:36:22'),
(85, 1, 112, 1, 84.27, 'As I observe Mr. Rosaura, I notice that while he completes tasks independently, there are instances where he relies on his co-trainees\' work, possibly when he encounters difficulties. However, it’s clear that he is capable of accomplishing tasks on his own. I encourage him to consistently perform tasks independently, as this will help him strengthen his problem-solving skills, enhance his learning experience, and build greater confidence in addressing challenges on his own.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:42:12', '2024-12-03 14:42:12'),
(86, 1, 144, 1, 84.73, 'Mr. Salvador is an expressive and outspoken individual, which adds energy to the team dynamic. I’ve observed that he performs his tasks well and demonstrates a proactive attitude. He often seeks guidance and collaborates with his fellow trainees, showing his ability to build rapport, although he may benefit from engaging more directly with his trainer for additional insights and support.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:45:26', '2024-12-03 14:45:26'),
(88, 1, 127, 1, 84.73, 'I have noticed that Ms. Sapungan consistently strives to give her best effort in completing tasks. She takes initiative and works independently while also being resourceful in seeking guidance from the trainer when needed. Her awareness of when to ask for help reflects her commitment to growth and learning, ensuring she produces high-quality results.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:51:09', '2024-12-03 14:51:09'),
(91, 1, 134, 1, 86.13, 'Mr. Silva is one of the standout students who consistently completes his tasks quickly and efficiently. He is also always eager to support his fellow trainees, willingly sharing the valuable knowledge and insights he has gained throughout the training. His proactive attitude and teamwork make him a great asset to the group.', '2024-12-04', '2024-12-03 14:54:27', '2024-12-03 14:54:27'),
