(122, 1, 193, 1, 84.27, 'While observing Mr. Ante, I noticed that he tends to get distracted easily, particularly when he knows he will have to present his work. He often laughs when he looks at his co-trainees, which can make it difficult for him to stay focused. To help him improve, I suggested that he try to stay more focused during his presentations. I also recommended that he practice speaking in English regularly, as this will help him improve his public speaking skills. By practicing more and staying focused, he will also feel more confident when speaking in front of others. With time and effort, I believe he will become more comfortable and effective in his presentations.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-18 16:16:18', '2025-01-18 16:16:18'),
(125, 1, 218, 1, 79.60, 'As I was observing Mr. Cabasa, I noticed that he is always laughing, even in situations where it\'s necessary to be serious. This tendency to laugh in inappropriate moments seems to hinder his ability to fully focus on the task at hand, especially when it comes to verbal communication. His constant laughter can be distracting and sometimes makes it difficult for others to take him seriously, which can affect the overall productivity and effectiveness of the work being done. Additionally, his inability to switch to a more serious tone when required may sometimes lead to misunderstandings or a lack of professionalism in his interactions. With consistent practice, he will learn to balance his cheerful demeanor with the need for seriousness. Over time, he’ll develop the ability to adapt his tone to different situations, enhancing both his communication skills and ability to navigate various environments effectively.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 14:16:12', '2025-01-20 14:21:09'),
(126, 1, 177, 1, 83.80, 'I would like to commend Mr. Cabasa for his impressive ability to stay focused and dedicated, even when faced with numerous distractions while presenting his work. Despite these challenges, he consistently manages to handle the situation with professionalism and poise. He puts forth a great deal of effort in ensuring that he delivers the best possible output, and it is clear that he is committed to doing his job to the highest standard. Of course, like anyone, there is always room for improvement, and I am confident that Mr. Cabasa will continue to strive for excellence in his work. His determination and willingness to improve are truly commendable and deserve recognition.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 14:24:24', '2025-01-20 14:24:24'),
(127, 1, 183, 5, 86.60, 'Ms. Andamon demonstrates an average level of performance in her assigned tasks and adheres to the company\'s rules and regulations. While her work meets the basic expectations, there is potential for improvement in areas that could enhance her professional development and contribute to her overall growth. With focused effort and dedication, she can elevate her performance to exceed expectations.', '2025-01-20', '2025-01-20 14:25:24', '2025-01-20 14:25:24'),
(128, 1, 192, 1, 77.73, 'I noticed with Mr. Belda that there is an opportunity for him to do his tasks with a bit more seriousness. I also suggested being mindful of his choice of words, as well as considering a more composed tone during presentations in front of colleagues. I believe this will help create a more professional and impactful impression. ', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 14:26:39', '2025-01-20 14:26:39'),
(129, 1, 158, 5, 89.40, 'Ms. Aramil is willing to assist her co-trainees when needed, showing a collaborative spirit. While her work meets basic expectations, there is potential for improvement in areas that could enhance her professional development and contribute to her overall growth. With focused effort and dedication, she can elevate her performance to exceed expectations.', '2025-01-20', '2025-01-20 14:28:59', '2025-01-20 14:28:59'),
(130, 1, 217, 5, 87.53, 'Mr. Asagra has shown steady performance and a good understanding of his responsibilities. While he meets expectations, there is room to refine his skills and enhance his contributions. With consistent effort and a focus on development, he can achieve even greater success. Despite being absent in a day, he remains committed to completing his assigned tasks, showing responsibility and determination.', '2025-01-20', '2025-01-20 14:35:46', '2025-01-20 14:35:46'),
(131, 1, 219, 1, 85.20, 'Ms. Cabase is doing well overall, but there are times when she lacks the energy to complete her tasks. As a result, there are instances when her work remains unfinished. However, I can clearly see that she has the potential to perform well; it\'s just that at times, she struggles with motivation and energy. I am confident that, with time, she will come to realize the importance of finishing her work and staying motivated. Once she fully understands how crucial it is to remain focused and dedicated, I believe she will be able to consistently meet expectations and perform her job to the best of her ability.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 14:41:11', '2025-01-20 14:41:11'),
(132, 1, 175, 1, 93.13, 'As I was observing Mr. De Belen, I noticed that he consistently makes sure his work is accurate and up to standard. He takes the initiative to ask his trainer whether his work is correct, which demonstrates his commitment to quality and his willingness to improve. This proactive attitude is commendable. Additionally, I observed that he excels in both written and verbal tasks, showcasing his strong communication skills. If he continues to maintain this level of dedication and continues to build on these skills, I have no doubt that he will achieve great success in the future. His attention to detail and eagerness to learn are qualities that will undoubtedly help him reach his goals.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 14:48:23', '2025-01-20 14:48:23'),
(133, 1, 167, 5, 85.20, 'Mr. Mark Xyron Belen is in the process of developing his skills and has demonstrated a strong willingness to learn. He shows eagerness to complete tasks; however, there is room for improvement in time management to ensure timely submission of tasks. Additionally, greater attention to detail and thorough review of his work will help minimize errors. Overall, his efforts are commendable, and with focused improvement, he has the potential to excel in his role.', '2025-01-20', '2025-01-20 15:05:33', '2025-01-21 12:23:33'),
(134, 1, 176, 1, 90.33, 'Mr. Hernandez does his best to perform his job, but of course, there is always room for improvement. I sincerely hope that he continues to grow and develop through his experiences, as this will allow him to gain more confidence in his abilities. With time, effort, and dedication, I believe he will continue to enhance his skills and become even more proficient in his work.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 15:07:58', '2025-01-20 15:07:58'),
(135, 1, 173, 5, 89.87, 'Ms. Queen Andrea Belen has demonstrated excellent performance throughout her work immersion. She consistently completes tasks with minimal errors and ensures timely submission of her assignments, reflecting her strong work ethic and attention to detail. However, as she is in a professional environment, it is important to maintain focus and avoid engaging in non-work-related activities, such as playing games, during training hours. Moving forward, maintaining a high level of professionalism will further enhance her growth and development in the workplace.', '2025-01-20', '2025-01-20 15:09:56', '2025-01-20 15:09:56'),
(136, 1, 165, 1, 87.07, 'I have noticed that Ms. Lidan is more of a quiet and reserved individual, but despite her calm demeanor, it is evident that she puts a great deal of effort into her work. She consistently strives to do her best, and her dedication is reflected in the quality of her tasks. Additionally, when it comes to presenting her work, Ms. Lidan demonstrates a strong sense of confidence. She is able to clearly and effectively communicate her ideas, showing that, while she may be quiet, she possesses a high level of competence and professionalism in her role.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-20 15:12:52', '2025-01-20 15:12:52'),
(137, 1, 181, 5, 83.80, 'Mr. Carl Jharred Belen demonstrates excellence in adhering to company rules and regulations and consistently shows respect toward his co-trainees and trainers, which reflects his commendable character. However, he faces challenges in completing tasks on time and keeping pace with his co-trainees. This has resulted in him often falling behind in his work. Given the limited duration of the work immersion program, it is crucial for him to develop a faster work pace and improve his time management skills to complete his assigned tasks efficiently. \n\nWith determination and effort, he can overcome these challenges and make the most of this learning experience.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 10:29:30', '2025-01-21 10:29:30'),
(138, 1, 163, 5, 94.53, 'Ms. Caravana has consistently demonstrated exceptional performance and a strong commitment to her tasks. Her proactive approach and willingness to learn have been valuable to her learning experience. We encourage her to continue striving for excellence and taking on new challenges to further her growth.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 10:37:22', '2025-01-21 10:37:22'),
(139, 1, 168, 5, 89.40, 'Ms. Castillo has demonstrated excellent performance throughout her work immersion. She consistently completes tasks with minimal errors and ensures timely submission of her assignments, reflecting her strong work ethic and attention to detail. However, as she is in a professional environment, it is important to maintain focus, follow the company dress code, and avoid engaging in non-work-related activities, such as playing games, during training hours. Moving forward, maintaining a high level of professionalism will further enhance her growth and development in the workplace.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 10:41:27', '2025-01-21 10:41:27'),
(140, 1, 155, 5, 89.40, 'Ms. Cortez has demonstrated professionalism and a positive attitude during her work immersion, which is commendable. However, there is an opportunity for her to improve her enthusiasm and proactive engagement in completing tasks. Showing greater initiative and energy in her work will not only enhance her productivity but also contribute to a more dynamic and fulfilling experience.\n\nWe encourage Ms. Cortez to adopt a growth mindset and seek continuous improvement by embracing challenges and taking on new opportunities to develop her skills. With increased enthusiasm and effort, she has the potential to excel further in her role.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:11:08', '2025-01-21 12:11:08'),
(141, 1, 153, 5, 88.93, 'Ms. Chincky Dionglay maintains a quiet demeanor during her training but demonstrates a commendable adherence to company rules and regulations. She performs her tasks with average proficiency, meeting basic expectations. However, there is room for her to build confidence in her abilities and take a more proactive approach to her work.\n\nWe encourage Ms. Dionglay to actively engage with her trainers and peers, as this will not only enhance her confidence but also provide opportunities for further learning and growth. By stepping out of her comfort zone and embracing challenges, she can unlock her full potential and achieve greater success in her training.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:18:42', '2025-01-21 12:18:42'),
(142, 1, 154, 5, 87.07, 'Ms. Patricia Dionglay has shown herself to be a good trainee overall, demonstrating the ability to adapt to a professional environment. However, to further excel in her role, she should focus on minimizing distractions, such as unnecessary conversations or activities unrelated to her tasks, during training hours. Additionally, enhancing her eagerness and commitment to completing her tasks efficiently will contribute to her overall growth and productivity.\n\nWe encourage Ms. Dionglay to prioritize her responsibilities and adopt a more focused approach to her work. By channeling her energy into task completion and maintaining a professional mindset, she can make significant strides in her development and achieve greater success.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:27:42', '2025-01-21 12:27:42'),
(143, 1, 203, 5, 87.53, 'Ms. Joreen has proven to be a good trainee overall, displaying the potential to succeed in a professional environment. However, to further enhance her performance, she should focus on minimizing distractions, such as unnecessary conversations or activities unrelated to her tasks, and prioritize completing her responsibilities with greater enthusiasm and efficiency.\n\nAdditionally, it is important for her to set aside personal issues during training hours to maintain a professional demeanor and ensure her full attention is directed toward her tasks. We encourage Ms. Joreen to adopt a more focused and proactive approach, as this will significantly contribute to her growth and success in the workplace.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:31:24', '2025-01-21 12:31:24'),
(144, 1, 157, 5, 89.87, 'Mr. Arjon has proven to be an excellent trainee, consistently demonstrating eagerness to learn and the ability to complete tasks with minimal supervision. His work is thorough, and he submits tasks that are nearly complete and with minimal errors, reflecting his attention to detail and commitment to quality.\n\nWe commend Mr. Arjon for his dedication and encourage him to continue refining his skills to achieve even greater levels of excellence. With his proactive attitude and strong work ethic, he is well-positioned for success in any professional environment.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:35:16', '2025-01-21 12:35:16'),
(145, 1, 156, 5, 87.53, 'Ms. Kc maintains a quiet demeanor during her training but demonstrates a commendable adherence to company rules and regulations. She performs her tasks with average proficiency, meeting basic expectations. However, there is room for her to build confidence in her abilities and take a more proactive approach to her work.\n\nWe encourage Ms. Kc to actively engage with her trainers and peers, as this will not only enhance her confidence but also provide opportunities for further learning and growth. By stepping out of her comfort zone and embracing challenges, she can unlock her full potential and achieve greater success in her training.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:49:22', '2025-01-21 12:49:22'),
(146, 1, 172, 5, 88.93, 'Ms. Mariel has shown steady performance and a good understanding of his responsibilities. While she meets expectations, there is room to refine her skills and enhance her contributions. With consistent effort and a focus on development, she can achieve even greater success.\n\nWe encourage Ms. Mariel to adopt a growth mindset and seek continuous improvement by embracing challenges and taking on new opportunities to develop her skills. With increased enthusiasm and effort, she has the potential to excel further in her role.', '2025-01-21', '2025-01-21 12:52:42', '2025-01-21 12:52:42'),
(147, 1, 200, 1, 87.07, 'Ms. Martinez is a trainee who tends to be shy, often hesitating to ask the trainer questions directly. However, I am hopeful that, with time, she will gain the confidence to ask questions and express herself, even when interacting with people she may not feel entirely comfortable with. Despite her shyness, she is performing well in the tasks assigned to her and shows promise in her work. For further improvement, she should focus on projecting her voice more clearly and confidently to ensure her audience can fully understand and engage with what she is saying.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 13:55:21', '2025-01-22 14:57:49'),
(148, 1, 164, 1, 84.73, 'Ms. Oafallas is the type of trainee who often feels nervous when speaking in front of others. However, I believe that with consistent practice and more opportunities to speak in front of people, her communication skills will gradually improve and she will gain more confidence in expressing herself.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 14:03:36', '2025-01-22 15:02:44'),
(149, 1, 182, 1, 84.73, 'Ms. Pandiño is the type of trainee who often says she can\'t do it, but I firmly believe she can because I have witnessed her remarkable progress from day one all the way through to the completion of her training.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 15:33:54', '2025-01-22 15:33:54'),
(150, 1, 179, 1, 86.13, 'Ms. Plata tends to be quite talkative; however, she demonstrates the ability to complete her tasks effectively. I recommend that she develop a stronger sense of when to adopt a more focused and professional demeanor to balance productivity with collaboration.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 15:37:27', '2025-01-22 15:37:27'),
(151, 1, 197, 1, 83.80, 'I can see that Ms. Santillan is putting in significant effort, which is commendable. However, I would suggest that she consider not relying entirely on memorization for her presentations. In my opinion, adopting an ad-lib approach allows for a more natural and engaging delivery. While this may take some practice, I am confident that, with time and experience, she will continue to improve and enhance her presentation skills.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 15:42:11', '2025-01-22 15:42:11'),
(152, 1, 185, 1, 87.07, 'Ms. Sentillas demonstrates strong communication skills, though there is room for improvement. With consistent practice and dedication, she has the potential to enhance these abilities further, which will undoubtedly benefit her in the future.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 15:45:11', '2025-01-22 15:45:11'),
(153, 1, 199, 1, 87.07, 'I would like to bring to Mr. Villaverde\'s attention that while he is capable of effectively completing his assigned tasks, it would be beneficial if he refrained from making jokes towards his co-trainees. Such behavior can sometimes distract from the collaborative environment we aim to foster. On a positive note, I have observed that he excels in logical tasks and demonstrates a willingness to assist his co-trainees once he has completed his own work. This proactive and supportive attitude contributes positively to the team\'s overall performance.', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-22 15:49:37', '2025-01-22 15:49:37'),
(154, 1, 215, 4, 88.00, 'I highly encourage to exert more effort in practicing to achieve better improvements. \n\nCongratulations, and good luck on your future endeavors!', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-24 08:40:36', '2025-01-24 08:40:36'),
