(177, 1, 160, 4, 95.00, 'Ms Yamaura demonstrated great interest, and potential in Web Development. She has initiative, and resourcefulness. And most importantly, she is highly trainable, and keen to details which are very rare skills, and she would be a great asset in any company that would hire her in the future.\n\nCongratulations, and good luck on your future endeavors! ', '2025-01-24', '2025-01-24 09:13:09', '2025-01-24 09:13:09'),
(178, 1, 260, 1, 82.87, 'I have noticed that Mr. Alcantara seems to lack confidence when it comes to both written and oral communication. Despite this, I can see that he is making a genuine effort to carry out his responsibilities during the training, demonstrating his commitment to doing his best and improving over time.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 14:52:45', '2025-02-01 14:52:45'),
(180, 1, 256, 1, 81.93, 'Mr. Belen is one of the trainees who struggles to speak fluently in English, but I can see that he is putting in a lot of effort to improve. Despite his best efforts, there are times when he asks his trainer to give him a lower rating because he feels he hasn’t been able to fulfill his responsibilities, such as presenting his work. However, I would suggest that he continue to practice speaking in English, as over time, he will likely overcome his weaknesses. With more experience, he will build confidence and improve his public speaking skills. ', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:00:16', '2025-02-01 15:00:16'),
(181, 1, 208, 1, 93.60, 'Ms. Bondad is an excellent trainee who consistently puts in her best effort to fulfill her responsibilities. She takes her tasks seriously and works hard to meet expectations. Additionally, I’ve noticed that she often goes above and beyond by offering help and support to her fellow co-trainees, showing her willingness to contribute to the success of the entire group.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:03:50', '2025-02-01 15:03:50'),
(182, 1, 245, 1, 85.67, 'I’ve noticed that Mr. Dela Peña tends to be a bit quieter compared to his co-trainees, but what stands out to me is his willingness to learn. Although he may not speak up as often, he shows a great deal of focus and dedication in his work, always striving to improve and absorb new information.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:07:20', '2025-02-01 15:08:14'),
(183, 1, 244, 1, 84.27, 'I suggested to Mr. Flores that he should learn to recognize when it’s appropriate to be serious and when it’s time for lighthearted moments or joking. In addition to that, I hope he can also focus on improving his oral communication skills and his posture when speaking in front of others. These improvements will help him present himself more confidently and professionally in various situations.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:11:38', '2025-02-01 15:11:38'),
(184, 1, 229, 1, 93.60, 'Ms. Gesmundo is the type of trainee who has a joyful and positive attitude. She often engages in one-on-one conversations with her trainer, which shows her eagerness to communicate and learn. What I appreciate most about her, however, is her consistent effort to improve her public speaking skills. She takes initiative to practice and seek feedback, demonstrating her commitment to personal growth and development.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:15:56', '2025-02-01 15:15:56'),
(185, 1, 206, 1, 84.27, 'Mr. Helera would benefit from more practice when it comes to public speaking. Like some of his co-trainees, he seems to be okay with receiving lower ratings, often because he is hesitant to try presenting his work or speaking in front of others in English. However, with more confidence and consistent practice, I believe he can improve his speaking skills and become more comfortable in these situations.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:20:49', '2025-02-01 15:20:49');
INSERT INTO `lcssv2_trainee_behavioral_evaluation` (`behavioral_evaluation_aid`, `behavioral_evaluation_is_active`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainee_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainer_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_ratings`, `behavioral_evaluation_remarks`, `behavioral_evaluation_date`, `behavioral_evaluation_created`, `behavioral_evaluation_datetime`) VALUES
(186, 1, 258, 1, 84.73, 'Mr. Lina is a trainee who consistently tries his best to fulfill his responsibilities. While he occasionally jokes around with his co-trainees, which adds a lighthearted atmosphere, I hope he continues to focus on improving his written and oral communication skills. With further effort in these areas, I believe he will enhance his overall performance and confidence in both professional and personal interactions.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:27:08', '2025-02-01 15:27:08'),
(187, 1, 205, 1, 87.07, 'I’ve noticed that Mr. Loyola excels in both written and oral communication in English, which is an impressive skill. However, I hope that in the future, he will mature further, as he sometimes prioritizes playing games over practicing for important presentations in front of others. I believe that if he becomes more serious and focused, his skills will undoubtedly improve, and he will be able to reach his full potential.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:31:18', '2025-02-01 15:31:18'),
(188, 1, 246, 1, 82.87, 'Mr. Lumagbas is one of the trainees who finds both written and oral communication challenging. However, I truly hope he continues to practice and push through these difficulties, as consistent effort will help him improve and overcome these challenges. With time and dedication, I’m confident that he will develop greater confidence and proficiency in both areas.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:34:12', '2025-02-01 15:34:12'),
(189, 1, 194, 1, 94.53, 'I’ve seen Mr. Martinez’s hard work in every task he tackles. I’ve even observed him doing extra research to ensure that his work is both high-quality and appropriate. He is certainly skilled in both written and oral communication, but I sense that he is still a bit hesitant to fully express himself. This may be because he’s still adjusting to the environment, but I believe with time, he will become more confident in showcasing his true abilities.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:38:23', '2025-02-01 15:38:23'),
(190, 1, 204, 1, 89.87, 'Ms. Navarez is a very quiet person, but what stands out to me is her willingness to learn. Despite her reserved nature, I have observed her giving her best in every task she takes on. She approaches her responsibilities with dedication and a desire to improve, which shows her commitment to personal and professional growth.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 15:41:34', '2025-02-01 15:41:34'),
(191, 1, 259, 1, 90.33, 'Ms. Plandez seems to get along better with the boys than with the girls, but I can see that she consistently tries her best to complete all the tasks assigned to her. She demonstrates a strong work ethic and dedication, always putting in the effort to meet expectations.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 16:35:02', '2025-02-01 16:35:02'),
(192, 1, 207, 1, 86.13, 'Mr. Puti is open to being corrected and consistently seeks feedback to ensure his work is both good and appropriate. He often asks if his grammar is correct, which shows his commitment to improving. I admire his willingness to learn, and I’m confident that with continued effort, he will make significant progress in the near future.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 17:00:38', '2025-02-01 17:00:38'),
(194, 1, 249, 1, 87.07, 'I appreciate Mr. Puti for taking the initiative to present his work and for his openness to receiving constructive feedback. His willingness to be corrected shows a genuine desire to improve, and it’s clear that he values growth and learning. This attitude will surely help him continue to develop and refine his skills moving forward. ', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 17:10:55', '2025-02-01 17:10:55'),
(195, 1, 250, 1, 88.00, 'Ms. Ramos always does her best to complete her tasks efficiently. I’ve noticed that she takes the time to search for English words she finds difficult to understand, ensuring that she fully grasps their meanings. This dedication to improving her language skills shows her commitment to doing quality work and her determination to overcome any challenges she faces.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 17:17:52', '2025-02-01 17:17:52'),
(196, 1, 255, 1, 89.87, 'I admire Ms. Reyes for her confident and somewhat boyish attitude. When it comes to her tasks, she consistently gives her best effort to complete them to the best of her ability. She also actively seeks feedback to ensure that she’s on the right track, showing her commitment to improving and her openness to constructive criticism. This proactive attitude will undoubtedly help her continue to grow and succeed in her work.', '2025-02-01', '2025-02-01 17:21:06', '2025-02-01 17:21:06'),
(197, 1, 221, 5, 90.80, 'Mr. Almonte has proven to be a good trainee, quickly learning the job and finding efficient ways to streamline his tasks for improved productivity. His ability to adapt and optimize his work process is commendable. However, he should focus on improving his time management skills to ensure punctuality and maintain a professional work ethic.\n\nOverall, he is a great trainee with strong potential for growth. Congratulations on your achievements, and we encourage you to continue developing your skills for future success!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-02 16:27:13', '2025-02-02 16:27:13'),
(198, 1, 227, 5, 87.53, 'Ms. Aporongao has been a good trainee, consistently adhering to company rules and regulations and ensuring timely submission of her tasks. Her discipline and commitment to meeting deadlines are commendable. However, she should focus on developing independence in completing her tasks without relying too much on her co-trainees, especially when individual work is required.\n\nOverall, she has performed well, and with continued effort, she can further enhance her skills and confidence. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-02 16:32:22', '2025-02-02 16:32:22'),
(199, 1, 228, 5, 88.93, 'Mr. Balaaldia has proven to be a good trainee, consistently ensuring that his work meets objectives and expectations. He conducts himself professionally throughout the work immersion, demonstrating a strong understanding of workplace standards.\n\nHowever, he should remain focused and avoid distractions from others during training, as this can lead to delays in his work. Additionally, improving his prioritization skills is essential, especially while managing part-time jobs alongside his responsibilities.\n\nOverall, he has great potential, and with better time management and focus, he can achieve even greater success. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-02 16:38:53', '2025-02-02 16:38:53'),
(200, 1, 238, 5, 84.73, 'Ms. Baldovino has great potential and consistently ensures that her work meets objectives and expectations. Her dedication to completing tasks is commendable.\n\nHowever, she should work on maintaining focus to prevent unnecessary delays during training. Additionally, observing professionalism in the workplace, including minimizing excessive conversations with fellow trainees, will help her develop a stronger work ethic.\n\nOverall, her performance is good, and with improved focus and professionalism, she can further excel in her role. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-02 16:44:08', '2025-02-02 16:44:08'),
(201, 1, 232, 5, 83.80, 'Ms. Belda performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, demonstrating her ability to complete assigned tasks effectively.\n\nHowever, she should focus on consistently maintaining professionalism in the workplace. It is important to always remember that she is in a professional environment and should conduct herself accordingly.\n\nWith a stronger commitment to workplace etiquette, she can further enhance her growth and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 00:45:13', '2025-02-05 00:45:13'),
(202, 1, 210, 5, 87.07, 'Mr. Benitez performs his job in a manner that meets expectations and demonstrates eagerness to learn new tasks, which is commendable.\n\nHowever, he should take the initiative to explore and attempt his tasks independently before seeking guidance from his trainer. Developing problem-solving skills and self-reliance will help him build confidence and efficiency in his work.\n\nOverall, he is a good trainee with great potential. With continued effort and independence, he can further enhance his skills and performance. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 00:50:17', '2025-02-05 00:50:17'),
(203, 1, 239, 5, 88.47, 'Ms. Bercasio is a good trainee who performs well during training and shows great potential. Her dedication to learning and improving is commendable.\n\nHowever, she should focus on better task management and maintaining a positive mindset. Challenges may arise, but she must remember that difficulties should never lead to self-doubt. With the right approach and determination, she can overcome any obstacle and excel further.\n\nOverall, she has shown strong potential, and with continued perseverance, she can achieve even greater success. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 00:56:49', '2025-02-05 00:56:49'),
(204, 1, 222, 5, 87.07, 'Ms. Bundalian performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, consistently completing her tasks effectively. She maintains a quiet demeanor during training, which reflects her focused and observant nature.\n\nOverall, she is a great trainee with the potential to further develop her skills and confidence. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:06:16', '2025-02-05 01:06:16'),
(205, 1, 212, 5, 88.00, 'Ms. Deomano performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, consistently completing her tasks effectively. She maintains a quiet demeanor during training, which reflects her focused and observant nature.\n\nOverall, she is a great trainee with the potential to further develop her skills and confidence. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:08:16', '2025-02-05 01:08:16'),
(206, 1, 224, 5, 88.00, 'Ms. Dimailig is a trainee who meets expectations in her performance. She completes her tasks adequately and has the potential for further growth.\n\nHowever, she should always be mindful that she is in a professional working environment and consistently demonstrate professionalism in her actions and conduct.\n\nOverall, she is a good trainee, and with continued focus on workplace etiquette, she can further enhance her skills and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:12:05', '2025-02-05 01:12:05'),
(207, 1, 234, 5, 79.60, 'Mr. Dimasapit is a trainee who still needs further development in handling work-related tasks independently. He tends to rely on others and must improve his professionalism in the workplace.\n\nTo grow in a professional setting, he should work on developing a stronger eagerness to learn, take initiative in completing tasks, and always be mindful of maintaining a professional attitude.\n\nNonetheless, completing this work immersion is a step toward improvement. With dedication and effort, he can enhance his skills and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:17:18', '2025-02-05 01:17:18'),
(208, 1, 248, 5, 87.07, 'Ms. Din is a trainee who meets expectations in her performance. She completes her tasks adequately and has the potential for further growth.\n\nHowever, she should always be mindful that she is in a professional working environment and consistently demonstrate professionalism in her actions and conduct.\n\nOverall, she is a good trainee, and with continued focus on workplace etiquette, she can further enhance her skills and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:20:38', '2025-02-05 01:20:38'),
(209, 1, 240, 5, 94.07, 'Ms. Eseo is an outstanding trainee who consistently demonstrates great potential and a strong commitment to her work. She is detail-oriented, eager to learn, and performs beyond expectations.\n\nHer willingness to assist her co-trainees reflects her teamwork and leadership qualities, making her a valuable member of the team.\n\nOverall, she has excelled in her role, and with her dedication and enthusiasm, she is well-prepared for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:25:02', '2025-02-05 01:25:02'),
(210, 1, 233, 5, 88.00, 'Ms. Gesmundo performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, consistently completing her tasks effectively. She maintains a quiet demeanor during training, which reflects her focused and observant nature.\n\nOverall, she is a great trainee with the potential to further develop her skills and confidence. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:27:55', '2025-02-05 01:27:55'),
(211, 1, 242, 5, 86.60, 'Mr. Gutierrez is a trainee who meets expectations and shows a commendable eagerness to learn. His dedication to understanding the tasks is evident.\n\nHowever, he should work on developing more independence in completing his tasks without relying on others. This will help him gain confidence and improve his efficiency.\n\nOverall, he is a good trainee with great potential. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:32:31', '2025-02-05 01:32:31'),
(212, 1, 223, 5, 84.27, 'Ms. Kawahara performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, demonstrating her ability to complete assigned tasks effectively.\n\nHowever, she should focus on consistently maintaining professionalism in the workplace. It is important to always remember that she is in a professional environment and should conduct herself accordingly.\n\nWith a stronger commitment to workplace etiquette, she can further enhance her growth and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:35:26', '2025-02-05 01:35:26'),
(213, 1, 236, 5, 92.20, 'Mr. Mazo is a great trainee with the ability to learn the job quickly and strong potential for growth. He consistently performs well in his tasks and demonstrates a good understanding of his responsibilities.\n\nHowever, he should be more mindful of maintaining professionalism in the workplace, including being cautious with his words and minimizing unnecessary conversations. This will help him further establish a professional demeanor.\n\nOverall, he is doing well in his role. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-05 01:39:53', '2025-02-05 01:39:53'),
(214, 1, 231, 5, 85.67, 'Ms. Natad is a good trainee who follows company rules and regulations, demonstrating discipline and professionalism in the workplace.\n\nHowever, she should focus on improving her task execution by paying closer attention to detail and reviewing her work to minimize errors. Strengthening this skill will help enhance the quality of her performance.\n\nOverall, she has the potential to grow and improve. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:01:04', '2025-02-06 02:01:04'),
(215, 1, 226, 5, 87.07, 'Ms. Navarez is a good trainee who follows company rules and regulations, demonstrating discipline and professionalism in the workplace. She maintains a quiet demeanor while working, showing focus and attentiveness.\n\nHowever, she should work on developing more independence in completing her tasks to build confidence and efficiency. Strengthening this skill will help her grow professionally.\n\nOverall, she has shown good performance. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:09:28', '2025-02-06 02:09:28'),
(216, 1, 252, 5, 77.27, 'Mr. Puod is a trainee who still needs further development in handling work-related tasks independently. He tends to rely on others and must improve his professionalism in the workplace.\n\nTo grow in a professional setting, he should work on developing a stronger eagerness to learn, take initiative in completing tasks, and always be mindful of maintaining a professional attitude.\n\nNonetheless, completing this work immersion is a step toward improvement. With dedication and effort, he can enhance his skills and readiness for future opportunities. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:12:39', '2025-02-06 02:12:39'),
(217, 1, 230, 5, 87.53, 'Mr. Quinto is a good trainee who consistently follows company rules and regulations. He maintains a quiet and focused demeanor at work and is always willing to assist his co-trainees, demonstrating strong teamwork and reliability.\n\nHowever, he should develop the habit of carefully reviewing his work to minimize errors and ensure accuracy in his tasks. Attention to detail will further enhance his performance and efficiency.\n\nOverall, he has shown great potential. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:29:06', '2025-02-06 02:29:06'),
(218, 1, 220, 5, 88.47, 'Ms. Ramos is a good trainee who consistently follows company rules and regulations. She maintains a quiet and focused demeanor at work and is always willing to assist her co-trainees, demonstrating strong teamwork and reliability.\n\nHowever, she should develop the habit of carefully reviewing her work to minimize errors and ensure accuracy in her tasks. Attention to detail will further enhance her performance and efficiency.\n\nOverall, she has shown great potential. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:33:00', '2025-02-06 02:33:00'),
(219, 1, 243, 5, 87.07, 'Mr. Rendon is a good trainee who consistently follows company rules and regulations. He maintains a quiet and focused demeanor at work and is always willing to assist his co-trainees, demonstrating strong teamwork and reliability.\n\nHowever, he should develop the habit of carefully reviewing his work to minimize errors and ensure accuracy in his tasks. Attention to detail will further enhance his performance and efficiency.\n\nOverall, he has shown great potential. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:36:03', '2025-02-06 02:36:03'),
(220, 1, 213, 5, 86.60, 'Ms. Roldan performs her job in a manner that meets expectations, consistently completing her tasks effectively. She maintains a quiet demeanor during training, which reflects her focused and observant nature.\n\nOverall, she is a great trainee with the potential to further develop her skills and confidence. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:40:35', '2025-02-06 02:40:35'),
(221, 1, 211, 5, 85.20, 'Ms. Siat is a good trainee who follows company rules and regulations, demonstrating discipline and professionalism in the workplace. She maintains a quiet demeanor while working, showing focus and attentiveness.\n\nHowever, she should work on developing more independence in completing her tasks to build confidence and efficiency. Strengthening this skill will help her grow professionally.\n\nOverall, she has shown good performance. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:44:04', '2025-02-06 02:44:04'),
(222, 1, 237, 5, 87.53, 'Mr. Tolentino is a good trainee who performs his job in a way that meets expectations. He is also a quick learner, adapting well to new tasks and responsibilities.\n\nHowever, he should work on maintaining better focus to further improve the quality of his work. Avoiding distractions will help him enhance his productivity and efficiency.\n\nOverall, he has shown great potential. Congratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:50:48', '2025-02-06 02:50:48'),
(223, 1, 241, 5, 82.87, 'Ms. Yao is a trainee who would benefit from improving her professionalism in the workplace. Demonstrating a professional attitude is essential for growth and success in any work environment.\n\nWe encourage her to focus on workplace etiquette, accountability, and maintaining a responsible approach to her tasks. With dedication and effort, she has the potential to develop and succeed.\n\nCongratulations!', '2025-02-07', '2025-02-06 02:55:18', '2025-02-06 02:55:18'),
(224, 1, 262, 12, 84.73, 'Prince shows a good perseverance during his training. Even he is having a hard time in coding, he manage to finish the task', '2025-02-06', '2025-02-06 08:37:12', '2025-02-06 08:37:12'),
(225, 1, 257, 12, 89.87, 'Ton is a good team player. He find a way to make the team enjoy the day. This is very helpful to make the team enjoy the work.', '2025-02-06', '2025-02-06 08:44:08', '2025-02-06 08:44:08'),
(226, 1, 254, 12, 94.07, 'Princess performs a good job. She shows interest doing the task and it makes her understand the job very well. She is doing a great job.', '2025-02-06', '2025-02-06 08:51:16', '2025-02-06 08:51:16'),
(227, 1, 301, 1, 85.67, '', '2025-03-05', '2025-03-05 08:40:37', '2025-03-05 08:40:37'),
(228, 1, 309, 1, 86.13, 'I noticed that Mr. Apostadero is always willing to help his co-trainees in any way he can. However, I have observed that he sometimes struggles, particularly with the CSS part of web development. Despite this, I can see that he is putting in a lot of effort and doing his best to learn. If he continues to practice and dedicate himself to improving his skills, I believe he will eventually overcome the challenges he faces when developing a website.', '2025-03-05', '2025-03-05 18:51:08', '2025-03-05 18:51:08'),
(229, 1, 304, 1, 85.20, 'Ms. Arazo is struggling with the structure of HTML. I suggest that she puts in extra effort to visualize the layout and plan how she will apply CSS. This will help her understand the structure of each section in advance, making it easier for her to organize the given layout effectively. By doing so, she can create a well-structured and visually appealing design with better efficiency.', '2025-03-05', '2025-03-05 18:59:22', '2025-03-05 18:59:22'),
(230, 1, 338, 1, 87.07, 'Mr. Bagsic is one of the trainees who can quickly absorb what I teach. He is very curious about his work and eager to learn. I also noticed that he willingly assists his fellow trainees, showing a helpful attitude. However, as a beginner, he sometimes struggles with figuring out the structure of the layout. Despite this, I have observed that he is a relatively fast learner and shows great potential for improvement.', '2025-03-05', '2025-03-05 19:26:19', '2025-03-05 19:26:19'),
(231, 1, 350, 1, 83.33, 'Mr. Cleofe is having a hard time learning HTML and CSS. He struggles to remember even small details about them. However, I understand that he may still be adjusting to this work environment, which could be affecting his ability to grasp the concepts quickly. With time and practice, he might become more comfortable and improve his skills.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 04:54:56', '2025-03-06 04:54:56'),
(232, 1, 307, 1, 81.93, 'Ms. Deriquito sometimes finds it challenging to complete tasks independently. Even for small errors, she tends to seek assistance from the trainer rather than first trying to identify and correct the mistake on her own. It would be beneficial for her to apply what she has learned during her work immersion to build confidence in her skills. Occasionally, she asks for help with simple spelling mistakes instead of attempting to find and correct them herself. With a little more effort and practice, she can improve her ability to handle tasks independently.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 05:00:46', '2025-03-06 05:00:46'),
(233, 1, 314, 1, 86.60, 'Mr. Dizon is very meticulous with his work because if he knows that his work is not correct, he immediately starts from the very beginning without hesitation. While his dedication to accuracy is commendable, I suggest that he practice more patience when working or developing a website. This will help him stay focused and improve his efficiency. However, I can see that he is capable of completing tasks successfully with proper supervision.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 06:04:12', '2025-03-06 06:04:12'),
(234, 1, 311, 1, 85.20, 'Mr. Endrenal is extremely energetic, to the point that whenever his co-trainees make a mistake, he immediately approaches them to observe and analyze the errors. However, despite his enthusiasm, he performs fairly well and occasionally assists his co-trainees when needed.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 06:29:37', '2025-03-06 06:29:37'),
(235, 1, 308, 1, 85.67, 'I noticed that Ms. Gorospe takes notes every time I have a discussion, which is a good habit since she can use them for future reference. However, I observed that she sometimes struggles to process all the information at once. Despite this challenge, she is able to complete tasks effectively with proper supervision. With continued guidance and practice, I believe she will improve in handling and retaining information more efficiently.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 06:34:33', '2025-03-06 06:34:33'),
(236, 1, 296, 1, 85.67, 'Ms. Indico is able to complete tasks independently with minimal supervision. However, I have noticed that she tends to be shy when it comes to asking questions to the trainer. Despite this, I can see that she is gradually learning how to develop a website and improving her skills over time.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 06:37:23', '2025-03-06 06:37:23'),
(237, 1, 341, 1, 86.13, 'Mr. Ladlad is very curious about web development, even though he has been quite vocal about not wanting to pursue this field. However, I can see that he is putting in his best effort to complete the tasks assigned to him. Despite his enthusiasm, he tends to forget small but important details that are essential for web development. With more practice and focus, I believe he can improve significantly.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 06:45:14', '2025-03-06 06:45:14'),
(238, 1, 336, 1, 82.40, 'Mr. Malaiba is putting in his best effort, but he is finding it challenging to grasp the information. It’s possible that this field may not align with his interests or strengths.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 07:02:24', '2025-03-06 07:02:24'),
(239, 1, 342, 1, 81.00, 'Mr. Manalo is having a hard time processing all the information given to him, and he struggles to apply it effectively. He also suffers from short-term memory loss, which makes it even more challenging for him to retain important details. For instance, he often forgets his own password, further highlighting his difficulty in remembering essential information.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 08:20:51', '2025-03-06 08:20:51'),
(240, 1, 316, 1, 85.67, 'Mr. Marasigan is able to complete tasks with minimal supervision; however, he tends to be somewhat hesitant when it comes to seeking assistance. Encouraging him to ask for help when needed could further improve his efficiency and confidence in his work.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 08:24:06', '2025-03-06 08:24:06'),
(241, 1, 337, 1, 81.47, 'Mr. Pujeda is having a hard time because he has also forgotten his own password. However, I can see that he is trying his best, even though he finds it challenging to process and apply the information. He is making an effort to overcome the difficulty, but it remains a struggle for him.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 08:27:10', '2025-03-06 08:27:10'),
(242, 1, 339, 4, 90.33, 'Ms Aniciete is highly trainable, and demonstrates great interest in her work. She lowkey performs well without the need of close supervision. Her best asset is that she is very resourceful where she does not limit herself on what is being taught, but she also has the initiative to research new source of information to help her do her tasks.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 14:51:07', '2025-03-06 14:51:07'),
(243, 1, 344, 4, 89.40, 'Mr Balcita shows that he can follow instructions as needed. I highly suggest him to be confident in himself so that he can do more. than what is being taught. Be resourceful, and have great attention to details.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 14:53:19', '2025-03-06 14:53:19'),
(244, 1, 335, 4, 89.40, 'Mr Bautista is one of the quiet ones where he lets his work do the talking. Though he may still need improvement when it comes to confidently do his work, and analyze things on his own.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 14:54:40', '2025-03-06 14:54:40'),
(245, 1, 297, 4, 94.07, 'Ms Bucad demonstrates great deal of interest in programming. She asks senseful questions to make her work better. She is also resourceful, though she may need some improvement in discovering things on her own so that she can make her own understanding of things aside from the things that are being taught.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 14:57:28', '2025-03-06 14:57:28'),
(246, 1, 300, 4, 89.87, 'Ms Cabrera is one of the quiet ones. She may still need some improvement in her self-confidence, and attention to details. She has the capability to excel more when she applies the advantage of practicing.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 14:59:15', '2025-03-06 14:59:15'),
(247, 1, 348, 4, 88.00, 'Mr De Leon demonstrates great interest in programming, though his interest does not necessarily reflect on his work. He may still need some improvement when it comes to attention to details, and become resourceful.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:00:55', '2025-03-06 15:00:55'),
(248, 1, 310, 4, 95.00, 'Mr Diangkinay is one of the few top performing students from his class. He is very interested in programming where he really asks senseful questions. He is also resourceful, very trainable, and great habits in programming. His talents, and capabilities can only be limited by himself. His best asset is the fact that he is really eager to understand the code that he is doing.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:04:06', '2025-03-06 15:04:06'),
(249, 1, 299, 4, 95.00, 'Ms Estologa\'s cheerful personality really lits up the class where she always smile even when confronted by problems. She has the potential to be a successful programmer considering that she has keen attention to details, and being very trainable.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:06:12', '2025-03-06 15:06:12'),
(250, 1, 346, 4, 85.20, 'I believe Mr Loto has the potential to excel more in programming given the situation that he becomes more focused at the task at hand. He often gets distracted by the people around him leading to the decline of his work. Start with being more confident in yourself, and proper priotization.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:08:27', '2025-03-06 15:08:27'),
(251, 1, 315, 4, 81.47, 'Mr Magdame has a lot to work on on his plate. He is unfocused, and has a problem having attention to details that lead to the class having delayed discussions. I highly suggest that he do some self-reflection, and really take into consideration the things that needs prioritization. ', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:11:28', '2025-03-06 15:11:28'),
(252, 1, 306, 4, 89.40, 'Ms Mendoza is one of the quiet ones. At first, she was getting left behind but after some adjustments, she got back on track. She is very trainable, and lets her work speak for itself.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:12:53', '2025-03-06 15:12:53'),
(253, 1, 303, 4, 89.40, 'Ms Pianois one of the quiet ones. At first, she was getting left behind but after some adjustments, she got back on track. She is very trainable, and lets her work speak for itself.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:13:22', '2025-03-06 15:13:22'),
(254, 1, 298, 4, 89.40, 'Mr Rivera is one of the quiet ones. There was little to no questions from him that may lead to unsettled confusion. I highly suggest that he engage more in discussions with his workmates.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:15:29', '2025-03-06 15:15:29'),
(255, 1, 351, 4, 89.40, 'Ms Santos is one of the quiet ones. At first, she was getting left behind but after some adjustments, she got back on track. She is very trainable, and lets her work speak for itself.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:16:20', '2025-03-06 15:16:20'),
(256, 1, 349, 4, 86.60, 'Mr Soriano is very willing to learn new things but does not necessarily reflect on his work. I highly suggest him to have more attention to details, and work on his self-confidence so that he can be more comfortable in coding.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:18:21', '2025-03-06 15:18:21'),
(257, 1, 345, 4, 89.40, 'Mr Tolentino demonstrates great interest in making his work right. Though he may still need some improvements when it comes to having attention to details, and avoid typographical errors.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:19:52', '2025-03-06 15:19:52'),
(258, 1, 343, 4, 80.53, 'Mr Tolentino need to rethink his priorities. He is physically in training but his mind is elsewhere. He gets left behind because he often uses his cellphone even in discussions that often leads to him not understanding what has happened.', '2025-03-06', '2025-03-06 15:21:37', '2025-03-06 15:21:37'),
(259, 1, 265, 14, 92.20, 'Very respectful both instructor and her co-worker and has a nice personality.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:31:22', '2025-03-23 11:31:22'),
(260, 1, 278, 14, 92.20, 'Takes ownership of mistakes and learns from them.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:35:29', '2025-03-23 11:35:29'),
(261, 1, 276, 14, 93.13, 'Has room to improve in actively listening and engaging in conversations.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:37:54', '2025-03-23 11:37:54'),
(262, 1, 263, 14, 92.67, 'Could enhance communication by expressing ideas more clearly and concisely. Meets deadlines and completes tasks efficiently.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:39:53', '2025-03-23 11:39:53'),
(263, 1, 269, 14, 88.93, 'Shows potential for growth by taking more ownership of responsibilities. Could work on maintaining a more respectful tone in challenging discussions.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:42:32', '2025-03-23 11:42:32'),
(264, 1, 274, 14, 91.27, 'Has great potential for growth by seeking out more learning opportunities.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:44:20', '2025-03-23 11:44:20'),
(265, 1, 267, 14, 89.87, 'Has room to improve in actively listening and engaging in conversations. Would do well to be more open to constructive criticism and use it as a tool for improvement.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:46:15', '2025-03-23 11:46:15'),
(266, 1, 268, 14, 88.47, 'Shows dedication but may need to improve efficiency to complete tasks on time.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:47:52', '2025-03-23 11:47:52'),
(267, 1, 281, 14, 88.47, 'Could strengthen critical thinking skills by analyzing situations more thoroughly.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:49:27', '2025-03-23 11:49:27'),
(268, 1, 261, 14, 90.80, 'Responds to feedback constructively. Shows initiative and takes responsibility without being asked.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:51:26', '2025-03-23 11:51:26'),
(269, 1, 280, 14, 91.27, 'Actively listens and engages in conversations. Adapts to changes and new challenges smoothly.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:53:18', '2025-03-23 11:53:18'),
(270, 1, 271, 14, 83.80, 'Would benefit from paying closer attention to workplace policies and guidelines. Could improve in demonstrating respect for differing opinions and perspectives.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:56:23', '2025-03-23 11:56:23'),
(271, 1, 295, 14, 89.87, 'Identifies problems and proposes effective solutions.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:57:55', '2025-03-23 11:57:55'),
(272, 1, 266, 14, 88.47, 'Demonstrates a positive and proactive attitude.\n\n', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 11:59:25', '2025-03-23 11:59:25'),
(273, 1, 279, 14, 90.80, 'Displays honesty and integrity in all interactions. Takes ownership of mistakes and learns from them.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:01:05', '2025-03-23 12:01:05'),
(274, 1, 270, 14, 87.53, 'Shows potential for growth by taking more ownership of responsibilities. Has room to improve in actively listening and engaging in conversations.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:03:02', '2025-03-23 12:03:02'),
(275, 1, 270, 14, 89.87, 'Accepts and adjusts to constructive criticism.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:04:32', '2025-03-23 12:04:32'),
(276, 1, 277, 14, 88.93, 'Accepts and adjusts to constructive criticism.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:06:10', '2025-03-23 12:06:10'),
(277, 1, 273, 14, 91.27, 'Adapts to changes and new challenges smoothly. Demonstrates a positive and proactive attitude.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:07:56', '2025-03-23 12:07:56'),
(278, 1, 291, 14, 90.33, 'Seeks out opportunities for growth and learning. Actively listens and engages in conversations.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:09:58', '2025-03-23 12:09:58'),
(279, 1, 275, 14, 91.27, 'Takes ownership of mistakes and learns from them. Has room to improve in actively listening and engaging in conversations.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:11:38', '2025-03-23 12:11:38'),
(280, 1, 272, 14, 89.87, 'Seeks out opportunities for growth and learning.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:13:32', '2025-03-23 12:13:32'),
(281, 1, 247, 14, 90.33, 'Responds to feedback constructively. Actively listens and engages in conversations.', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:15:03', '2025-03-23 12:15:03'),
(282, 1, 235, 14, 90.33, 'Responds to feedback constructively. ', '2025-03-23', '2025-03-23 12:17:34', '2025-03-23 12:17:34'),
(283, 1, 357, 16, 94.07, 'Mr. Bautista is usually quiet in class, but he does a great job when given a task. Since he already knows the basics of web development, he picks up new lessons really quickly. Even though he doesn’t speak up much, he learns fast and applies what he knows effectively.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:30:15', '2025-03-27 14:30:15'),
(284, 1, 325, 16, 92.20, 'Mr. Belen learns quickly and isn’t afraid to ask questions when he doesn’t understand something or struggles with coding. While he enjoys chatting with his friends, he always makes sure to get his work done on time. His curiosity and willingness to ask for help show that he is focused on improving his skills and completing his tasks efficiently.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:34:00', '2025-03-27 14:34:00'),
(285, 1, 323, 16, 86.60, 'Mr. Gahon initially struggled with understanding how HTML and CSS are structured, but he puts in extra effort to improve. He takes the time to study ahead and always keeps notes to guide him in his work. His dedication and willingness to learn show that he is determined to get better, and his hard work is helping him gradually gain a stronger grasp of web development.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:39:52', '2025-03-27 14:39:52'),
(286, 1, 326, 16, 93.13, 'Mr. Lorico is always the first to finish his work compared to his classmates. Even though he already knows the basics of web development, he stays curious and eager to learn more. After completing his tasks, he takes the initiative to explore new things, showing his enthusiasm for expanding his skills and improving his knowledge. His curiosity and willingness to experiment make him a motivated and dedicated learner.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:46:55', '2025-03-27 14:46:55'),
(287, 1, 330, 16, 87.07, 'Mr. Lucena finds it difficult to code on his own and often relies on his seatmates for help. However, when asked about what he learned from them, he can clearly explain it, showing that he understands the assistance he receives. He is also very proactive in asking questions whenever he faces challenges in coding. His willingness to seek help and clarify his doubts shows that he is eager to learn and improve his coding skills.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:48:52', '2025-03-27 14:48:52'),
(288, 1, 354, 16, 92.20, 'Mr. Manalang quickly grasps lessons and completes his work with ease. He isn’t afraid to try different approaches to solve problems, showing his creativity and confidence in his skills. In his free time, he willingly helps his seatmate, demonstrating his teamwork and willingness to share his knowledge. His ability to learn fast and assist others makes him a valuable and supportive classmate.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:52:38', '2025-03-27 14:52:38'),
(289, 1, 324, 16, 92.67, 'Mr. Petras is usually quiet in class, but he always completes his tasks without any trouble. When he encounters a problem, he takes the time to figure it out on his own before asking for help. His ability to solve issues independently shows his problem-solving skills and determination. Even though he doesn’t speak up much, his work reflects his focus and strong understanding of the lessons.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:54:12', '2025-03-27 14:54:12'),
(290, 1, 329, 16, 91.27, 'Mr. Rivera is very focused in class and quickly understands his tasks. He follows instructions well and isn’t afraid to ask for help when needed. His dedication and willingness to learn make him a hardworking and responsible student.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:56:58', '2025-03-27 14:56:58'),
(291, 1, 356, 16, 92.20, 'Mr. Sadsad takes the time to research before working on a task, making sure he fully understands it. He applies what he learns to his work, showing his ability to use information effectively. His effort to gather knowledge and put it into practice helps him produce well-thought-out results and improve his skills.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 14:59:36', '2025-03-27 14:59:36'),
(292, 1, 318, 16, 92.20, 'Mr. Tolentino understands his lessons well and applies them to his work. He completes his tasks quickly and takes the extra step to double-check for any mistakes. His attention to detail and efficiency show his dedication to producing quality work.', '2025-04-02', '2025-03-27 15:00:52', '2025-03-27 15:00:52'),
(293, 1, 353, 18, 94.53, 'Mr. Alanano has consistently demonstrated excellence and a strong commitment to every project assigned to him. His eagerness to learn has been a key factor in his ability to successfully achieve objectives and complete tasks. Furthermore, his compassion and dedication are certain to lead him to continued success in the future.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:19:09', '2025-03-27 20:19:09'),
(294, 1, 355, 18, 93.60, 'Mr. Cruz is a silent listener who consistently demonstrates excellence in his work. He exhibits a strong eagerness to learn and explore new knowledge and experiences that contribute to the development of his skills. While his communication and collaboration with colleagues could benefit from further training, his dedication to growth and improvement is evident.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:22:06', '2025-03-27 20:22:06'),
(295, 1, 352, 18, 94.53, 'Mr. Endrenal demonstrates excellence not only in coding but also in visualizing designs. His eagerness to learn and explore has contributed to the successful completion of projects. He also shows he\'s not hesitant to seek clarification on areas where he lacks knowledge and will use it as a reference to his works, which allows others to see that he\'s eager to learn and grow.\n\n', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:25:18', '2025-03-27 20:25:18'),
(296, 1, 320, 18, 94.07, 'Mr. Flaviano demonstrates a strong interest in learning. Every task assigned to him is approached with dedication and enthusiasm. He listens attentively and observes carefully. He effectively applies the knowledge he has acquired to each subsequent project, showing significant growth and improvement.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:28:15', '2025-03-27 20:28:15'),
(297, 1, 328, 18, 92.67, 'Mr. Flores is a silent listener and he demonstrates a strong eagerness to learn new things with a sense of compassion. He possesses valuable skills and actively explores new areas of knowledge to enhance his expertise. This reflects his dedication to his tasks. However, his communication and collaboration with colleagues would benefit from further development in order to improve teamwork in the future.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:32:09', '2025-03-27 20:32:09'),
(298, 1, 322, 18, 94.07, 'Mr. Ilagan demonstrates a strong interest and eagerness to learn, even though he already possesses the skills and abilities to showcase his capabilities. He actively explores and applies the knowledge he has gained, which highlights his creativity and competitiveness in every task assigned to him. His growth and development are clearly evident through his work.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:34:28', '2025-03-27 20:34:28'),
(299, 1, 317, 18, 94.53, 'Mr. Luna demonstrates a strong interest in learning. Every task assigned to him is completed thoroughly and with dedication. He consistently showcases his skills and abilities, which enables him to excel in creating projects and assisting others with their tasks. His generosity towards his colleagues reflects his growth and willingness to embrace new experiences that will further contribute to the knowledge he has acquired.', '2024-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:36:51', '2025-03-27 20:36:51'),
(300, 1, 327, 18, 90.80, 'Mr. Malvar demonstrates a strong eagerness to learn and explore new knowledge. Although he requires more experience to fully complete tasks, his dedication and compassion are evident. Throughout the training period, he has shown significant self-growth and skill development. He is also not scared to seek clarification when necessary, which contributes positively to his work.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:41:09', '2025-03-27 20:41:09'),
(301, 1, 331, 18, 91.73, 'Mr. Palanca is an attentive listener who demonstrates a keen interest in every task assigned to him. With more experience, he will undoubtedly be able to fully showcase his skills. He is committed to learning and actively seeks to expand his knowledge. Throughout the training period, he has developed new skills that will contribute to his growth.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:44:05', '2025-03-27 20:44:05'),
(302, 1, 321, 18, 88.47, 'Mr. Paz is occasionally prone to distractions, but he has demonstrated notable skills. Providing him with clear instructions and encouraging the right attitude will allow him to showcase his full potential. Throughout the training period, he has displayed a genuine eagerness to explore new knowledge and consistently strives to complete the tasks assigned to him to the best of his ability.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:47:10', '2025-03-27 20:47:10'),
(303, 1, 319, 18, 88.47, 'Mr. Subijano is occasionally prone to distractions, but he consistently demonstrates a strong eagerness to learn. He is not afraid to seek assistance when he is unable to complete a task on his own, yet he first takes the initiative to explore and acquire additional knowledge before requesting help. He shows dedication to his projects, and with more experience, he would undoubtedly be able to fully showcase his abilities.', '2025-03-27', '2025-03-27 20:49:34', '2025-03-27 20:49:34'),
(304, 1, 369, 1, 84.73, '', '2025-08-01', '2025-07-31 10:42:56', '2025-07-31 10:42:56'),
(305, 1, 369, 19, 86.13, 'Mr. Landon, your curiosity and ability to grasp complex ideas quickly are real strengths—keep leveraging them! However, challenge yourself to pause and explore solutions independently before seeking support. Trust your instincts and break problems down step by step; often, the answer is closer than you think. When you do ask for help, try framing your thought process first (‘Here’s what I’ve tried/considered…’). This will sharpen your problem-solving skills and build even more confidence in your abilities. Keep pushing your initiative—you’ve got this!', '2025-07-31', '2025-07-31 15:56:41', '2025-07-31 15:56:41'),
(306, 1, 369, 13, 82.87, '', '2025-08-01', '2025-08-01 07:56:03', '2025-08-01 07:56:03'),
(307, 1, 370, 5, 89.87, 'Sir Lester has shown commendable dedication as a trainee. He is eager to learn and consistently demonstrates a positive attitude toward growth and development. He approaches tasks with determination, ensuring they are completed correctly and within the expected time frame. One of his strengths is his strong communication skills—he is not hesitant to ask questions, clarify instructions, or seek guidance whenever necessary. This openness makes him adaptable and easy to work with.\n\nOn the other hand, there are areas where further development would be beneficial. Specifically, he would greatly benefit from strengthening his analytical thinking, problem-solving skills, and attention to detail. These areas are essential in accounting work, where accuracy and critical assessment are highly important.\n\nRecommendations\nTo support his growth, I recommend additional training focused on enhancing his technical and analytical competencies. Training in Microsoft Excel (advanced functions, data analysis, and automation tools) as well as Payroll processing would be highly valuable. These programs will not only refine his accounting skills but also increase his efficiency, accuracy, and confidence in handling more complex tasks.\n\nOverall, with continued guidance and structured training, I believe Sir Lester has strong potential to excel in his role in the future.', '2025-09-17', '2025-09-17 13:18:02', '2025-09-17 13:18:02'),
(308, 1, 371, 5, 79.13, 'Ms. Mesta shows a strong willingness to learn accounting practices and demonstrates determination in her tasks. I can see her potential, especially if she decides to pursue a career in accounting. Given her background as a Marketing major, it is understandable that some accounting tasks can be challenging, which may affect her confidence in performing certain responsibilities. She is encouraged to continue developing her professionalism and confidence to become fully industry-ready.\n\nMs. Mesta has shown commendable effort and eagerness to learn despite the challenges. With continued practice, guidance, and commitment to improving her professional skills, she has the potential to perform well in the accounting field.', '2025-10-28', '2025-10-27 10:55:01', '2025-10-27 10:55:01'),
(309, 1, 386, 1, 82.40, 'Mr. Apuro is a very communicative individual who shows a strong willingness to assist fellow trainees. He is approachable and supportive when working with others. However, he sometimes experiences difficulty maintaining focus on assigned tasks and may become frustrated when outcomes do not immediately meet expectations. With continued guidance and practice in managing patience and concentration, he has good potential for improvement.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 09:51:55', '2026-01-27 09:51:55');
INSERT INTO `lcssv2_trainee_behavioral_evaluation` (`behavioral_evaluation_aid`, `behavioral_evaluation_is_active`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainee_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_trainer_id`, `behavioral_evaluation_ratings`, `behavioral_evaluation_remarks`, `behavioral_evaluation_date`, `behavioral_evaluation_created`, `behavioral_evaluation_datetime`) VALUES
(310, 1, 388, 1, 82.40, 'Mr. Endozo is very helpful to his co-trainees and willingly offers assistance whenever needed. He works well in a team setting and consistently demonstrates a positive and cooperative attitude toward assigned tasks. At times, he encounters challenges in identifying bugs and errors in his work, which may lead him to seek guidance and reference the work of other trainees. With continued guidance and practice, he is expected to develop greater confidence and independence in completing his tasks.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:07:45', '2026-01-27 10:07:45'),
(311, 1, 383, 1, 84.27, 'Mr. Enriquez is capable of completing assigned tasks. However, there are times when he becomes easily frustrated when he does not immediately understand or achieve the expected result. Despite this, he remains willing to assist his co-trainees and demonstrates a cooperative attitude in the workplace. With continued guidance and practice, he is expected to further develop patience and adaptability when facing challenges.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:13:26', '2026-01-27 10:13:26'),
(312, 1, 387, 1, 82.87, 'Mr. Garcia shows effort in completing his assigned tasks. However, there are times when he needs to seek guidance from the trainer as well as from his co-trainees to better understand certain tasks. This demonstrates his willingness to learn and improve. With continued support and practice, he is expected to gain more confidence and independence in performing his responsibilities.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:16:50', '2026-01-27 10:16:50'),
(313, 1, 389, 1, 81.00, 'Mr. Macapuno sometimes experiences difficulty maintaining motivation, as the tasks assigned are not fully aligned with his personal interests. There are moments when he feels discouraged; however, he still makes an effort to complete his assigned work. At times, he relies on referencing the work of his co-trainees to finish tasks. With continued encouragement, guidance, and skills development, he may improve his confidence and engagement in his responsibilities.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:19:22', '2026-01-27 10:19:22'),
(314, 1, 390, 1, 80.53, 'Mr. Nierva occasionally finds it challenging to stay motivated, as some tasks are not closely aligned with his personal interests. There are times when he feels discouraged; nevertheless, he continues to make an effort to complete his assigned responsibilities. In certain situations, he seeks guidance by reviewing the work of his co-trainees to help him move forward. With ongoing encouragement, proper guidance, and skills development, he is expected to build greater confidence and become more engaged in his tasks.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:21:29', '2026-01-27 10:21:29'),
(315, 1, 391, 1, 79.60, 'Mr. Vidal occasionally finds it challenging to stay motivated, as some tasks are not fully aligned with his personal interests. Despite this, he consistently makes an effort to complete his assigned responsibilities. At times, he seeks assistance from others even for small details; with increased patience and attention to minor aspects of his work, he is likely to become more independent and confident in completing tasks.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:24:08', '2026-01-27 10:24:08'),
(316, 1, 384, 1, 85.67, 'Ms. Orlanes is a hardworking and diligent trainee who shows perseverance even when facing challenges. She is willing to complete her assigned tasks, and although she occasionally requires guidance to accomplish them, she does not hesitate to assist her co-trainees whenever needed. Her dedication and cooperative attitude make her a valuable member of the team.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:27:58', '2026-01-27 10:27:58'),
(317, 1, 385, 1, 85.20, 'Mr. Palo is a hardworking and very helpful trainee who willingly assists his co-trainees. He demonstrates patience and perseverance in completing his tasks, even when he is frequently approached by others for guidance. His dedication and cooperative nature make him a valuable member of the team.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 10:30:57', '2026-01-27 10:30:57'),
(318, 1, 382, 5, 91.27, 'Ms. Del Mundo has demonstrated exemplary dedication and commitment as a trainee. She listens attentively, executes tasks accurately, and makes minimal errors, reflecting her conscientious approach to learning.\n\nShe is encouraged to maintain this level of diligence, as she possesses significant potential for future professional growth. Overall, her performance during the work immersion program has been commendable. Congratulations on the successful completion of her training.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 12:18:15', '2026-01-27 12:18:15'),
(319, 1, 380, 5, 84.27, 'Mr. Gamo demonstrates a genuine dedication to completing his tasks and shows a willingness to learn. He approaches his assignments with effort and perseverance, which is commendable.\n\nHowever, there are occasions when he appears inattentive during work hours, such as napping or losing focus, which can affect his understanding of some training sessions. By improving his concentration, actively listening, and paying closer attention to the details of each task, he will be able to maximize his learning and fully demonstrate his capabilities.\n\nOverall, we congratulate him on successfully completing the program. With continued focus and commitment, he has the potential to achieve even greater success in the future.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 12:23:00', '2026-01-27 12:23:00'),
(320, 1, 381, 5, 89.40, 'Mr. Paez is an exemplary trainee who demonstrates remarkable learning agility and strong logical thinking skills. He quickly grasps new concepts and applies them effectively in his tasks, showing both initiative and problem-solving ability. \n\nWhile he consistently delivers good results, he is encouraged to maintain a sharper focus on his tasks to minimize occasional mistakes and ensure even greater accuracy in his work. By paying closer attention to details, he can fully maximize his potential and further refine his skills.\n\nOverall, Mr. Paez has shown excellent performance during his work immersion training. We congratulate him on his accomplishments and successful completion of the program.', '2026-01-30', '2026-01-27 12:27:28', '2026-01-27 12:27:28'),
(321, 1, 401, 19, 89.87, 'Rihanna is a dedicated and thoughtful student. She listens attentively and demonstrates excellent judgment by asking precise, important questions that get to the heart of our web development concepts. She takes clear pride in her work, consistently submitting tasks that are complete and well-executed. It\'s a pleasure to have such a conscientious learner in class.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 14:59:25', '2026-02-03 14:59:25'),
(322, 1, 397, 19, 93.13, 'Terrence\'s performance is outstanding. He grasps complex concepts instantly and is undoubtedly the top of the class technically. My challenge for him is to become a top-tier collaborator as well. By actively engaging with and supporting his peers, he will not only enhance our class community but also build the exact skill set that defines successful professionals in this field.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:03:44', '2026-02-03 15:03:44'),
(323, 1, 408, 19, 86.13, 'Danielle Kimberly is a kind heart and a helpful team player. I truly appreciate her supportive nature. To help her grow even more, I am encouraging her to shift some of that wonderful energy from asking for the path to starting to explore the path herself. A little more confidence in her own ability to investigate and experiment will unlock a new level of enjoyment and mastery in web development.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:12:05', '2026-02-03 15:12:05'),
(324, 1, 403, 19, 86.13, 'Imrich approaches his work with a quiet demeanor. I’ve noticed that a reluctance to engage or ask questions can sometimes lead to a loss of focus and instructions being missed, which shows in the organization of his code. This often masks what he is truly capable of. My key advice for Imrich is to practice \"precision\" – in asking one quick question to confirm a task, in naming his variables clearly, and in checking his work against the goal. Small, confident actions in communication will lead to much clearer, more accurate technical results.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:18:36', '2026-02-03 15:18:36'),
(325, 1, 398, 19, 82.87, 'Juan Ynigo completes the assigned tasks, but often seems to disengage immediately afterward, returning to social media or other activities. This pattern suggests he is not yet fully immersed in the learning process or leveraging the practice time to explore concepts more deeply. There\'s a clear ability to complete work; the next step is to cultivate a more engaged and curious mindset throughout the entire session to truly master the material.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:30:14', '2026-02-03 15:30:14'),
(326, 1, 402, 19, 82.87, 'Juan Rafael demonstrates the ability to complete his assigned tasks. However, similar to a pattern observed in the class, he tends to disengage and switch to personal activities like social media immediately afterward. This suggests that his focus is on finishing, rather than on learning deeply. I encourage him to see his workstation as a full-time training environment and to use the extra time for review, experimentation, or helping peers. A more sustained engagement would allow his clear technical ability to shine through.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:33:37', '2026-02-03 15:33:37'),
(327, 1, 405, 19, 85.67, 'Cid is a quiet and reserved student, whose shyness appears to impact his ability to seek help and clarify instructions. This can lead to missed steps and unrefined work that may not fully represent his understanding. I encourage him to practice taking small, proactive steps—like asking one clarifying question per session and setting a personal goal for clean, well-named code. Building this habit of communication will be key to unlocking the potential I see in him.', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-03 15:41:12', '2026-02-03 15:41:12'),
(328, 1, 399, 19, 92.20, 'Darren demonstrated strong independence throughout her Web Development immersion. She consistently took the initiative to understand and accomplish tasks based on the lessons provided, asking only specific and well-thought-out questions when clarification was needed. She showed focus and attention to detail, regularly reviewing her work to ensure accuracy and quality. In addition, Darren willingly helped her co-trainees when needed, reflecting both technical competence and teamwork. Her eagerness to learn and problem-solve is commendable and indicative of strong potential in the field of web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 08:28:23', '2026-02-05 08:28:23'),
(329, 1, 411, 19, 88.00, 'Anjelie showed curiosity and a strong desire to complete her tasks during her Web Development immersion. Although she is naturally shy, she actively asked questions to better understand the lessons and requirements given. She demonstrated willingness to learn and perseverance in finishing her work. With continued practice and increased focus on small details in her code, Anjelie has the potential to further improve her technical skills and confidence in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 08:42:35', '2026-02-05 08:42:35'),
(330, 1, 396, 19, 87.07, 'Karl Josef demonstrated willingness to learn during his Web Development immersion and asked questions when clarification was necessary. Although he is reserved, he showed interest in completing his assigned tasks. Upon review, his code would benefit from better organization and closer attention to details. With guidance and increased focus on code structure and best practices, Karl Josef can improve the quality and clarity of his work and further develop his skills in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 08:44:58', '2026-02-05 08:44:58'),
(331, 1, 422, 19, 90.80, 'Alexynne consistently demonstrated diligence and seriousness in completing her tasks during the Web Development immersion. She showed strong eagerness to finish assignments on time and displayed curiosity toward more advanced concepts beyond the basic requirements. When given a task, she actively sought to understand how it works and how it can be properly implemented. Her dedication, curiosity, and initiative reflect strong potential for growth in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 08:47:30', '2026-02-05 08:47:30'),
(332, 1, 416, 19, 90.80, 'Mr. Cedrick demonstrated strong interest and enthusiasm for web development during his immersion program. He showed eagerness to learn, complete tasks, and stay ahead in understanding technical concepts. As a technologically inclined student, he grasped lessons quickly and showed initiative in his work. With a little more effort in going the extra mile—such as refining outputs and exploring improvements—Mr. Cedrick has the potential to further excel in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 08:54:07', '2026-02-05 08:54:07'),
(333, 1, 414, 19, 86.13, 'Jonella is a shy but diligent trainee who demonstrates genuine eagerness to complete tasks. She actively asks questions to clarify concepts, even if they are repetitive, which shows her commitment to understanding the work. While she may need more guidance during discussions and training, her determination to finish assignments reflects a positive learning attitude. With continued practice and confidence, Jonella has the potential to grow significantly in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:28:18', '2026-02-05 09:28:18'),
(334, 1, 407, 19, 89.87, 'Ryan demonstrates strong independence in his work, asking questions only when he encounters specific challenges in his tasks. He is not only focused on his own learning but is also eager to assist and share knowledge with his fellow trainees. His seriousness, curiosity, and willingness to help others reflect a commendable attitude toward learning and growth in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:31:03', '2026-02-05 09:31:03'),
(335, 1, 417, 19, 87.07, 'Rianne is a casual and reserved trainee who demonstrates a genuine willingness to learn and complete her tasks. She shows a kind and supportive attitude by helping others, even while managing her own challenges. Although she may sometimes take time to fully grasp concepts and instructions, her perseverance and collaborative spirit are commendable. With continued practice, she has the potential to steadily improve in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:38:24', '2026-02-05 09:38:24'),
(336, 1, 412, 19, 88.00, 'Danica is a bright and capable trainee who quickly excels once she understands the task. She actively asks questions after receiving assignments, demonstrating her eagerness to learn. While she shows great potential, she still requires close supervision and support to ensure tasks are completed correctly. With guidance, Danica is likely to continue growing and performing exceptionally in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:51:18', '2026-02-05 09:51:18'),
(337, 1, 409, 19, 90.80, 'Mr. Lilregz is a serious and dedicated trainee who consistently goes the extra mile to complete his tasks. While he may come across as having a strong personality, his focus on getting work done is evident. He asks specific, relevant questions thoughtfully and retains the knowledge well. He occasionally assists his fellow trainees, and with continued engagement, he can further strengthen his collaborative skills.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:54:13', '2026-02-05 09:54:13'),
(338, 1, 406, 19, 88.93, 'Ermielle is a focused and diligent trainee who demonstrates strong dedication to her work. While her motivation may occasionally dip, she consistently rebounds and continues her tasks with commitment. She is also proactive in assisting her fellow trainees, reflecting both a collaborative spirit and a positive attitude toward learning in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:56:23', '2026-02-05 09:56:23'),
(339, 1, 415, 19, 88.00, 'Janica is a keen and dedicated trainee who shows a genuine desire to learn. Although web development is still new to her and she sometimes needs extra guidance, she consistently asks questions to understand better and improve. With her curiosity and willingness to learn, Janica has great potential to grow confidently and succeed in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 09:59:15', '2026-02-05 09:59:15'),
(340, 1, 400, 19, 88.00, 'Mr. Santhino is a quick learner who performs well with guidance and support. When working independently, he sometimes needs a little more initiative to stay on track. Reviewing previous lessons and revisiting concepts will help him gain confidence and maintain focus on tasks. With continued practice and self-direction, he has the potential to excel in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 10:05:43', '2026-02-05 10:05:43'),
(341, 1, 421, 19, 87.07, 'Rianne is a casual and reserved trainee who demonstrates a genuine willingness to learn and complete her tasks. She shows a kind and supportive attitude by helping others, even while managing her own challenges. Although she may sometimes take time to fully grasp concepts and instructions, her perseverance and collaborative spirit are commendable. With continued practice, she has the potential to steadily improve in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 10:19:10', '2026-02-05 10:19:10'),
(342, 1, 410, 19, 88.47, 'Mr. Angelo is a keen and enthusiastic trainee who shows genuine interest in learning. While he can sometimes get distracted by browsing on his workstation, he demonstrates that when focused, he is capable of completing tasks effectively. He is also helpful and supportive toward his fellow trainees. With more consistent focus, Angelo has strong potential to excel in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 10:27:11', '2026-02-05 10:27:11'),
(343, 1, 419, 19, 86.60, 'Mr. John is a keen and attentive trainee who actively listens during lessons and shows genuine interest in exploring code. While he may occasionally get left behind, he consistently finds ways to complete his tasks. He is also helpful and collaborative, willingly assisting his fellow trainees. With his curiosity and dedication, John has great potential to continue growing in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 10:37:30', '2026-02-05 10:37:30'),
(344, 1, 404, 19, 89.40, 'Matthew is a quiet yet focused trainee who approaches tasks with dedication and efficiency. He asks questions only when necessary, demonstrating thoughtful engagement with his work. His commitment and steady work ethic make him a reliable and capable learner in web development.', '2026-02-05', '2026-02-05 10:39:21', '2026-02-05 10:39:21'),
(345, 1, 413, 19, 79.60, 'Mr. Coria brought positive energy to the training environment and contributed to a supportive atmosphere during the immersion. However, his overall performance and attitude were affected by concerns related to work discipline, particularly instances of leaving or being absent without prior notice. These situations go beyond simple tardiness and highlight the importance of responsibility and proper communication in a professional setting. Greater consistency in attendance and adherence to workplace policies are needed to improve his performance and professional conduct.', '2026-02-06', '2026-02-06 07:56:39', '2026-02-06 07:56:39'),
(346, 1, 420, 19, 81.47, 'Athena demonstrated a kind and helpful attitude throughout her Web Development immersion and maintained good relationships with her peers. While she showed willingness to work once tasks were clearly explained, she required close supervision to proceed effectively. A one-time instance of tardiness affected her work output for the day and highlighted the importance of time management and preparedness. With improved focus, initiative, and time management, Athena can further enhance her overall performance.', '2026-02-06', '2026-02-06 09:10:34', '2026-02-06 09:10:34'),
(347, 1, 438, 19, 93.60, 'Reign is an exceptional and driven student who consistently demonstrates curiosity, initiative, and a genuine passion for learning. He is highly detail-oriented and approaches every task with precision and purpose. What sets him apart is his determination—when faced with a challenge, he does not stop at the surface level. Instead, he explores, researches, and even advances beyond the current topic to find solutions that bring his vision to life.\n\nHis ability to think critically and independently allows him to solve problems effectively, especially in website development. Beyond technical skill, Reign shows a strong eye for design. He values alignment, structure, and organization, which reflects both his creativity and discipline.\n\nIf he continues to nurture this mindset of curiosity and perseverance, there is no doubt that he will excel not only in development and design but in any path he chooses. Reign has the potential to become not just a skilled creator, but a leader and innovator in his field.', '2026-02-17', '2026-02-17 14:57:01', '2026-02-17 14:57:01'),
(348, 1, 439, 19, 92.67, 'Ethan is a naturally curious and self-driven learner who actively seeks understanding rather than waiting for answers. What makes him stand out is his ability to ask the right questions—thoughtful, precise, and purposeful—which leads him to deeper learning and meaningful progress.\n\nDespite joining after taking the entrance exam, Ethan showed remarkable determination in catching up with discussions and activities. Not only did he keep pace, but he also managed to excel. This reflects his resilience, adaptability, and strong commitment to growth.\n\nEthan clearly has a natural talent for web development. With the right motivation and consistent guidance, he has the potential to achieve outstanding results. If he continues to nurture his curiosity and confidence, there is no limit to what he can build and accomplish in the field.', '2026-02-17', '2026-02-17 15:02:25', '2026-02-17 15:02:25'),
(349, 1, 440, 19, 92.20, 'Harvey is a brilliant and promising young developer who has already begun building coding projects and games at an early age—an impressive achievement that speaks volumes about his passion and natural talent for IT. He demonstrates strong technical ability and creative thinking, showing the qualities of someone who is truly born to build and innovate.\n\nWith greater focus, consistency, and commitment to mastering more advanced concepts, Harvey has the potential to thrive and excel in the IT field. His foundation is already strong; what will elevate him even further is sustained discipline and continuous growth.\n\nBeyond his technical skills, Harvey brings a joyful and positive energy to the learning environment. He is friendly, cooperative with his co-trainees, and shows clear signs of leadership potential. With the right guidance and continued dedication, Harvey is well on his way to becoming not just a skilled developer, but a future leader in the technology industry.', '2026-02-17', '2026-02-17 15:08:46', '2026-02-17 15:08:46'),
(350, 1, 444, 19, 88.93, 'Rye is a thoughtful and self-motivated web development student who demonstrates genuine curiosity and engagement with the subject matter. He shows strong problem-solving abilities, often taking initiative to research and discover solutions independently when faced with coding challenges.\nWhile his quiet demeanor reflects a focused, introspective approach to learning, Rye would benefit from increasing his collaboration with team members and speaking up more during discussions. Developing these communication skills would enhance his effectiveness and allow him to contribute even more value to group projects. With continued growth in teamwork and active participation, Rye has significant potential to excel in the field.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 07:53:04', '2026-03-05 07:53:04'),
(351, 1, 445, 19, 86.13, 'Kaye Anne is a quiet but focused trainee who consistently works hard to finish her tasks. She is independent and resourceful, trying to solve problems on her own before asking for help. She only reaches out when she truly doesn\'t understand something, which shows good judgment and self-awareness. With her strong work ethic, she has good potential to grow further.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 07:56:27', '2026-03-05 07:56:27'),
(352, 1, 453, 19, 84.73, 'John is a quiet and attentive trainee who listens carefully during discussions and stays focused on his tasks. He shows determination when facing challenges, consistently working to find solutions on his own. He also actively helps his team members, contributing to a collaborative environment. However, an incident of tardiness affected his performance and resulted in lost work time. Moving forward, maintaining punctuality will be important for him to fully contribute and succeed.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:00:56', '2026-03-05 08:00:56'),
(353, 1, 451, 19, 82.87, 'Harlie is a committed student with strong aptitude for web development. He quickly grasps concepts and fundamentals, and remains focused on his work. However, serious concerns with his attitude toward work and time management led to multiple tardiness incidents. Despite his technical potential, he exceeded the allowed limit of one late arrival during the 10-day program, resulting in termination from the work immersion.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:04:44', '2026-03-05 08:04:44'),
(354, 1, 451, 19, 77.73, 'Harlie is a committed student with strong aptitude for web development. He quickly grasps concepts and fundamentals, and remains focused on his work. However, serious concerns with his attitude toward work and time management led to multiple tardiness incidents. Despite his technical potential, he exceeded the allowed limit of one late arrival during the 10-day program, resulting in termination from the work immersion.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:07:18', '2026-03-05 08:07:18'),
(355, 1, 448, 19, 89.40, 'Jabez is a dedicated and disciplined trainee who consistently prioritizes his work and collaborates well with his peers. He demonstrates a mature, professional attitude and strong self-management—focusing entirely on tasks without distractions. His mindset, work ethic, and reliability show clear potential to be work-ready. He is a commendable trainee.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:11:10', '2026-03-05 08:11:10'),
(356, 1, 443, 19, 73.07, 'Mr. Jowen is a student who is still adjusting to a professional work environment. During his training, he struggled with punctuality and task initiative, which affected his overall performance. He may benefit from more time to develop workplace discipline and maturity before transitioning into employment. With further guidance and experience, he has room to grow.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:17:06', '2026-03-05 08:17:06'),
(357, 1, 446, 19, 92.20, 'Bryne is a brilliant and advanced student with exceptional technical skills in web development. He demonstrates strong talent and a solid foundation that positions him well for success in the IT industry. With continued guidance and exposure, he has great potential to thrive.\n\nMoving forward, Bryne would benefit from strengthening his professional discipline—specifically, using company time productively even after completing tasks, rather than engaging in activities like playing video games. Developing this habit will help him fully respect workplace expectations and maximize his growth.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:23:32', '2026-03-05 08:23:32'),
(358, 1, 446, 19, 92.20, 'Khloe is an active, curious, and dedicated student with a strong passion for learning. She absorbs new knowledge quickly and approaches her tasks with enthusiasm and commitment. She engages thoughtfully during lessons by asking good questions and sharing valuable suggestions and opinions. With her proactive attitude and eagerness to grow, she shows excellent potential for success.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:28:20', '2026-03-05 08:28:20'),
(359, 1, 450, 19, 90.80, 'Khloe is an active, curious, and dedicated student with a strong passion for learning. She absorbs new knowledge quickly and approaches her tasks with enthusiasm and commitment. She engages thoughtfully during lessons by asking good questions and sharing valuable suggestions and opinions. With her proactive attitude and eagerness to grow, she shows excellent potential for success.\n', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:30:38', '2026-03-05 08:30:38'),
(360, 1, 446, 19, 92.67, 'Bryne is a brilliant student who is advanced on his current status/level. He already has a talent for web development. He is a talented developer or IT. With proper guidance and exposure he will surely thrive in the IT industry.\n\nHis technical skills is already exceptional. But just an advice for Bryne, maybe he can work on his discipline than when during working hours even though he is finished on his task. He should avoid playing video games on his laptop to respect company time and focus more on work related stuff.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:32:41', '2026-03-05 08:32:41'),
(361, 1, 451, 19, 76.33, 'Harlie is a good and committed student. He has the knack or skills to learn the concepts and fundamentals in web development. He is also focused. The only problem with him is his attitude towards work and time management. He got late for 2 times already which is really bad and got terminated on our work immersion program because we only allow 1 late during the 10 day stay here at our office.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:35:34', '2026-03-05 08:35:34'),
(362, 1, 442, 19, 86.60, 'Rainiel brings positive energy to the training and enjoys the learning process while staying focused on his tasks. However, he sometimes gets distracted by playing video games. If he can minimize this and channel more focus into his work, he has great potential to achieve even more.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:39:38', '2026-03-05 08:39:38'),
(363, 1, 447, 19, 79.13, 'Ms. Elizabeth participated in the training program, though she often appeared distracted and disengaged during sessions. She frequently used her phone for video games and was observed starting late, even when tasks remained unfinished. While she did ask for assistance when needed and accepted help when offered, she showed limited initiative to explore solutions independently—often relying on external tools rather than deepening her own understanding.\nWith more active participation, better time management, and a stronger commitment to the learning process, Ms. Elizabeth has room to grow. Developing self-directed learning habits and workplace discipline will be important steps for her future development.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 08:45:46', '2026-03-05 08:45:46'),
(364, 1, 449, 19, 81.47, 'Ephraim brings positive energy to the class with his curiosity and active engagement in web development discussions. He asks thoughtful questions and shows genuine interest in learning the material.\nHowever, concerns remain regarding his workplace discipline. A single tardiness incident significantly impacted his evaluation, and he was frequently observed playing video games during working hours. Developing stronger professional habits—particularly time management and focus during company time—will be essential for him to fully realize his potential.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 09:56:17', '2026-03-05 09:56:17'),
(365, 1, 452, 19, 90.80, 'Matt is a brilliant, committed, and dedicated student with a clear passion for web development and a strong thirst for knowledge. He pays close attention to detail, listens carefully during discussions, and asks precise, thoughtful questions that lead to deeper understanding. His genuine interest in the field, combined with excellent work ethic and discipline, sets him apart as a commendable trainee with promising potential.\n', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 10:01:24', '2026-03-05 10:01:24'),
(366, 1, 451, 19, 74.93, 'Harlie is a good and committed student. He has the knack or skills to learn the concepts and fundamentals in web development. He is also focused. The only problem with him is his attitude towards work and time management. He got late for 2 times already which is really bad and got terminated on our work immersion program because we only allow 1 late during the 10 day stay here at our office.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 10:03:16', '2026-03-05 10:03:16'),
(367, 1, 451, 19, 73.53, 'Harlie is a good and committed student. He has the knack or skills to learn the concepts and fundamentals in web development. He is also focused. The only problem with him is his attitude towards work and time management. He got late for 2 times already which is really bad and got terminated on our work immersion program because we only allow 1 late during the 10 day stay here at our office.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 10:09:30', '2026-03-05 10:09:30'),
