(371, 1, 451, 19, 71.67, 'Harlie is a good and committed student. He has the knack or skills to learn the concepts and fundamentals in web development. He is also focused. The only problem with him is his attitude towards work and time management. He got late for 2 times already which is really bad and got terminated on our work immersion program because we only allow 1 late during the 10 day stay here at our office.', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-05 10:29:52', '2026-03-05 10:29:52'),
(372, 1, 459, 1, 85.67, 'Ms. Zabala is a dedicated trainee who consistently shows eagerness to learn, even though the trainer observed that this field may not yet be her primary area of interest. Despite this, she continuously puts forth her best effort in understanding the lessons and tasks assigned to her. She actively asks questions whenever she is curious about certain details, demonstrating initiative and a genuine willingness to improve her knowledge and skills. Given that she is still in junior high school, the trainer can see strong potential for her to thrive in this industry, especially if she continues practicing coding and exploring her skills even outside the training environment. With continuous learning, practice, and confidence-building, she has the potential to further develop her capabilities in the field.', '2026-05-14', '2026-05-14 08:54:27', '2026-05-14 08:54:27'),
(373, 1, 458, 19, 93.60, 'Sir Paul has been a remarkable trainee throughout his internship. His natural talent for web development, combined with his eagerness to learn, has allowed him to quickly grasp new concepts and contribute meaningful ideas. He is proactive, dependable, and always willing to assist others when needed. Beyond his technical skills, he works well with the team, maintains a positive attitude, and demonstrates professionalism in every task he undertakes. He has shown great potential and is well-positioned for a successful career in the technology industry.', '2026-06-11', '2026-06-09 09:08:03', '2026-06-09 09:08:03'),
(374, 1, 458, 13, 94.07, 'Sir Paul has been a remarkable trainee throughout his OJT hours during the bootcamp. He consistently demonstrated professionalism, dedication, and a strong willingness to learn, particularly in backend development training. He actively participated in discussions, quickly grasped technical concepts, and applied feedback effectively to improve his skills. His positive attitude, responsibility, and commitment to completing tasks made him a pleasure to mentor. I am confident that the knowledge and experience he gained during the bootcamp will contribute significantly to his future success in the field.', '2026-06-15', '2026-06-15 09:54:25', '2026-06-15 09:54:25');
