(46, 1, 55, 100, 'For me, i like the friendliness type of all emplyees, the good manners, and happy environment. Also i like the aircon, cafiteria and also the type of envirenmont they have.', 'For me, for being strict some times. And also for being serious of some employees sometimes.', 'i may suggest to FBS to fix the comfort room for them to have a proper and decent comfort room that they can use.', 'I just wanted to say that I enjoyed to be part of ojts here in FBS, i have learned a lot about accountings and to be a friendly type like other employees. Also I would like to say that FBS have a good, kind, and well mannered trainer that even she had a bad days she would do anything for us to understand the lesson. Thankyouuu so much for your understanding specially to Ms.Thea.', '2024-04-25 15:14:12', '2024-04-25 15:14:12'),
