(61, 1, 70, 100, 'I appreciate the comprehensive structure of the OJT Program, particularly its instructional methods encompassing both theoretical lessons and practical application. Our comprehension of professionalism and confidentiality has been notably enhanced. Ms. Kennie has proven to be an exceptional trainer, as have the other staff members.', 'In light of the ongoing progress of the LCS, my sole desire is for its enhancement to facilitate more effective utilization.', 'None.', 'None. The program alone is efficient and effective.', '2024-06-06 10:28:13', '2024-06-06 10:28:13'),
(62, 1, 72, 100, 'Overall, I like the training since we our expose with the HR task. We handle 201 files where we practice confidentiality while organizing the personal files of an employee. Our proctors is approachable and they also guide by providing primary and secondary source that makes our filling and documentation much easier to accomplish.', 'I have none', 'I have none', 'We are planning to come here again for our 3rd year externship', '2024-06-06 10:51:43', '2024-06-06 10:51:43'),
(63, 1, 73, 100, 'The welcoming environment at FBS, along with the approachable and kind employees, exceeded my expectations. The trainers demonstrated excellent teaching skills, honing and further developing our abilities in a short time. They ensured that students comprehended the lessons and gained practical skills for the outside world.', 'Honestly, I\'m satisfied with the overall outcome.', 'I recommend enhancing the technical system or website/portal of FBS. While the newest system is user-friendly, the registration process and website access can be challenging, leading to issues.', 'My experience at FBS has been fulfilling. In a short time, I’ve learned a lot and am impressed every day in various aspects. What truly stands out to me is the devotion of every employee, guided by faith, which strengthens the foundation and morale of the team.', '2024-06-06 11:08:13', '2024-06-06 11:08:13'),
(64, 1, 71, 100, 'What I like the most about Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is that they are well-equipped to accommodate OJT\'s with a supportive  environment to learning  and growth. I\'m honored to be mentored by skilled individuals that very hands on guiding us to complete task.', 'None', 'I think since the company gives an excellent services, there\'s no room for improvement', 'none', '2024-06-06 11:21:22', '2024-06-06 11:21:22'),
(65, 1, 75, 92, 'The environment', 'nothing', 'When teaching it\'s to slow down a bit so that everyone can follow', 'None', '2024-07-22 10:15:26', '2024-07-22 10:15:26'),
(66, 1, 76, 88, 'Good Facility', 'none', 'Consider that some students are not that fast on learning', 'none', '2024-07-22 10:20:52', '2024-07-22 10:20:52'),
(67, 1, 80, 100, 'What I like about the program is how the trainers always helps trainees to fully understand the topic.', 'I can\'t say anything that I don\'t like about the program because it really helps me learn about frontend development.', 'I don\'t have anything to suggest in the current program.', 'I have fun during the training, the trainers are friendly, and the work environment are very good. I learned so much. Thank you.', '2024-07-22 10:22:43', '2024-07-22 10:22:43'),
(68, 1, 69, 100, 'I think have improved a lot, since I joined this program. I have learned many things about web development. Every topic is  full of information and interesting especially when being guided by our instructors. I like how I can learn more about web development, I find all of them very useful and helpful for the upcoming school year.', 'I did not dislike anything about my experience in this program.', 'I don\'t have any suggestions because i was very satisfied during my experience in this program.', 'none', '2024-07-22 10:25:02', '2024-07-22 10:25:02'),
(69, 1, 84, 100, 'the program really meets my expectation and help me to refresh on my programming skills.', 'None', 'None', 'Thank you FBS', '2024-07-22 10:26:51', '2024-07-22 10:26:51'),
(70, 1, 81, 100, 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT Program is that all trainers are well-equipped and skilled. All the topics we have are very relevant, especially in the industry we will surely use.', 'To be honest, nothing. Since it is my first time training I tend to limit my expectations. But what surprises me is that FBS delivered or provided all of what I was expecting.', 'I suggest that FBS OJT Program should also offer backend development training since some individuals, including myself, are interested in this kind of training.', 'Thank you, FBS, for allowing us to train in your company. Hoping that more people will have the opportunity to benefit from this valuable experience. The knowledge and skills we gained have been incredibly beneficial, and we are grateful for the support and mentorship provided. Looking forward to seeing the program continue to grow and improve.', '2024-07-24 16:00:40', '2024-07-24 16:00:40'),
(71, 1, 79, 100, 'I liked how they always make you feel at home when you are being taught. They always greet you like a co-league even though you are just a trainee.', 'None', 'For me I found nothing for them to improved on the attitudes of the employee\'s is nice the facility is nice the computer is nice too.', 'None', '2024-07-24 18:38:59', '2024-07-24 18:38:59'),
(72, 1, 74, 92, 'I liked the hands-on experience and real-world application of skills the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program, which greatly enhanced my practical knowledge and professional growth.', 'Waking up early', 'consider having more mentors', 'None', '2024-07-29 08:13:38', '2024-07-29 08:13:38'),
(73, 1, 77, 100, 'The work environment. Not only does it instill a sense of decency, politeness, and professionalism in us, but at the same time immerses us in a professional work environment, teaching us how to act accordingly in a corporate workplace which would surely prove to be of great importance in the upcoming future as a professional in the IT Industry.', 'I have not noticed such a thing.', 'In matters of suggestion, I cannot think of anything. Perhaps to improve what FBS already has and is also widely praised by others which is its healthy work environment.', 'Nice place, clean crs, free coffee, and an abundance of great and polite people. I really enjoyed and have been comfortable with my stay here in FBS. Thank you so much for having me ^_^', '2024-07-29 08:21:10', '2024-07-29 08:21:10'),
(74, 1, 67, 100, 'What I like the most during the OJT Program is the WordPress taught by Mr. Ramon Plaza. It was shocking how fast paced Mr. Plaza proceeds in teaching WordPress but I enjoyed it the most because I can see how I improved a lot during the training that I had with Mr. Plaza.', 'I don\'t have any thing that I liked least in the OJT Program. Though I faced problems during the Figma, I wouldn\'t say that it is something that I don\'t like since I have a hard time in coming up with design ideas which makes Figma hard for me but I deem Figma or Web Design as a vital part of web development.', 'I do not have any suggestion since in my experience on the OJT Program I am satisfied about the pacing and the training schedule of the program.', 'I really enjoyed my experience WordPress with the guidance of Sir Mon.', '2024-07-29 10:25:03', '2024-07-29 10:25:03'),
(75, 1, 68, 100, 'I like how the training was well planned, the flow of topics for front-end web development, the facilities we can access, and the availability of equipment to be used for the training. I also liked how the training allowed us to build relationships with fellow interns and trainees, further strengthening our bond and allowing teamwork.', 'Overall, my experience has been great and fruitful throughout the training. I guess my least favorite part is when we (the interns) are the only ones left to finish the remaining week of our training, because there has been a drastic change on the atmosphere of the work place.', 'I would like to suggest additional topics for the 240 hours timespan of the training, however that will depend on the student/interns ability to keep up with the topics.', 'None', '2024-07-29 12:54:04', '2024-07-29 12:54:04'),
(76, 1, 85, 100, 'What I like the most about the FBS OJT program is their trainers\' professionalism and mastery on the field of their expertise. I also like bond of each employees where they can share thoughts and work as a team without pressure.', 'None', 'Continue to expand the program by having partnerships to other schools outside Laguna.', 'I am deeply grateful to FBS for the opportunity to be part of the team. My heartfelt thanks go to my trainers, who generously shared their knowledge and expertise in the field of web development. I also want to extend my appreciation to the Web-LCS team for welcoming me as one of their own and for the camaraderie we built during my 240 hours with the company. I eagerly look forward to training here again and hope to contribute to the team, sharing my own knowledge and skills. Wishing continued growth and success to FBS. Maraming salamat po!', '2024-08-20 12:46:50', '2024-08-20 12:46:50'),
(77, 1, 92, 92, 'The work-related influence whether in front-end development or the ethics &  in the work environment, and also the clean and neat comfort room at all times.', 'Fast-paced teaching I think, really depends on the trainee how they cope though.', 'I think do diagnostic tests first, if the company really want to measure the trainers knowledge about the training itself.', 'N/A', '2024-09-04 07:01:25', '2024-09-04 07:01:25'),
(78, 1, 89, 100, '- All trainers are 5/5\n- Positive work environment\n- Good CR\n- Good coffee', 'Aircon too cold sometimes', 'None for now', 'Thank you', '2024-09-04 07:04:33', '2024-09-04 07:04:33'),
(79, 1, 88, 100, '-Hands on projects\n-Peaceful work environment\n-Technical and passionate trainers\n-Unlimited free coffee\n-Clean comfort room\n-Good air conditioning\n-Monthly company gathering/fellowship', 'The monitor at the front of the room is too low, the trainees can\'t see it well, especially if they\'re not tall.', 'Implement daily coding challenges focused on data structures and algorithms of Javascript and PHP to familiarize the trainees with the syntax of both scripting languages. Additionally, have at least 4hours course on Git bash commands tackling what to do when merging, or when problems arise.', 'The trainers are very approachable, passionate and hands-on. The employees are very welcoming.', '2024-09-04 07:05:17', '2024-09-04 07:05:17'),
(80, 1, 87, 100, '- they are very hands-on when it comes to mentorship\n- fantastic work environment\n- gives interns work and life balance\n- free coffee\n- clean cr with bidet\n- trainers 5 stars', 'the tv used for teaching is too low', 'put the tv higher', 'I forgot to commend Ms. Herlyn for her efforts in our eval forms when we were in Cavite and to Sir Jhonny for helping us out with our certificate of completion', '2024-09-04 07:06:39', '2024-09-04 07:06:39'),
(81, 1, 91, 100, 'I like how the instructors are very accommodating to us, especially Ms. Herlyn. Everyone was very approachable and is willing to show us the ropes on web development. The facilities are also very well maintained and  the environment is very pleasant to work in.', 'The equipment are sometimes buggy causing technical delays, but overall I like everything about this company', 'Allow student interns to have more hours than 8 hours per day if possible, at least 1 hour additional. This will allow some students who are time constricted to finish the OJT program on time and comply to the requirements of their respective universities.', 'I\'m deeply thankful to Frontline Business Solutions, who served as the host training establishment. Their support, resources, and professional environment significantly contributed to my learning and development. To everyone in the web solutions and learning center solutions, I\'m very thankful to be given this opportunity, and I would very much like comeback here someday.', '2024-09-04 07:15:52', '2024-09-04 07:15:52'),
(82, 1, 90, 100, 'The liberty to show my personality and creativity in my work', 'Inconsistency with the training equipment (monitors, keyboard, etc)', 'Streamline and automate tasklist', 'None', '2024-09-04 07:17:03', '2024-09-04 07:17:03'),
(83, 1, 107, 100, 'The supportive and professional environment that FBS have', 'Every program has room for growth, and while I can\'t pinpoint a specific aspect I liked least, there were certainly valuable lessons in each phase that contributed to my overall learning.', 'While I thoroughly enjoyed the Frontline Business Solutions OJT program, I believe that every program has opportunities for improvement. It’s always helpful to continue gathering feedback from participants to identify areas where small adjustments could make the experience even more valuable. Overall, the program provided great learning opportunities, and I\'m confident that future iterations will continue to evolve and improve.', 'I would like to express my appreciation for the opportunity to be a part of the Frontline Business Solutions OJT program. The experience provided valuable hands-on learning and allowed me to develop key skills in a real-world setting. I also found the support from the team and mentors to be encouraging and helpful in navigating tasks and challenges. I’m grateful for the chance to contribute and learn, and I believe the program will continue to be a valuable resource for future trainees.', '2024-11-15 07:51:18', '2024-11-15 07:51:18'),
(84, 1, 106, 100, 'The Frontline Business Solutions OJT program i likely stands out for offering hands-on experience, mentorship, and skill development. It provides valuable networking opportunities and helps participants apply what they’ve learned in real-world scenarios, all while exploring potential career paths.', 'I don’t have anything I liked least about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT program because they provided valuable technical and professional experience throughout my training.', 'One suggestion for improving the Frontline Business Solutions OJT program could be the regular check-Ins. Frequent one on one meetings with mentors to discuss progress, challenges, and goals could ensure that participants stay engaged in the training.', 'My training at Frontline Business Solutions has been incredibly enriching and impactful for my professional growth. Throughout my time here, I had the opportunity to enhance my technical skills. The environment fostered by FBS was supportive and encouraging, with mentors readily available to guide me whenever I faced challenges. One of the highlights was working on real-world projects, which not only improved my problem-solving and multitasking abilities but also gave me practical insight into industry standards. This hands-on experience allowed me to see the direct applications of what I learned in my studies and training. This training has solidified my passion for continuous learning, and I’m motivated to further develop my skills, especially in areas like web development and backend programming. I’m grateful for the experience and am excited to carry forward the knowledge and values I’ve gained at FBS.', '2024-11-15 07:55:33', '2024-11-15 07:55:33'),
(85, 1, 108, 80, 'I really liked the program outline for both the Frontend and Backend program. I feel like almost everything needed was covered all throughout the program.', 'Although I am happy with all of the coding and projects we completed in the curriculum, I believe that the theoretical and conceptual discussions are one area where the program falls short.', 'Before getting into the code portion, it would be more beneficial to include more visual aids, such as a PowerPoint presentation, rather than just verbal explanations of the topics such as the Model–view–controller and Object-Relational Mapping.', 'Overall, I\'m really happy with my experience with the OJT program. It exceeded all my expectations and I\'m more confident with my skills now and found my passion for Web/Full-Stack Development.', '2024-11-15 12:27:55', '2024-11-15 12:27:55'),
(86, 1, 138, 56, 'The all room is clean, the Trainers are good in communicating and can easily approach', 'The internet', 'nothing', 'nothing', '2024-12-03 10:16:05', '2024-12-03 10:16:05'),
(87, 1, 122, 96, 'i like most about fbs ojt program is the free coffee and the service of fbs', 'the aircon of fbs', 'the student in ojt program can be connect to innternet connection of fbs', 'im very satisfied in my experience because my comoputer skills has improve in the way of coding.im very thankful to fbs to give me excellent experience and unforgetable experience', '2024-12-03 10:17:32', '2024-12-03 10:17:32'),
