(89, 1, 112, 100, 'what I like most about FBS is their teaching and how they treat the youth and their clients well.', 'THEIR KINDESS, THEIR PATIENT', 'I DONT HAVE ANY SUGGESTIONS IN FBS', 'NOTHING', '2024-12-03 10:57:21', '2024-12-03 10:57:21'),
(90, 1, 148, 100, 'I like the care of our dear trainers shown to us. They teach us effectively and helped us whenever we have confusion and mistakes. We are also very comfortable with our trainers, they are very friendly. The environment here in FBS is also warm and wonderful.', 'So far, There\'s nothing much it\'s the location is just too far and commuting is very tiring.', 'I would like to suggest changing the chair since my back is aching every night because of the sitting posture.', 'I have so much fun here in fbs and learned a lot.', '2024-12-03 11:00:13', '2024-12-03 11:00:13'),
