(92, 1, 116, 92, 'I LIKE MOST ABOUT FBS is how they communicate to the  students because they know that is our First and almost all haven\'t any idea about coding they teach one by one to learn us, maybe not all students may use this in college but it\'s a  great experience,', 'non', 'i suggest of having more than 10 days because 10 days it\'s not enough to become proficient but, having this limited days gives me a  big lesson to grow not only in coding', 'HOPE SOMEDAY I WILL COMEBACK HERE THANKYOU FBS FAM', '2024-12-03 12:42:49', '2024-12-03 12:42:49'),
