(99, 1, 127, 92, 'I like the healthy environment and good services. I also like how employees treat others in a good way', 'nothing', 'nothing', 'Thankyou po for  a great experience. We learn a lot!', '2024-12-04 07:27:50', '2024-12-04 07:27:50'),
(100, 1, 140, 92, 'It has a healthy environment which helps us to learn more effectively.', 'The employees,  they are very professional and they are all good. Then it builds a healthy environment which benefits us.', 'To make more outputs.', 'The environment is surely awesome.', '2024-12-04 07:31:01', '2024-12-04 07:31:01'),
(101, 1, 125, 96, 'While I\'m in FBS OJT Program, I liked how the trainers are friendly and very approachable when I needed assistance. Also, I like the way they teach us where the trainers ensures that we really learn and capable of doing our task independently. But, the speech of Mr. Robert is one of the many things that I would certainly remember both as an advice and a lesson that I can use in my life.', 'To be honest, there is nothing that I didn\'t like in my time here in FBS OJT Program.', 'For me, there is nothing that needed to be improve and everything is good.', 'Unfortunately, nothing', '2024-12-04 08:03:32', '2024-12-04 08:03:32'),
(102, 1, 128, 88, 'What I liked most about the FBS OJT Program is the knowledge I have gained regarding web designing and programming. Even though this isn\'t the field that I\'m going to take in the future, I still believe that having foundational knowledge about this field will be helpful in the future during instances that I need to apply what I have learned, given that I\'m in a STEM field. Moreover, I also love how the program not only focused on the technical skills, but also on the internal skills that are very valuable not just in our professional lives, but also in our daily lives as we take on our different journeys. I deeply appreciated our PLE sessions that eventually led me to self-reflection, realization, and improvement. Overall, I think that it\'s a really good program that cultivated and inspired me to be the best version of myself.', 'To be honest, I really liked everything about it. Even though our time here was limited, I believe that we made good use of the 80 hours that was given to us. Everyday was full of knowledge that was definitely both challenging and fun.', 'Personally, I like it already as it is.', 'I have nothing else to say. I really had fun. Thank you FBS!', '2024-12-04 08:10:29', '2024-12-04 08:10:29'),
(103, 1, 134, 88, 'While working at FBS OJT PROGRAM  I\'ve realize that the trainers deals a same vibes to us. Also, I like the way  of teaching the contributed to my knowledge and work professionally at the workplace. Additionally, I appreciate those guideline services of trainers during our working task. Thus, it develop my skills that gained and make the better version of myself.', 'Basically, I like the beautiful view in workplace either inside or outside, it defines a calmness.', 'I don\'t have any suggestion', 'Same as the recent I don\'t have any comment', '2024-12-04 08:34:18', '2024-12-04 08:34:18'),
(104, 1, 146, 84, 'What I liked most in FBS is that the employees and staff here treat us as we were already part of FBS, they are so polite and they always greet us with a smile. They made us have a sense of belongingness and spread positivity. I also like that Sir Robert came to inspire us and to give us tips, knowledge, and examples in business, career, work, and goals in life.', 'So far, I did not have any dislike towards the FBS OJT Program. :)', 'Maybe provide short motivational activities for those participants/students that lack motivation.', 'none', '2024-12-04 09:29:00', '2024-12-04 09:29:00'),
(105, 1, 109, 96, 'technical skills', 'PLE', 'Coding/programming games', 'it was a fun and great experience', '2024-12-04 16:10:07', '2024-12-04 16:10:07'),
(106, 1, 110, 88, 'The trainers and the environment inside the company.', 'nothing', 'More coding experience, but what I’ve experience is already great as it is', 'Thank you for providing a great experience for us grade 12 students.', '2024-12-04 16:18:41', '2024-12-04 16:18:41'),
(107, 1, 133, 96, 'very fun & has a friendly environment. all of the trainers also especially Sir Ansbert and Sir Roy were very entertaining and all of them provided us lots of new learning', 'nothing.', 'my only suggestion is please continue providing students quality education while having fun. THANK U FBS!!!!', 'I am really really grateful to have experienced my work immersion here. I will brought all of my learnings from FBS to anywhere I go!', '2024-12-04 17:07:53', '2024-12-04 17:07:53'),
(108, 1, 115, 100, 'What I liked the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Programs was the Supervisors who taught and guided us', 'Nothing', 'I don\'t have any suggestions', 'the 10 days was immersion was really fun and I also felt like we were actually workers and not students and also I learned a lot from PLE to Technical Skills', '2024-12-04 17:23:20', '2024-12-04 17:23:20'),
(109, 1, 141, 40, 'the trainers, all of them are very approachable and I learn a lot of them very they are all magaling.', 'The company of course because the company are very much good for me and very malinis', 'for me is nothing.', 'i hope marami pa silang matulungan ng mga ganong skills lalo na sa mga gustong mag computer science in the future', '2024-12-04 17:42:01', '2024-12-04 17:42:01'),
(110, 1, 136, 92, 'That we are belong with them and we feel the care of Ma\'am/Sir. Also we understand the topics in other subject like PLE that can help us to realise the reality.', 'We can\'t buy some foods near the FBS', 'It should have a nearby food court in or outside the FBS:)', 'FBS is a good at teaching in technical and reality things, that will be one of the greatest I encounter in my first time ojt and this would be memorable. Thank youu FBS!', '2024-12-04 21:53:26', '2024-12-04 21:53:26'),
(111, 1, 131, 84, 'The people in it, they were very warm and welcoming to us.', 'none', 'have more program that may help students in the future besides coding.', 'none', '2024-12-05 20:27:16', '2024-12-05 20:27:16'),
(112, 1, 97, 100, 'I love how they treat  us. All of them are very kind and helpful persons', 'Nothing, I love all of them', 'Nothing', 'Thank you for teaching us and caring for us. AWESOMEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEEE', '2025-01-06 13:22:43', '2025-01-06 13:22:43'),
(113, 1, 94, 100, 'I love how they teach us and how they treat us equally even they are more professional than us.', 'nothing', 'Nothing', 'Thankyou for everything that yall teach us in 600 hours', '2025-01-06 13:26:13', '2025-01-06 13:26:13'),
(114, 1, 101, 100, 'I liked that the company is prepared to take in interns.  The trainers that are patient when it comes to teaching their trainees.', 'None', 'More collaboration projects, To help the trainees to be more collaborative with others.', 'none', '2025-01-06 13:32:44', '2025-01-06 13:32:44'),
(115, 1, 93, 100, 'Hindi lang sila nagfofocus sa work, pinapahalagahan din nila yung  connection between there employees and workmates, which makes your work more easy kase wala pong toxic or negatity and most specially FBS work , most importantly, FBS is dedicated on serving God', 'none', 'Presentation of their learnings per week, para they are motivated matuto talaga unlike sa gumagawa lang po na di naman po pala nila naiintindihan, and dun din po makikita niyo kung may improvements po ba talaga sa mga intern', 'none', '2025-01-06 13:39:13', '2025-01-06 13:39:13'),
(116, 1, 99, 92, 'I love their program structure I like how strong and unique their program and folder structures are, as an com-sci college student I am amazed on how clean and efficient it is. For our daily training, it\'s like a battlefield of ideas, we search projects as reference then we give it a try , and then we start from scratch like frontend to backend all important things you need to learn in SASS, WORDPRESS, tailwindcss are covered. Only here on FBS I learned the important of using Github repositories, usually I just save my project their and nothing else to do.', 'Nothing so far', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2025-01-06 13:40:14', '2025-01-06 13:40:14'),
(117, 1, 100, 96, 'i like the most in this training on fbs, is having an own pc and also their program is align the needs of the students that we\'re having an ojt. besides when we have a complex problem on every task that we make, our instructor really help us to understand and solve it perfectly', 'Regarding this, i have nothing to say because in this company they provide all the neccesity stuff, also it has a lot of working materials/devices that we really need for working a task.', 'I think it would be better if to enhance structure by implementing a standardized training materials, a structured curriculum and regular assessment to ensure consistent and effective learning', 'None so far', '2025-01-06 13:40:35', '2025-01-06 13:40:35'),
(118, 1, 96, 96, 'The effectiveness of the program and the good environment', 'None', 'none', 'none', '2025-01-06 13:43:13', '2025-01-06 13:43:13'),
(119, 1, 95, 100, 'The things that I like most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM is how they get along and interact with the OJTs, they don\'t consider us students but an office mate or work mate,  Another thing I like here is that they won\'t let you be left behind in the tasks, and with every lesson or project that is finished you always learn something that will be used in your future, and last of all what I liked the most here is how approachable they are, every time they see you they will always greet you', 'I liked the most here is how approachable they are as a office mate.', 'Right now, in my opinion, there is nothing that can be improved, based on what I have seen and learned, there is nothing that needs to be improved for me.', 'put some bread in the pantry so that coffee has a partner..... joke only  thanks for all learnings and knowledge', '2025-01-06 13:46:24', '2025-01-06 13:46:24'),
(120, 1, 98, 100, 'What I like the most is  the tasks, It is really challenging that makes me learn compared to the learnings from school. And also the trainers that is really approachable.', 'None', 'Weekly report on that specific project, so the future trainees know what they have learn and they have missed or errors. Collaborations work is also good for the trainees to communicate with other and teach each other', 'none', '2025-01-06 13:48:18', '2025-01-06 13:48:18');
