(121, 1, 217, 88, 'I like how we can learn things on our own and discussing it with my fellow classmates so we can expand our knowledge and learn the mistakes, also the free time anytime and coffee.', 'nothing to be honest, I just don\'t like waking up very early but it doesnt  involve the company', 'i already feel satisfied with how things are so i dont have any suggestions', 'nothing', '2025-01-22 13:49:31', '2025-01-22 13:49:31'),
(122, 1, 156, 76, 'The way they teach and guide us', 'none', 'more patient', 'none', '2025-01-23 06:53:42', '2025-01-23 06:53:42'),
(123, 1, 172, 76, 'They are approachable and they treat the interns like one of them', 'None', 'stay like what they really are and more patient to interns', 'nothing, i have good experience here in frontline', '2025-01-23 06:56:02', '2025-01-23 06:56:02'),
(124, 1, 174, 96, 'i like about how difficult but fun the fbs ojt', 'none', 'none', 'i am genuinely thankful for experiencing this kind of journey in my life, it was hard but i enjoy everything that we did. I will surely miss fbs :)', '2025-01-23 12:40:24', '2025-01-23 12:40:24'),
(125, 1, 168, 100, 'THEY HELPED US A LOT AND ALSO THEY GAVE A SUCH INFORMATION THAT WE CAN USE IN OUR COLLEGE LIFE AND  THEIR QUALITY AND HIGHTECH COMPUTER THAT WE ARE YOU USING  TO ENJOY AND TO LEARN THIS OJT PROGRAM. THANKYOU LCSS!!!!', 'NOTHING', 'NOTHING BECAUSE IM SATISFIED', 'JUST TO FEEL FREE AND KEEP TEACHING OTHER SENIORS FOR THEIR FUTURE', '2025-01-23 13:04:37', '2025-01-23 13:04:37'),
