(127, 1, 157, 96, 'I like the trainings that we do everyday', 'Non', 'I suggest to check the computers because some computers are lagging', 'None', '2025-01-23 13:07:32', '2025-01-23 13:07:32'),
(128, 1, 163, 100, 'The approachability of all the employees.', 'Nothing', 'None', '.', '2025-01-23 13:22:47', '2025-01-23 13:22:47'),
(129, 1, 181, 100, 'The Collaboration ,The Care, that they gave us the balance time about work and learn about personal lives,. And we gain more knowledge ,about life, and academics and work.', 'None.', 'Is to improve the Fingerprint scanner for the future OJT Students that are going to join to Frontline Business Solutions', 'I Had a great time here in Frontline it was a great learning experience all the knowledge that i gain through good to bad it was all detailed towards me.', '2025-01-23 14:44:09', '2025-01-23 14:44:09'),
(130, 1, 175, 92, 'The trainors,  they are too kind, and helpful to me during my work immersion weeks here at FBS', 'Nothing, all good for me', 'There\'s  no need to suggest because all here are great and I don\'t see any negative things here at FBS', 'Thank you, Frontline Business Solution.', '2025-01-23 14:49:14', '2025-01-23 14:49:14'),
(131, 1, 192, 92, 'the trainee, staff, and the quality service', 'nothing, i like everything about FBS OJT PROGRAM', 'I have no words on what to improve because the FBS OJT PROGRAM is balance and good', 'i like to thank the trainee for being kind and having the best humor', '2025-01-23 14:49:21', '2025-01-23 14:49:21'),
(132, 1, 193, 88, 'the computer and how they teach us', 'nothing EVERYTHING IS GOOD', 'ADD CANTEEN', 'NOTHING', '2025-01-23 14:49:28', '2025-01-23 14:49:28'),
(133, 1, 177, 92, 'the well maintained and air conditioned training room', 'maaga ang pasok', 'add more buildings', 'the first is their beautiful location, and ofc here in FBS the staff members will accomodate you incredibly and approach you genuinely.', '2025-01-23 14:55:38', '2025-01-23 14:55:38'),
(134, 1, 165, 96, 'What I like the most is the kindness treatment we\'ve received from the trainers and staff. All of them are kind and approachable.', 'I am indeed satisfied with everything.', 'There is no suggestion I would like because I am satisfied with everything here at FBS, free coffee, kind staff and trainers, and also the aircon. ^^', 'I would like to say thank you so much to all trainers here and also to the staffs and employee here. We learned a lot from you and we\'ve improved a lot. Thank you Frontline Business Solutions!', '2025-01-23 14:59:03', '2025-01-23 14:59:03'),
(135, 1, 183, 96, 'what i like the most about FBS is how the company is  manage and how the trainers who handle the work immersion are patient and kind', 'For me , there\'s nothing to criticize because the trainers are able to teach us everything we need to learn', 'nothing', 'nothing', '2025-01-24 07:06:24', '2025-01-24 07:06:24'),
(136, 1, 153, 100, 'What I like most in FBS is their employees is approachable and there are many things you will learn here', 'For me, there\'s nothing I don\'t like in FBS', 'Nothing, just keep doing what they thought us', 'Nothing', '2025-01-24 07:08:00', '2025-01-24 07:08:00'),
(137, 1, 173, 92, 'When they teach us how to work on excel and learn how to improve yourself', 'When we\'re working on balancing, and I\'m having a hard time, but still I was able to accomplish them all', 'Nothing', 'I learned so many things about excel, and how to work on the formulas', '2025-01-24 07:27:31', '2025-01-24 07:27:31'),
(138, 1, 154, 100, 'ANG PINKANG NAGUSTUHAN KO SA COMPANY NATO AY KUNG PANO MAKI HALUBILO ANG MGA EMPLOYEE DITO AT SA MGA TRAINER NAMAN AY SOBRANG MABABAIT NAITUTURO NILA BAWAT ISA AT MAAYOS', 'YUNG LUGAR PO', 'WALA PO', 'WALA PO', '2025-01-24 09:27:12', '2025-01-24 09:27:12'),
(139, 1, 169, 100, 'Great discipline', 'none', 'everything is great', 'Sir Ansbert\'s way of teaching is very commendable', '2025-01-24 09:28:59', '2025-01-24 09:28:59'),
(140, 1, 203, 80, 'Nagustuhan ko yung mga tinuturo ng mga trainers samin kahit na medyo mahirap ay masaya padin maraming natutunan', 'Yung ibang gawain na hindi ko natapos kasi nahihirapan ako pero okay lang', 'nothing po pagpatuloy nyo lang po mga tinuturo nyo kasi masaya po', 'wala na po', '2025-01-24 09:29:51', '2025-01-24 09:29:51'),
(141, 1, 150, 52, 'i learned something from coding', 'nothing', 'nothing', 'i practice coding on my house to improve my skills', '2025-01-24 09:30:44', '2025-01-24 09:30:44'),
(142, 1, 159, 80, 'When it comes to coding and hearing others share their life experiences, I’ve learned a lot. These can serve as lessons for me, so when I encounter similar situations in the future, I’ll know what to do or how to solve them to avoid any issues. What really stuck in my mind is that life isn’t as simple as doing nothing—you have to make an effort and find ways to address things.', 'Everything\'s good. Coding is a bit challenging, but it\'s manageable because the way it\'s being taught makes it easier to understand.', 'Don\'t teach too fast because not everyone can keep up', 'the working environment is great.', '2025-01-24 09:33:23', '2025-01-24 09:33:23'),
(143, 1, 162, 88, 'Although we have a shorter period of time in here, as our immersion is only limited for 10 days - i learned a lot and have experienced, what it feels to be in a working place. In addition, I\'m also satisfied on the trainers that we have - they are so nice to all of us and handy.', 'Although, I\'m extremely satisfied in here - there are somethings that i want to point out (in my own opinion). The first one is the \"Web designing\" course - it was insightful but it lacks something. As what were doing is like route learning (we\'re just repeating what is shown on the screen) - i just wish that we have something like a task that could test, what we have learned and critical thinking. Second, i suggested that after the basic of web designing and introduction is done, student should be given an assignment - wherein they will comeup and design their very own website.', 'Frontline OJT program in my opinion is good but it still need some refinement - there should be more task like challenge and assignment , that will test and apply the knowledge of the students.', 'I would like to thank! all our trainers, especially for to our coding trainer.  To be honest, when i first entered Frontline my expectation were very low (since coding is so broad and hard to learn) - but it turns out, i was wrong. Over the span of 10 days, i do learn a lot of coding and i was now able to start a coding project on my own.  I wouldn\'t say I\'m  PRO in coding - but i would say, i will practice and learn more about it.', '2025-01-24 09:38:40', '2025-01-24 09:38:40'),
(144, 1, 158, 100, 'What i like most about the frontline is the teaching about accounting and the PLE which really helps up grow and change our negative thoughts.', 'None', 'i make sure the computers and keyboards are okay because sometimes some take a long time to load and the keyboard does not work properly.', 'none', '2025-01-24 09:39:44', '2025-01-24 09:39:44'),
(145, 1, 151, 88, 'I like that, while Frontline Business Solutions regularly enforce rules and regulations in order to make us prepare and expect what having a job is like, they still allow some bit of leeway as me and the rest of the students here are all new and aren\'t fully used to the sudden change in policies. I find that great as I know I will make mistakes even though I\'m trying my best so having warnings or lighter repercussions for minor offenses are nice.', 'I don\'t really have any gripes with the program, but if I have to, I\'ll say that the sudden changes in schedule, such as the sudden extension of deadlines, or having to PLE\'s back to back messes up my time management a bit as I now have to be a bit unprepared for what will happen next.', 'One suggestion I would have is to make sure that everyone is alerted of the possibility of a schedule change along with what will happen afterwards so everyone knows what will happen and can prepare themselves for it.', 'None, as I really have nothing else to comment about this program since I\'ve find the entirety of it to be enjoyable, valuable, and memorable and will be ever grateful for being given an opportunity like this.', '2025-01-24 09:45:13', '2025-01-24 09:45:13'),
(146, 1, 188, 100, 'how they treat and welcomed everyone nicely, especially sir ansbert best trainer ihihih', 'none, im happy here kung pede lang po mag extend e', 'none', 'mamimiss ko to super', '2025-01-24 10:27:43', '2025-01-24 10:27:43'),
(147, 1, 209, 100, 'jamming and learning with sir ans', 'nothing', 'just keep this kind of treatment  & teaching, that\'ll do', 'mamimiss ka namin sir ans,  AWIT', '2025-01-24 12:40:55', '2025-01-24 12:40:55'),
(148, 1, 167, 60, 'THE ENVIRONMENT', 'PLE ITS GIVING ME A WAY TO BE A BETTER STUDENT', 'NONE BECAUSE ITS PERPRCT', 'ROR ME THE FBS IS 10/10!', '2025-01-24 13:57:57', '2025-01-24 13:57:57'),
(149, 1, 255, 72, 'i think id say how they treat the trainees, they are really kind to us and i love it. when teaching us they really want to ensure that we know what were doing and make sure that we learn something from them. Ms. herlyn is very kind, i like her the most and she boost my confidence.', 'id say the air conditioner, bcs its too cold hehe', 'more teaching skills i think? but theyre good enough.', 'ms. herlyn deserves a promotion.', '2025-02-03 07:43:30', '2025-02-03 07:43:30'),
(150, 1, 205, 68, 'WIFI and AC', 'the hole on the ceiling at CR', 'more activity', 'none', '2025-02-06 12:24:03', '2025-02-06 12:24:03'),
(151, 1, 246, 84, 'Satisfied', 'im so very Satisfied', 'rooms', 'no more', '2025-02-06 12:25:10', '2025-02-06 12:25:10'),
(152, 1, 258, 96, 'I LIKE THEIR TEACHING BECAUSE THE TEACHERS WERE PLEASANT AND THEY TEACH WHEN WE DONT KNOW TO DO', 'NOTHING', 'GIVE THOSE THEY TEACH MORE TIME TO WHAT THEY ARE DOING', 'NOTHING', '2025-02-06 12:37:12', '2025-02-06 12:37:12'),
(153, 1, 206, 80, 'everything\'s is good', 'everything', 'nothing', 'none', '2025-02-06 15:34:30', '2025-02-06 15:34:30'),
(154, 1, 249, 80, 'making report', '.', 'none', 'nothing', '2025-02-06 15:35:41', '2025-02-06 15:35:41'),
(155, 1, 260, 80, 'ang pinaka nagustuhan ko sa FBS PROGRAM ayb ang mga trainer na magaling magturo', 'i like the coffe', 'none because i am satisfied to the company service3', 'igusto ko bumalik dito minsan', '2025-02-06 15:37:22', '2025-02-06 15:37:22'),
(156, 1, 204, 92, 'They teach abt improving self, also how they teach us because they are not judge you if i am wrong and giving me a advice', 'i think being strict but this is for us or in the future', 'being not faster to teach because i am slow learner :))', 'nothing, thank you', '2025-02-07 06:41:16', '2025-02-07 06:41:16'),
(157, 1, 244, 28, 'making memoranmdum', 'making memo randum', 'nyhing', 'none', '2025-02-07 06:41:17', '2025-02-07 06:41:17'),
(158, 1, 194, 100, 'There are plenty of things that I liked in the FBS company. To tell you what I liked most, is the trainers. They are the one who guided us throughout this journey of our work immersion. I would like to give my highest credits to them.', 'It is hard to tell something that I dont like with this company, if I need to tell one thing the I least like, i would say it is the coffee from the pantry that made me palpitate.', 'I am looking forward for the growth of this company. That time will come, that they will be capable of hiring more immersionists and interns.', 'I am so thankful with the FBS company. Specially to my mentors, Miss Herlyn, and Miss Thea. With their supervision and guidance it helped  to make every work successful. Continue inspiring and guiding students. I would definitely leave FBS company with a lot of professional skills in my field of study ,and of course all of the learning will help to build my character as a person and as a future employer or employee. I highly recommend FBS company to be be part of your immersion program.', '2025-02-07 07:00:04', '2025-02-07 07:00:04'),
(159, 1, 237, 100, 'THE PLE PROGRAM', 'NONE', 'NO SUGGESTION', 'NO MORE', '2025-02-07 07:02:58', '2025-02-07 07:02:58'),
(160, 1, 221, 48, 'I liked learning about excel though it was only surface-level, I would have liked to delve deeper into it. Although I might not be able to use it in my future career path it was entertaining. on an unrelated note the food from the cafeteria is *very* good, better than all school cafeterias; on one of the days they literally served nilagang bulalo for 70 and it was good enough for two people, very exquisite.', 'It was \"too stuck to the books\" we didn\'t really do any \"real\" work and it felt as if I was just going to school but using a computer rather than actually immersing into work.', 'Make us do actual work, at least select a few trustable students to the tasks.', 'The food was really good.', '2025-02-07 07:03:22', '2025-02-07 07:03:22'),
(161, 1, 252, 100, 'mababait po ang mga tao dito at marami po talagang natututunan at masaya dito sa frontline', 'none', 'none', 'thank you', '2025-02-07 07:06:19', '2025-02-07 07:06:19'),
(162, 1, 210, 76, 'Excel Trainings', 'None', 'More Teachings', 'None', '2025-02-07 07:07:29', '2025-02-07 07:07:29'),
(163, 1, 213, 92, 'They are very patient on teaching us and they are also very professional yet friendly. I do also enjoy listening and learning in FBS.', 'Its not that its the least thing I like in FBS,. its more on im just shocked how strict they are when it comes to time and dresscode. And also they give so many task.', 'FBS is already good in their OJT Program but i hope they give considerations when  it comes to late comers that has reasons.', 'Thank you for giving us opportunities to have new knowledge and for being patient with us despite the fact that we are being unprofessional sometimes and very noisy.', '2025-02-07 07:09:30', '2025-02-07 07:09:30'),
(164, 1, 220, 72, 'The information that they wanted to teach us is really useful, and I appreciate how well they were able to teach us skills that would be more than enough to say that we\'re qualified for certain things in the field once we cultivate the information that was taught on our own. Opportunities have become more varied and wider than I was initially hoping it to be, and that\'s pretty valuable.', 'Nothing much-- It\'s facilities and other aspects are all satisfactory. (P.S. I also really really like the food-- Hats off to the chef and other staff-- I\'m gonna miss it when we go back to our school\'s canteen)', 'Better selection of schools to be open for OJT Programs.\nSTMS was not the way to go-\nI hope our proctor and other staff members weren\'t too burned out from my class\' blatant--\nFor lack of a better word, indecency.', 'The food is great :DDD\nI hope you all get to enjoy it comfortably for years to come (Assuming none of ya\'ll plan to leave- [In that case- Good luck to you!])', '2025-02-07 07:09:53', '2025-02-07 07:09:53'),
(165, 1, 230, 88, 'The trainers at FBS are kind and good at teaching, and I learned a lot because of it, as well as treating us like employees because they show what a real employee feels like.', 'Nothing', 'I don\'t have any suggestion because for me FBS is already good, because they treat the students as employee as well as Teaching Personal Learning Environment that helps the students improve their Personality', 'Its Fun Learning in FBS  : D', '2025-02-07 07:09:57', '2025-02-07 07:09:57'),
