(167, 1, 259, 88, 'What i liked the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM is their services.', 'I  like of how can they get along with OJT\'S like us.', 'So far nothing because they are good at communication and also teaching us.', 'Thank you for the 10 days, I learned not to be shy to speak up infront, and also thank you Ms. Herlyn your so kind and approachable.', '2025-02-07 07:11:17', '2025-02-07 07:11:17'),
(168, 1, 248, 100, 'what i like the most here in frontline is the professionalism of the people here. i love how they treat us as an employee not as students. as a senior highschool students I dont like being babied by the teacher. i also enjoyed the experience here.', 'the schedule and the tasks that was given to us. medyo nahirapan sa tasks siguro gawa na rin ng pressure sa deadline', 'improve their communication skllls', 'THE BEST PANTRY \nBEAUTIFUL CR (COMFY MAG CR)\nNOT SUFFOCATING', '2025-02-07 07:12:24', '2025-02-07 07:12:24'),
