(173, 1, 240, 96, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the opportunity to gain hands-on experience in a real work environment. It allowed me to apply my skills, learn from professionals, and develop a deeper understanding of how the industry operates.', 'What I liked least about the OJT Program was that, time sometimes felt too short to finish tasks. However, it taught me to manage my time efficiently and make the most out of every task.', 'I suggest extending the duration or providing more hands-on tasks to maximize learning opportunities.', 'I really appreciated the guidance and support from the mentors, especially Ms.Thea during the OJT Program.<3', '2025-02-07 07:15:28', '2025-02-07 07:15:28'),
(174, 1, 223, 84, 'gained new knowledge, the experience and found other skills.', 'lack of clear objectives or expectations', 'gather feedback from trainees and mentors', 'none', '2025-02-07 07:16:02', '2025-02-07 07:16:02'),
(175, 1, 243, 88, 'their teaching is not only about our strand but they are teaching things about life like PUT GOD FIRST, they are teaching things that we need both spiritually and physically.', 'What I liked most about the frontline was their passion and Christianity', 'Devotion and sharing. so that the students\' day can start happy and full of encouragement and also so that they can grow spiritually.', 'BFS is okay, it\'s fun and I\'m learned a lot even though it\'s tiring and it hurts my eyes. I learn a lot and the coffee is delicious. I plan to work here when the time comes. continue to grow and God Bless us', '2025-02-07 07:16:07', '2025-02-07 07:16:07'),
(176, 1, 226, 96, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is that they let us experience real life work.', 'Nothing', 'I don\'t have any suggestions.', 'I\'m grateful for the experience and I\'m excited to apply the knowledge and skills I learned.', '2025-02-07 07:16:13', '2025-02-07 07:16:13'),
(177, 1, 224, 88, 'The practical experience provided in a work environment was my favorite aspect of the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program. It gave me a great chance to put the knowledge I had learned in school to use in practical situations, which really enhanced the learning experience. I was exposed to a business\'s daily operations through the program, and I found it immensely beneficial to observe firsthand how several departments work together to accomplish shared objectives. I really valued the mentorship I got during the course of the program. I was able to improve my technical proficiency and comprehension of workplace dynamics with the support of seasoned specialists. I felt secure in my skills and prepared because my supervisors gave me constructive criticism that was meant to promote progress.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'I would like to take a moment to express my sincere gratitude for the incredible opportunity to be part of the OJT program. The experience has been truly enriching, and I’ve gained valuable insights that will undoubtedly shape my career moving forward. I appreciate the guidance, support, and knowledge shared by everyone throughout the program.', '2025-02-07 07:18:23', '2025-02-07 07:18:23'),
(178, 1, 227, 64, 'Most of the trainers were professional and I have gained more knowledge about ABM related work', 'When the office for biometrics opens late or takes a long time to open because we schedule time to arrive early, then when we get there we can\'t immediately do the biometrics.', 'Maybe assign a personel to open the office for biometrics earlier', 'hahahahh wala na po', '2025-02-07 07:18:58', '2025-02-07 07:18:58'),
(179, 1, 236, 76, 'The quality of teaching', 'The time amount, It\'s not enough to finish the difficulty of task', 'Improve the Time for those students that is not that good when it comes to computer', 'I love the environment of FBS!!', '2025-02-07 07:19:49', '2025-02-07 07:19:49'),
(180, 1, 238, 84, 'Opportunities for growth and development', 'so strict in time when passing a task', 'being fair to the workers', 'TAHNK YOU FOR 2 WEEKS !!', '2025-02-07 07:21:17', '2025-02-07 07:21:17'),
(181, 1, 239, 88, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the hands-on experience and exposure to real-world business. Also, the PLE program I learned how to grow, to know my priorities and purpose in life, and etc.  I also liked the approachable and supportive nature of the employees/trainer. They were willing to lend a helping hand, answer my questions, and provide guidance whenever I needed it.', 'What I liked least about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the strict policies and guidelines.  Also, i felt unfair treatment in our trainer.', 'Ensure that all trainees are treated fairly and without bias.', 'I hope in the future, FBS will continue to improve and provide a more supportive and inclusive environment for trainees. Thank you FBS for making my work immersion experience productive and enjoyable.', '2025-02-07 07:21:17', '2025-02-07 07:21:17'),
(182, 1, 231, 44, 'kind and approachable trainer', 'give limited time in every given task resulting to not finishing it on time', 'provide student with clear expectation', 'non', '2025-02-07 07:23:08', '2025-02-07 07:23:08'),
(183, 1, 234, 84, 'a balancing', 'all', 'become a entrep', 'none', '2025-02-07 07:25:20', '2025-02-07 07:25:20'),
(184, 1, 222, 96, 'What I liked about the FBS OJT PROGRAM was the experience and exposure to real-world  business operations. Also, I appreciate the opportunity to work with a team of professionals who were passionate about their work and willing to share their expertise, the staffs and other employees are very approachable.', 'The FBS are strict when it comes to attire and time.', 'Additional training sessions, providing more training sessions on specific software, systems, and processes would help trainees develop a stronger foundation in this areas.', 'Thankyou FBS for providing me with the opportunity to participate in your OJT PROGRAM.', '2025-02-07 07:29:38', '2025-02-07 07:29:38'),
(185, 1, 229, 100, 'I like how FBS care for us. I am very satisfied with the services they offer because my whole 10 days of being here, I did not experience any disappointment. I also like our PLE time, I learned a lot. It is very nice that FBS did not just only about works, it is also about our whole physically, mentally, and spiritually wellbeing.', 'Nothing.  :>', 'I know there is a room for improvement but based on what I experienced, they are perfect; their services, staffs, environment, are PERFECT!', 'I would like to thank the whole Frontline Business Solutions Inc. for making my Grade 12 journey memorable. There is a lot of core memories that worth cherish for.  I would also like to thank Miss Herlyn Mae Torres for her patience, care, and being kind to us.  She always motivates us by saying \"Kaya niyo \'yan, gusto kong makita ang improvement niyo\" and that means a lot to us. From day 1 to day 10, she is always there for us. Miss Herlyn, if you are reading this, sobrang mami-miss po namin ikaw. Maraming maraming salamat po sa lahat. Also Miss thea, thank you po sa dalawang araw na puno ng \"Mam paano nga po ulit ito?\" HAHAHAHA.\n\nThank you so much for this wonderful experience, FBS. We are gonna meet again, promise.', '2025-02-07 07:44:54', '2025-02-07 07:44:54'),
