(198, 1, 289, 96, 'The hands-on experience provide by Frontline Business Solutions OJT program is what I value the most. It allows us to apply our knowledge real-world setting, fostering, essential skills development and adaptation to a professional environment. The mentorship and collaborative opportunities helps us enhance our growth and future career prospects.', 'It was initial difficulty in adjusting to new tasks and responsibilities. From editing to coding, to make a website its really mind-blowing. There\'s a question in my mind, how? How can this be possible for me to do it on my own? Because I don\'t even have a background about it.  But although its hard it became a valuable learning experience.', 'I suggest to have a more clearer instructions because it was hard to keep on pace most especially to an individual who require additional support. Through this they can easily adjust and gain confidence in their work.', 'Thankyou FBS for the opportunity and valuable experience during my immersion. I truly appreciate the learning and support! This is a big part of my experience as a Grade 12 students and I\'ll always cherish it.', '2025-02-19 07:31:46', '2025-02-19 07:31:46'),
