(232, 1, 339, 100, 'What stand out the most is the hands-on experience. It allows deeper understanding of the field, application skills, and learning from the professionals already establish in the field.  it can also offer the opportunity to develop our problem solving skills in real-time programs', 'None', 'I would like to suggest is to have a bigger space for individuals or built a locker where the trainees things can be placed but in overall its fine', 'It\'s such a very very very wonderful experience,  hopefully po sa college is dito ulit ako', '2025-03-07 07:53:58', '2025-03-07 07:53:58'),
(233, 1, 297, 96, 'I love the environment, especially mentioning the people here.  The view of the places are refreshing and calming, the people are lovely, knowledgeable, yet fun. The learning system and the teachers unique ways of teaching are efficient, very professional and enjoyable.', 'none', 'have something like a training client \"for work immersion clients\" to make students feel the working fields/working environment more.', 'I love it here. The people, place, doings, and me myself when I\'m in an environment that influences my thinking and attitude.', '2025-03-07 10:41:47', '2025-03-07 10:41:47'),
(234, 1, 353, 100, 'I like PLE\'s, it helped me somehow to know more about leadership. also, the way they teach us things about web development, I learned a lot.', 'N/A', 'N/A', 'I like the coffee :))', '2025-03-28 10:31:20', '2025-03-28 10:31:20'),
(235, 1, 352, 100, 'I learned a deeper understanding about web designing from figma to html, css, js.', 'I\'m not sugar coating but there is nothing i liked the least', 'I have nothing to suggest as of the moment, given that everything fulfills what i need and what i want.', 'None', '2025-03-28 10:32:10', '2025-03-28 10:32:10'),
(236, 1, 355, 92, 'yung sa teaching nila like marami kaming natutunan na mga techniques, approaches lalo sa figma html css js lahat pala', 'wala naman po since lahat dito ay maganda ang healthy nung environment super', 'wala naman po', 'i like coffee, tsaka yung facilities malinis malamig', '2025-03-28 10:32:23', '2025-03-28 10:32:23'),
(237, 1, 317, 100, 'I liked the fact that it wasn\'t entirely about programming or designing. We learned valuable life lesson along the way. Being a trainee here at FBS has taught me to be resilient and easygoing.', 'None, I had no problems during my stay here at FBS. The staff were caring and friendly. They welcomed us with open arms and taught us alot.', 'Nothing because it was perfect', 'Thank you for the experience and the lessons you taught us', '2025-03-28 10:35:26', '2025-03-28 10:35:26'),
(238, 1, 328, 96, 'Yung kape na libre at magandang aral tunkol sa web developing', 'masyadong malayo saamin', 'keep up the free coffee and add more cups and group activities', 'Salamat sa libreng kape', '2025-03-28 10:36:12', '2025-03-28 10:36:12'),
(239, 1, 320, 100, 'I liked the technical part of the FBS OJT program the most because I actually enhanced my skills here. Also, the workspace is another part that I absolutely loved.', 'I didn\'t dislike anything about the OJT program in particular.', 'Maybe group activities would be fun.', 'I have no further comments.', '2025-03-28 10:36:26', '2025-03-28 10:36:26'),
(240, 1, 322, 96, 'Being treated as new employees by being able to use facilities of staff, biometric authenticators and more. I did enjoy the whole process and tasks especially with our trainers.', 'Location being far from the main road.', 'I don\'t really have any suggestions but I guess some kind of group activity/teamwork to enhance that aspect.', 'Thank you for the internship, I would like to be back here someday! KEEP IT UP', '2025-03-28 10:37:50', '2025-03-28 10:37:50'),
(241, 1, 327, 100, 'Mga nagturo sa amin po at ang mga worker po dito dahil po di lang sa pag program lang ang tinuro kundi pati mentally and spiritually and emotionally. Bihira lang ang ganun company at naeenjoy ko siya at sa mga ginagawa.', 'yung aircon po sobra lamig HAHAHAHa jk po wala po.', 'Being proffesional and careful using a word to a student and prevent using words \"OA\"', 'If I ever have a chances to ojt here or work here I will grab the chances to accept here again and again.', '2025-03-28 10:38:40', '2025-03-28 10:38:40'),
(242, 1, 331, 84, 'I like the location of the frontline, and I also like how generous they are with the free coffee.', 'The least thing that i like is the heat outside FBS', 'I don\'t have anything in mind so i think FBS is fine for me', 'i dont have any comments', '2025-03-28 11:52:59', '2025-03-28 11:52:59'),
(243, 1, 321, 88, 'facilities and projects', 'coffee', 'none', 'Thankyou fbs fam', '2025-03-28 12:04:42', '2025-03-28 12:04:42'),
(244, 1, 319, 92, 'almost all of it. including:\nfacilities\nenvironment\nan etc.', 'keyboard', 'i guess sa equipments lang, like keyboard and etc', 'that\'s all thank you^^', '2025-03-28 12:42:20', '2025-03-28 12:42:20'),
(245, 1, 318, 100, 'Facilities\nSupportive Mentors\nSkill Development', 'nothing', 'nothing', 'THANK YOU FBS!!', '2025-03-28 12:43:11', '2025-03-28 12:43:11'),
(246, 1, 323, 100, 'for me its not just the unli coffee but on how they handle us like an employee, even tho i made a lot of mistakes they still teach us properly.', 'none', 'for me none', 'this is a great experience for me, fbs made me gain a lot of knowledge, not just in programming but to be my self more and fbs also teach me on how to deal with my problems and how to fix it so i am really thankful for fbs for this opportunity.', '2025-03-28 12:45:59', '2025-03-28 12:45:59'),
(247, 1, 326, 96, 'friendly environment within and out of the workspace & comprehensive learning and teaching methods (bonus: unlimited coffee)', 'limited working days (only 9-10 days) i guess and teaching method in ple', 'better teaching method in ple', '9/10, would go here for OJT again if given the chance', '2025-03-28 12:46:54', '2025-03-28 12:46:54'),
(248, 1, 325, 96, 'What I like about the FBS training program is that people here are nice, they also taught me a lot of things i didn\'t know about programming, the FBS facilities  also made me focus in coding without any distractions, lastly they have free coffee.', 'absolutely nothing (for now)', 'more coffee please, but in all seriousness I am satisfied with the program itself and for me its already good as it is.', 'more coffee please', '2025-03-28 12:48:09', '2025-03-28 12:48:09');
INSERT INTO `lcssv2_trainee_evaluation` (`trainee_evaluation_aid`, `trainee_evaluation_is_active`, `trainee_evaluation_trainee_id`, `trainee_evaluation_ratings`, `trainee_evaluation_like_most`, `trainee_evaluation_like_least`, `trainee_evaluation_to_improve`, `trainee_evaluation_other_comments`, `trainee_evaluation_created`, `trainee_evaluation_datetime`) VALUES
(249, 1, 354, 96, 'I think i  like the most about the Frontline Business is the culture or the environment they have.', 'One area that could be improved is the variety or challenge level of assigned tasks. While the program provided a good foundation, there were moments where the work felt a bit repetitive or didn’t fully utilize our potential or technical skills. Having more opportunities to work on real-world projects or collaborate in teams on more complex problems could make the experience even more engaging and educational.', 'The one that i suggest is i want a website for their ojt like me the tools they use n industry i want a website that it has all the link of tools or other that we can use in education or own project because i think it was help full for me as a students.', 'i just want to thanks to the worker, proctor, and the staff of Frontline Business because they are all approachable and nice to all students ojt\'s, thank youuu ma\'am sir for joining our class to your industry for trying what you do in real work...', '2025-03-28 12:52:47', '2025-03-28 12:52:47'),
(250, 1, 330, 100, 'I like the most environment and people around here', 'none', 'I guess none', 'I have no comments all goods', '2025-03-28 12:57:18', '2025-03-28 12:57:18'),
(251, 1, 357, 100, 'One of the things I liked the most in FBS OJT Program is we have learned a lot of technical techniques, program, and other knowledge that is being used in the industry that we can apply in our school works, personal project, and in our future journey. FBS also have a very approachable instructor and peaceful environment that help us to not get burnout in our task and learn more.', 'I personally didn\'t have any things I don\'t like in the FBS OJT Program', 'I think I can suggest that FBS OJT Program can teach more about the industry standard---since we as a student, we have learned a lot of things in FBS that is being used in the industry such as creating an organized structure in html, make a clean and more readable css structure, and others that we didn\'t learn from our school.', 'I learned a lot of things here in FBS, it allows me to explore more technical skills and it also gave us experience', '2025-03-28 13:08:32', '2025-03-28 13:08:32'),
(252, 1, 324, 92, 'There is a lot of advantageous things here as they help you develop a sense of design for web while also improving your self confidence but with everything the times we have spent with the trainers are certainly the best', 'The fact that there wasnt really a lot of group activities that can try and improve teamwork', 'Add more group activities in which people could improve their sense of leadership.', 'non', '2025-04-02 07:06:44', '2025-04-02 07:06:44'),
(253, 1, 329, 92, 'It helps you in hand-on programming and designing for a web design and gives valuable skills and information about the future', 'It was more on solo work, there isn\'t any grouped activities or projects to work on', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2025-04-02 07:07:10', '2025-04-02 07:07:10'),
(254, 1, 356, 100, 'Learning about new things that i didn\'t even know of, like new shortcuts for coding and making a interactable figma web', 'None.\nEverything that i have experienced within my time here has been absolutely great.', 'N/A', 'Thank you for having me , and experience here is absolutely awesome', '2025-04-02 07:08:01', '2025-04-02 07:08:01'),
(255, 1, 291, 100, 'As I always say, we learn by doing and not just by reading and memorizing.', 'In all honesty, there\'s nothing I dislike about FBS. They checked all the criteria of what a good company is.', 'A change in training room once in a while. Sometimes we need to be in a different environment, even if it is just in another training room.', 'Keep cultivating the students to the best they can be.', '2025-04-04 12:14:48', '2025-04-04 12:14:48'),
(256, 1, 295, 100, 'The environment of the workplace, the friendliness of fellow trainees and trainers, and the knowledge I have gained throughout the various projects that we did.', 'None', 'none', 'none', '2025-04-04 12:14:59', '2025-04-04 12:14:59'),
(257, 1, 261, 100, 'There\'s so many knowledge that we get from FBS OJT Program and its fun to be part of this ojt program', 'Just the new instructors they should be familiarize the teaching', 'Just continue those things that you do', 'none', '2025-04-04 12:15:23', '2025-04-04 12:15:23'),
(258, 1, 279, 100, 'What I like about the OJT Program of FBS is the Hands on Teaching and the overall experience of the OJT Program', 'The least thing I like about the OJT Program is the 7 Am start of work', 'Have a JavaScript course before going to React', 'N/A', '2025-04-28 06:45:54', '2025-04-28 06:45:54'),
(259, 1, 269, 100, 'The facility is great, and there is unli coffee.', 'I don\'t think I have any', 'A place to hangout (tambayan)', 'None', '2025-05-09 12:33:14', '2025-05-09 12:33:14'),
(260, 1, 267, 100, 'What I like the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM is that the everyone is very welcoming and the environment is very accommodating. I learned a lot not just in terms of improving my skills but also improve as a person.', 'I can\'t really think about anything that I could say that I don\'t like about the OJT PROGRAM', 'I don\'t really have any suggestions that I could think of', 'None', '2025-05-16 10:42:13', '2025-05-16 10:42:13'),
(261, 1, 274, 100, 'What i liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is how approachable and helpful the people are', 'What i liked least about the program is the start time of 7 am, because i am not used to waking up early', 'I don\'t have any suggestions for improvements, because i am extremely satisfied with the current operations of the OJT program', 'None', '2025-05-16 10:42:45', '2025-05-16 10:42:45'),
(262, 1, 275, 100, 'A lot of instructors have a profound ways of teaching us there methods when it comes to the task at hand.', 'Sometimes they can be very strict when it comes to time.', 'I\'m satisfied with the current standard for FBS.', 'none.', '2025-05-16 10:50:51', '2025-05-16 10:50:51'),
(263, 1, 276, 100, 'What I like the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is they teach everything from the scratch from basic to advance that I can be used in a real word project in the future.', 'They are very strict when it comes to time.', 'I can\'t think of anything since I am very satisfied about Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM.', 'None.', '2025-05-16 10:51:24', '2025-05-16 10:51:24'),
(264, 1, 235, 100, 'What I like the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program are multiple things. One is the company experience. The inclusive and very friendly community within the company is what I really enjoyed, it made me feel like I really belonged to the community. The other is the amount of things that I have learned through the FBS OJT Program. I was able to develop more skills in front end programming, learn about managing and designing a website through wordpress, and so much more. This OJT experience left me with so much knowledge compared to before. This gives me a wider range of career opportunities to undergo in the future and I\'m really thankful for FBS for this.', 'There isn\'t anything about the FBS OJT Program that I would say that I like the least. All my expectations were met and I am very satisfied with my OJT experience.', 'In terms of suggestions for the FBS OJT Program, I would most likely suggest the teaching of other different React frameworks such as Next.js.', 'I would like to thank the FBS staff and all the instructors for accommodating me in my OJT journey. This experience has left me with a lot of knowledge and has opened new opportunities for me in the future. I sincerely would like to thank you from the bottom of my heart.', '2025-05-20 11:06:18', '2025-05-20 11:06:18'),
(265, 1, 282, 100, 'I deeply appreciated the hands-on approach, guidance and support from WEB-LCS Team especially from Ms. Thea. Also, when new tasks and discussions were introduced, as well as the fellowship and devotion that contributes on my personal development. Additionally, the work environment was engaging and fun, and the task were truly beneficial on my future career.', 'I honestly don’t have anything I dislike about the FBS OJT Program, everything about it has been a great learning experience. But, If I had to point out one little challenge, it would be that whenever I finish my task quickly, I feel a bit uneasy having nothing to do while everyone else is still busy.', 'I think it would be great if other OJT students could also experience devotion session. Also, it would be helpful if IDs included an indication of whether a trainee is an Accounting Intern, IT Intern, or from another department. This would improve identification and make it easier to recognize each intern\'s role within the program.', 'I’m really going to miss the whole Web-LCS team, the fun coffee breaks at the smart house, going out to buy food, and break times at the cafeteria. The random stories, jokes, and laughter made the environment feel light and enjoyable. It was such a great experience, and I’ll always remember the friendships and memories we built.', '2025-05-21 13:11:00', '2025-05-21 13:11:00'),
(266, 1, 277, 100, 'Sir mon', 'not enough time with sir mon', 'more time with sir mon', 'Fantastic', '2025-05-23 06:43:05', '2025-05-23 06:43:05'),
(267, 1, 266, 84, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is the learning method. You are guided by the trainers step by step, and you really get to learn gradually and effectively.', 'Some trainers didn’t provide step-by-step guidance, which made it difficult for first-timers to understand and build properly.', 'I suggest teaching trainees step by step first. Once they’re ready, give them tasks or activities they can handle independently without constant guidance.', 'none', '2025-05-26 14:52:22', '2025-05-26 14:52:22'),
(268, 1, 281, 100, 'The Coffee, the people around me and friendships built. I did become confident and it also help me have a goal in my future i now know what steps next to take', 'humihina bigla ung aircon sa room namin. pero all goods naman', 'All goods naman. wala naman. ang init lang maglakad sa carenderya pag maglulunch kasi pricey ang foods sa canteen.', 'wala', '2025-05-26 14:52:44', '2025-05-26 14:52:44'),
(269, 1, 268, 100, 'I like how the Instructor is very friendly and I like how they explain their subject properly and I like the free coffee!', 'pag umaga at sa hapon minsan yung maiinit na tubig di maiinit', 'I suggest giving more time to teach about the basics of the lesson before giving challenge activity', 'none', '2025-05-26 14:55:37', '2025-05-26 14:55:37'),
(270, 1, 273, 100, 'What I like most is that every instructor are approachable.', 'None', 'None', 'No comment/s', '2025-05-26 15:08:42', '2025-05-26 15:08:42'),
(271, 1, 270, 100, 'What I like most is learning and gaining new knowledge every day, which helps me improve and excel. Each new lesson brings me one step closer to becoming a better version of myself and continuing my personal and professional growth. This continuous growth keeps me motivated and excited for what lies ahead.', 'Nothing, I enjoy everything.', 'Keeping up the great work! <3', 'Keeping up the good work pa rin HAHAHAH', '2025-05-26 22:29:50', '2025-05-26 22:29:50'),
(272, 1, 247, 100, 'It\'s about how they teach us and the facilities they provide.', 'Nothing', 'It\'s about how they teach us and the facilities they provide.', 'None', '2025-05-26 23:01:39', '2025-05-26 23:01:39'),
(273, 1, 278, 100, 'Teamwork and enjoy each topic', 'More learning about programming language.', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2025-05-27 06:57:27', '2025-05-27 06:57:27'),
(274, 1, 272, 96, 'I appreciated how the instructors were easy to approach, which helped me to build the tasks or project. The projects or tasks were meaningful and aligned with industry standards, allowing me to build both technical skills and apply my learnings to the future job.', 'None', 'None', 'None', '2025-05-27 07:21:38', '2025-05-27 07:21:38'),
(275, 1, 264, 100, 'Sobrang daming learnings na nabigay sa amin. Lahat ng projects na naibigay sa amin may matututunan talaga. Kahit minsan may mga projects na nahihirapan kame dahil bago palang sa amin pero once nakatapos na kame ng isang project kasama ang mga trainer namin unti unti mas nakakaya na namin gumawa independently sa mga sunod na projects na ibibigay sa amin ng trainer namin. Hindi lang knowledge sa web development ang binigay sa amin ng FBS pati work ethics and yung pagiging God centered  na mas nakakatulong sa team work ng company. \nPumasok ako sa FBS ng zero knowledge pagdating sa web development na kahit mga basic html/css wala akong alam pero lalabas ako ng FBS na confident na kaya ko ng maging isang Front-end Developer sa future work ko. Very thankful kay FBS and sa lahat ng trainers and supervisors.', 'Pag dating sa mga trainers and knowledge na binigay sa amin wala akong hindi nagustuhan lahat goods na goods yun, kagaya ng laging sinasabi ni sir Mon positive. Sayang lang na parang bitin lang yung naging oras ko para umabot sa backend. Pero kung umabot ako sa backend mas nakakaproud na masasabi kong isa akong full stack developer.', 'N/A', 'Thank you FBS sa knowledge and real-world IT experience na nakuha namin.', '2025-05-27 09:11:09', '2025-05-27 09:11:09'),
(276, 1, 263, 100, 'I appreciate how the trainers adjusted their teaching approach based on the trainees\' knowledge, especially since some of us had no prior background in certain topics discussed. I also like the working environment at Frontline Business Solutions; even as a trainee, I feel a sense of belonging during the company fellowships we attend.', 'There is really nothing I dislike about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program. It is understandable that there is limited time for each topic, as we need to cover various subjects within the limited hours required for our OJT.', 'N/A', 'I would like to thank Frontline Business Solutions for making it possible for me to learn web development from scratch, as I can use this skill in the future. I would also like to thank our trainers for teaching us and assisting us whenever we have questions or encounter errors in our projects. Thank you po for being part of our OJT!', '2025-05-27 10:29:14', '2025-05-27 10:29:14'),
(277, 1, 265, 100, 'What I like about the Frontline Business Solution OJT Program is that they teach us from the basics, which helped me a lot since I didn’t know how to start making websites. I learned new skills like tailwind, sass, and react js , which boosted my confidence in coding. The trainers are very skilled, which inspires me to work harder and reminds me why I chose my course. I also discovered that FBS has company fellowship and bible study sessions when they invited us to one. I believe this is why they have such a positive and friendly work environment, and it makes me appreciate the company even more.', 'I don\'t think there is anything I least liked.', 'N/A', 'Thank you so much po!', '2025-05-27 10:38:08', '2025-05-27 10:38:08'),
(278, 1, 271, 60, 'Accommodating and kind instructors and  stuff', 'Nothing', 'as of  now I don\'t see a thing that needs to improve because of how they  operate things here is perfectly fine', 'nothing', '2025-06-03 07:13:26', '2025-06-03 07:13:26'),
(279, 1, 360, 100, 'Being exposed to and gaining hands-on experience in web development.', 'N/A', 'None at the moment. My experience was great and exceeded my expectations.', 'Thank you for teaching me, I learned a lot.', '2025-06-03 09:58:49', '2025-06-03 09:58:49'),
(280, 1, 369, 100, 'Exposure to the corporate scenarios which would help us visualize what is it like to be working in a company.', 'Lack of explanations on certain parts of the program since other trainees/interns are inexperienced. The learning curve may be too steep for others. So proper detailed explanation from basics should be considered.', 'Accommodate interns/trainees that are new to the field and try to know what they know to adjust the learning curve of the program', 'None. Thank you', '2025-08-01 07:23:54', '2025-08-01 07:23:54'),
(281, 1, 361, 100, 'The Trainers and Staff are kind and very accommodating they\'re also very supportive, which makes you feel motivated to do your best. They always make sure you understand the tasks and are willing to help if you have questions. the environment is friendly  and makes learning more enjoyable.', 'I don\'t have much to say about what i like least, because our OJT was very productive. We were given tasks regularly and learned a lot.', 'Honestly, I dont have any suggestions. Everything went well and the internship was already complete and productive', 'I would like to make a comment regarding my OJT in FBS. I really enjoyed the experience because I was able to apply what I’ve learned and also gain new knowledge. The people there were approachable and made us feel comfortable. It was a good environment for learning and growth.', '2025-08-01 07:35:26', '2025-08-01 07:35:26'),
(282, 1, 365, 92, 'I appreciated how all the trainers were supportive and knowledgeable throughout the program. The sessions were well-paced and easy to follow. I especially enjoyed the frontend development training with Sir Vincent—his way of teaching made the lessons more engaging and easier to grasp.', 'For me, I get bored easily, so I didn’t enjoy some of the slower or repetitive parts. But overall, I still appreciated the learning experience.', 'I don’t have any specific suggestions. The program was well-organized and the trainers guided us effectively throughout the training.', 'Thank you to all the trainers for making the experience meaningful. I learned a lot and really enjoyed the training, especially the sessions that challenged me to grow.', '2025-08-01 07:51:06', '2025-08-01 07:51:06'),
(283, 1, 362, 100, 'What i really liked the most about FBS is the people, especially the trainers and staff. Their kindness and warm treatment toward us trainees made a big difference. They never made us feel lonely or pressured because they always made sure we were okay, even during the challenges we faced during our OJT. Our trainer was kind, approachable, and taught us very well. Because of that, we were able to learn a lot before finishing our internship. I will surely miss all the people, the FBS school, and the staff. I feel really grateful to have known this school and all the wonderful trainers and staff here.', 'To be honest, i dont have anything that i liked least about FBS. The entire experience was great, and everyone from the trainers to the staff was very supportive like i said in the first question. I truly enjoyed my time during the OJT, and I\'m thankful for the opportunity to be part of FBS.', 'I dont have any sugestions because for me, the FBS OJT program is already good. Everything went well, and the staff and trainers were very helpful. I\'m happy and thankful for the experience.', 'I dont have any other comments, but i just want to say thank you to all the staff and trainers of FBS. You were all very kind and supportive. I really enjoyed my OJT experience here.', '2025-08-01 07:51:38', '2025-08-01 07:51:38'),
(284, 1, 363, 84, 'What i like  the most in FBS is the supportive environment.  Everyone is willing to help and you really get to learn a lot , especially through real projects related to our course.', 'To be honest, there was nothing I disliked about the OJT. My experience here was smooth, and I really appreciated how supportive the trainer was.', 'N/A', 'Thank you, FBS family, for guiding us and helping us build confidence in our skills during OJT.', '2025-08-01 08:27:24', '2025-08-01 08:27:24'),
(285, 1, 367, 100, 'Ang nagustuhan ko sa  FBS OJT Program ay yung professionalism ng mga trainers and kung gaano sila ka passionate sa pagtuturo. Nagustuhan ko rin yung approach nila sa pagtuturo, yung mastery sa topics na dinidiscuss, at very considerate sila sa learning capacity ng trainees/interns which is nakatulong sa learning progress namin.', 'Since limited lang yung timeframe na irerender namin, medyo nanghiyang lang ako sa ibang topiccs na unfortunately, hindi na namin nacover.', 'Based on my training experience, very satisfied ako sa nagain kong skills maging soft skills man or sa technical skills. Ang masusugest ko lang is imaintain or mas higitan pa yung pagiging hands-on nila sa pagtuturo sa interns/trainees.', 'Gusto ko lang mag-extend ng appreciation sa lahat ng employees na nagwelcome samin sa company and sa magagaling na trainers especially kina Sir Emman, Ma\'am Herlyn, and Sir Vincent.', '2025-08-01 08:31:01', '2025-08-01 08:31:01'),
(286, 1, 368, 100, 'I liked how friendly and approachable the employees are especially the trainers. In our training, they make sure sure that they can explain the lessons in the simplest possible way.', 'I didn\'t feel anything that can make me dislike the ojt program in FBS. I felt welcomed and appreciated in everything we do here.', 'To continue teaching the interns with patience and to continue motivating them.', 'I would like to thank all the employees, especially the trainers, because of their guidance, support, and patience in helping us learn and grow throughout our experience.', '2025-08-01 19:05:17', '2025-08-01 19:05:17'),
(287, 1, 366, 100, 'What I like the most about the company is the welcoming environment.', 'Wala man po', 'Wala rin po. Kayo po the best example ng company that offers OJT Program, hehe.', 'God bless po and thank you so much. Worth it po ang naging 1 ½ months namin with the company.', '2025-08-01 21:00:35', '2025-08-01 21:00:35'),
(288, 1, 364, 100, 'What I liked most about the Frontline OJT Program was the hands-on training. I was able to apply what I learned by doing real tasks. The mentors were also very helpful and guided me whenever I had questions or problems. The training felt organized, and I learned a lot in a short time.', 'There’s nothing that I didn’t like the most about the program. Frontline Business Solutions provided a great learning environment, helpful mentors, and hands-on experience that really helped me grow and improve.', 'No major suggestions. Just continue and maintain the quality of training, support, and hands-on experience. Everything was well-organized and helpful for trainees like me.', 'Thank you, Frontline Business Solutions, for the opportunity to be part of your OJT program. I learned a lot and truly appreciated the support, guidance, and training you provided. It was a great experience that helped me grow both personally and professionally.', '2025-08-02 04:55:49', '2025-08-02 04:55:49'),
(289, 1, 370, 100, 'Ang nagustuhan ko sa program na ito ay ang trainor ay hands-on, and lahat ng aking katanungan ay nabibigyan nya ng mga sagot at isa sa mga nagustuhan ko ay yung kung saan ako nalilito ay naisasaayos niya upang maunawaan ko.', 'N/A, \n\nnagustuhan ko talaga itong one-on-one training program niyo sa akin', 'Though I can desire more of this, but I understand the duration of this training though 1 and half day almost. The Trainor  and the program is already prepared. Good job on this!', 'Thank you for giving me time and understanding! May God bless you all!', '2025-09-17 11:08:02', '2025-09-17 11:08:02'),
(290, 1, 371, 92, 'I like the most about Frontline Business Solutions (FBS) OJT PROGRAM is the people i feel comfortable with, and we playing mobile games like Mobile Legends and some Coffee breaks. They\'re all approachable and easy to fun with.', 'The least I like about the Frontline Business Solution OJT Program is none because i have no any problem.', 'The suggestions i would like to make to improve future FBS OJT PROGRAM is more interaction between interns and other departments, need to include soft skills and career development sessions for future job hunting.', 'Thank you FBS for this opportunity, i learned a lot in accounting firm even though i graduated in my marketing field. My OJT experience at FBS was meaningful i gained practical knowledge and learned how to apply what we studies in accounting, To my mentor I appreciate you how you support and patient to me when i don\'t know what to do but still it\'s my responsibility to know everything by myself in accounting field for my future work, like how to journal entries (basic bookkeeping), balance sheet, trial balance, also the accounting tools: Xero Accounting Software and Quick books Online. I hope more students can experience the same kind of training in the future.', '2025-10-28 10:04:23', '2025-10-28 10:04:23'),
(291, 1, 383, 92, 'what i liked the most about the FBS solution OJT program is they are so related to the real word and they can improve the student skill and they give us idea before we go to work. and i like that every day they have\ntle that can improve our mindset. they are so professional on that', 'i like that this FBS is so professional and the teacher is so nice and they help every student step by step and i like that they have free coffee', 'maybe a comfortable chair and a big white board', 'thankyou for this experience. this is the best because of the strategy and teamwork', '2026-01-28 15:39:38', '2026-01-28 15:39:38'),
(292, 1, 384, 100, 'The thing that I like the most about the Frontline Business Solutions is the opportunity to gain real-world, hands-on experience in a professional business environment.  The program allows trainees to apply what they have learned in school to actual class, develop personal skills, and understand how the real organization operates.', 'What I liked least about Frontline Business Solutions was some tasks was so hard sometimes, which limited the opportunities to explore the other areas of the company.', 'To improve future Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM, I would suggest providing a more structured training plan with clear tasks guidelines and learning objectives for interns.', 'Frontline Business Solutions provides a positive and supportive learning environment for interns. The staff are approachable and professional, especially our Trainer, Ms. Herlyn Mae Torres, which makes the OJT experience both comfortable and educational.', '2026-01-28 15:47:23', '2026-01-28 15:47:23'),
(293, 1, 386, 100, 'pinaka nagustuhan ko dito ay mababait ang mga tranier at iba pang mga trainier magagaling sila lahat magturo at may pa libreng kape pa', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-01-28 15:50:30', '2026-01-28 15:50:30'),
(294, 1, 385, 64, 'The availability of the materials, facility, working environment, and the great things we learn that will not only help us in the future but make us a better person for a great life.', 'to be honest I like the experience here but for me it will probably be on how cold it is in the room.', 'The thing I would like to suggest is to probably have a first aid station or a small clinic to treat future trainees if they got hurt or if something bad happens to them.', 'The whole place is very welcoming and the trainers are very nice.', '2026-01-28 15:50:42', '2026-01-28 15:50:42'),
(295, 1, 388, 80, 'i like the training room because it is very comfortable and also how the trainor teach us about coding and the coffee is free', 'none', 'none', 'The trainer was approachable and supportive, always willing to guide us patiently and uplift us whenever we felt unsure or challenged. They did not only teach us technical skills, but also helped build our self-discipline, responsibility, and confidence. Because of their guidance, we became more enthusiastic, proactive, and determined to improve ourselves.', '2026-01-28 15:51:47', '2026-01-28 15:51:47'),
(296, 1, 390, 96, 'ang pinaka nagustuhan ko po dito ay mabait po sila lahat', 'none', 'none', 'wala po dahil napaka say', '2026-01-28 15:51:56', '2026-01-28 15:51:56'),
(297, 1, 389, 88, 'Ang nagustuhan  ko po ay malamig ang room at naka aircon at tsaka po ang libreng kape. At syempre ang mabait naming maam', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-01-28 15:52:24', '2026-01-28 15:52:24'),
(298, 1, 387, 84, 'i like most about the prontline business solution is all because all of things in fbs is so good and the way to treating us is so good', 'none', 'wala kasi lahat nmn ng meron sa FBS is magaganda at ayos', 'sobrang galing at mabait supportive para maayos namin lahat ng project and never nagalit', '2026-01-28 15:52:33', '2026-01-28 15:52:33'),
(299, 1, 391, 88, 'mahalaga ang frontline dahil nagbibigay ito ng practikal nakaranasan', 'ang hindi ko na gustohan ay ang ang nabibitin ako sa oras', 'maaga dapat ang uwean', 'none', '2026-01-28 15:53:30', '2026-01-28 15:53:30'),
(300, 1, 380, 100, 'I Like most in Frontline Business Solutions ojt  unlimited coffe and the employees are kind and willing to help', 'i like least the limited time because i wanted to learn more.', 'wala namn po', 'frontline business solutions is the best', '2026-01-30 07:04:58', '2026-01-30 07:04:58'),
(301, 1, 381, 24, 'The trainees are kind,and i was able to learn everything I wanted to learn related to my strand. Learning bookkeeping is very important to me because it greatly contributes to my knowledge and will be useful in the future.', 'None', 'I don\'t have any suggestion, because Frontline Business Solution in the best company', 'None', '2026-01-30 07:07:20', '2026-01-30 07:07:20'),
(302, 1, 382, 100, 'What I like most about the FBS OJT Progran is that it helped me grow both acqademically and personally. I learned practical skills beyond what we study in school, especially in responsibility, communication, and confidence. The experience prepared me not only for work but also for real-life challenges.', 'None.', 'The program may be improved by providing more regular feedback to trainees to help them identify their strengths and areas for improvement.', 'Thank you FBS for the opportunity to learn, grow, and gain valuable experience throughout the OJT program.', '2026-01-30 07:09:49', '2026-01-30 07:09:49'),
