(305, 1, 398, 92, 'Coffee', 'Grids, positioning of images and text', 'None', 'I enjoyed my stay as a shut in who enjoys using a pc its like heaven lol', '2026-02-09 10:04:08', '2026-02-09 10:04:08'),
(306, 1, 396, 100, 'making a logo using the figma website', 'making my own website and designing in figma', 'N/A', 'N/A', '2026-02-09 10:06:59', '2026-02-09 10:06:59'),
(307, 1, 405, 80, 'I do like the environment and the professionalism of the mentors/teachers in FBS', 'fast phasing of the tasks', 'FBS should focus more on teaching techniques rather on fast phasing tasks.', 'none', '2026-02-09 10:09:13', '2026-02-09 10:09:13'),
(308, 1, 403, 80, 'Learning about Figma', 'The teaching method is too fast', 'I would suggest that  the pace of teaching be slowed down', 'None', '2026-02-09 10:10:16', '2026-02-09 10:10:16'),
(309, 1, 415, 100, 'PLE is my most favorite about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM, because this taught us to be more closer to God and it also helped us to build our confidence.', 'The room temperature is my least like here at the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM, because it\'s so cold and some of us can\'t handle the cold', 'My suggestion would be a stable internet connection because we experienced having a slow internet during our work hours', 'thank you FBS, especially Sir Vincent for your patience when teaching.', '2026-02-09 10:10:19', '2026-02-09 10:10:19'),
(310, 1, 419, 88, 'In my experiences, i like the most is FIGMA because i able to design with my own ideas and what i want to input  and also i like the most is free unlimited coffee.', 'Not the least but based on my experience i didn\'t catch enough how to do the media query because its kind a hard for me .', 'Nothing, i love the way what they are, i love their personalities, their teachings and helpful skills.', 'none', '2026-02-09 10:10:30', '2026-02-09 10:10:30'),
(311, 1, 407, 100, 'They\'re so supportive, kind and easily approaching. Thanks to them I learned various thing, to technical and to discipline myself.', 'Nothing at all. I had no problem within my 2week of stay here at Frontline Business Solutions.', 'Just keep it up and keep it enjoying for everyone', 'Thank you, Frontline Business Solutions, for making our 2 weeks of stay here amazing and fun, we learned a lot and for sure we will keep your teachings with us for the rest of our lives.', '2026-02-09 10:12:04', '2026-02-09 10:12:04'),
(312, 1, 420, 88, 'The things that i like the most through out the my immersion is learning new things and  they treat us with care', 'Through out my  journey  there\'s none that i didn\'t like or least like', 'Maybe give us more time to expand or to explore more things in web developing', 'The staffs here in Frontline Business is friendly and they would not make you feel like an intern or inferior', '2026-02-09 10:13:18', '2026-02-09 10:13:18'),
(313, 1, 421, 100, 'For me the worker\'s here because most of them is very approachable, and also the figma. With this flatform I use my creativeness to boost my skills when comes arts.', 'I think the developing because as a first timer i don\'t know how to use computer in the proper way.', 'I think none because base in my observation this company is very useful for the students who needs to improve their technical skills and most important is the PLE their so much things that you apply in your everyday life.', 'None', '2026-02-09 10:13:46', '2026-02-09 10:13:46'),
(314, 1, 401, 88, 'I liked how professional and approachable the workers and staffs here. The environment is very supportive and welcoming.', 'Nothing. I\'m satisfied of how much knowledge I\'ve learned.', 'Nothing. I have no suggestions to give. Just keep it how the company is.', 'I have no comments to make. Thank you.', '2026-02-09 10:14:16', '2026-02-09 10:14:16'),
(315, 1, 408, 96, 'What I like the most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT PROGRAM is the PLE  because it helps us realize things that we need to realize and the workers of FBS is friendly and the company is good.', 'I didn\'t have any major dislikes, because I really enjoyed most aspects of it, if I have to think of something maybe it would be that there was so much to learn, it made me feel overwhelming some times. Overall it was a great experience, and I\'m really grateful for the opportunity.', 'I don\'t really have any suggestions for improvement to be honest. Overall it was a really good program and the work environment is super chill and fun, there\'s fun in every corner of FBS company.', 'I just want to thank our instructor sir Vincent for giving us long patience and for always guiding us. and also the FBS company for letting us experience working in your company we really enjoyed it.', '2026-02-09 10:20:06', '2026-02-09 10:20:06'),
(316, 1, 416, 100, 'positive atmosphere', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-02-09 10:20:22', '2026-02-09 10:20:22'),
(317, 1, 413, 72, 'Fun', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-02-09 10:21:17', '2026-02-09 10:21:17'),
(318, 1, 400, 100, 'For me,  i like figma the most because as someone who loves to create different designs. it hones my skills better and showcase my full-potential to the fullest.  Also, the staffs, our mentors, and the environment i can say that FBS is the definition of suitable for everyone because they don\'t want any person left behind and they include everybody in short, they promote inclusivity in this company.', 'Personally, there\'s nothing because everyone here is friendly and the environment is very calm and peaceful.', 'i think the aircon because its so cold but its tolerable.', 'I love FBS, because they teach everyone equally and no favoritism at all. And if i had i chance to comeback here i will gladly accept it.', '2026-02-09 10:22:31', '2026-02-09 10:22:31'),
(319, 1, 399, 96, 'I learned a lot of things and the warm and friendly environment', 'I think everything is great', 'it\'s great as it is right now', 'I do not have any', '2026-02-09 10:22:52', '2026-02-09 10:22:52'),
(320, 1, 412, 100, 'Their professionalism, generosity, guidance, and patience with trainees', 'Nothing,  FBS gave us a better experience', 'keep trainees motivated', 'FBS is the best experience for me i didn\'t expect that it would be fun', '2026-02-09 10:23:35', '2026-02-09 10:23:35'),
(321, 1, 411, 96, 'Their way of teaching is effective, and the equipment we need for coding is complete.', 'none', 'None. For me, overall it\'s really good here.', 'I respectfully suggest slowing down the pace of instruction, as some interns, including myself, are still beginners in coding and may have difficulty keeping up, which can lead to confusion.', '2026-02-09 10:24:25', '2026-02-09 10:24:25'),
(322, 1, 404, 92, 'I like how they are kind and good to us trainees, and they treat us well. And the teachings too I learned so much on this OJT PROGRAM. I LOVE THIS COMPANY EVEN THE FREE COFFEE', 'None', 'None', 'None', '2026-02-09 10:25:11', '2026-02-09 10:25:11'),
(323, 1, 409, 96, 'coding, environment, work atmosphere, friendliness of trainors and senior employees, overall amazing experience.', 'pacing of teaching, some students who are limited in exposure to computers struggle to catch up leading to being too stressed out to continue and lowers their self esteem. I would like for there to be additional guidance and support for beginners so that they can catch up and not stressed out too much.', 'Additional guidance and support for beginners, making sure that each have the same if not closer progress and learning experience.', 'none.', '2026-02-09 10:28:34', '2026-02-09 10:28:34'),
(324, 1, 422, 100, 'What I liked most about the company was the supportive and healthy working environment. I really love how the employees were kind, respectful and approachable towards us.', 'For me, it was the adapting to a new schedule and new environment. Although, it was difficult at first but this experience taught me to become more adaptable person and it helped me to manage my time better.', 'None.', 'I would like to express my sincere gratitude to FBS for giving me this opportunity to be part of the work immersion program. I truly appreciated the positive and healthy environment, where everyone was kind and approachable. It helped me grow not only as a student but also as an individual.  And to our trainer,  Sir Vincent, thank you so much for your patience and understanding. Despite the many questions we asked, you were willing to guide and teach us.  Thanks for being part of my Grade 12  journey. I will definitely miss FBS : ((', '2026-02-09 10:37:57', '2026-02-09 10:37:57'),
(325, 1, 438, 92, 'What i liked the most about FBS is their open staff. i commend my trainer that is Sir Vincent, for showing me the importance of what he thought to us during my stay in FBS. he explained every bit of detail when it comes to teaching, and that goes the same to all employees of FBS. i also liked the strictness of the business, as it further improved my discipline and time management. I enjoyed my time at FBS, and im sure that i will see it again in my bright future.', 'what i disliked about FBS was the lack of directions, and the minimal materials on necessary privileges like the bathroom, and the offices. i noticed that the offices were also ran by dust, and there were no official cafeteria during my stay.', 'i would like to suggest to further improve signs for directions, a more maintained restroom, and some tiny aromas in offices, due to the dust settling in, it introduced a concrete smell.', 'me and my fellow classmates will miss sir vincent, one of the goat trainers of all time at FBS fr, it was fun while it lasted, well make sure to never forget that experience.  GGS! GOAT', '2026-03-02 11:14:26', '2026-03-02 11:14:26'),
(326, 1, 446, 100, 'Everyone is very professional, Very focused and helpful. This has been an immense experience and boost to my foundational knowledge.', 'I have to wake up at 4am due to the strictness of the Time-In', 'None, from my experience every step of the program has been well planned and well thought out', 'Perfect!', '2026-03-06 13:22:58', '2026-03-06 13:22:58'),
(327, 1, 444, 100, 'libreng kape tas its fun here and comfy', 'nothing', 'ergo chair yung malambot na makakatulog ka joke lng po', 'none', '2026-03-06 13:23:33', '2026-03-06 13:23:33'),
(328, 1, 445, 96, 'yung trainer po namin is very hands on  po sa pag tuturo,  then  the place po is comfortable', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-03-06 13:23:47', '2026-03-06 13:23:47'),
(329, 1, 447, 100, 'The trainers and the fact that they teach us from scratch. it\'s just that they\'re way too fast, I couldn\'t keep up. Their consideration is peak.', 'The place outside of the office, not only is the place has trash everywhere, the sun beams outside, it burns to the skin', 'The place cannot be changed so, no further suggestions, this program is perfect.', 'Mr. Vincent Ramirez is the most chill person I\'ve known, including my mom.', '2026-03-06 13:25:33', '2026-03-06 13:25:33'),
(330, 1, 452, 100, 'my favorite about thing fbs in the proffesionalism of all employee, they treat us like we are a part of the company and not students who are trying to learn.', 'hands on actvities', 'as far as i can tell this company exceeded all my expectations', 'none', '2026-03-06 13:25:53', '2026-03-06 13:25:53'),
(331, 1, 442, 96, 'Ang nagustuhan ko sa FBS OJT Program  ay ang hands-on learning ng Figma, Html, Css, at Javascript. Pati narin ang kanilang aircon na parang nasa ibang bansa anlamig, also the free coffee  that gives me energy in the morning. Most importantly our  instructor sir roy, vincent and our instructors that taught us  how figma, css, html, and java script works.', 'well the  extreme cold in the room and the weird feeling of being outside that is extremely hot', 'maybe an activity that the whole class can work on, that would be fun.', 'nothing', '2026-03-06 13:27:12', '2026-03-06 13:27:12'),
(332, 1, 450, 100, 'I am able to apply and improve my technical skills (specifically about Graphic Design, Web Design, and Web Development) thanks to the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program.  Moreover, the trainers are kind and approachable and I was able to enjoy the workplace environment along with learning about programs and websites that i wasn\'t initially familiar with like Figma.', 'None, I find extreme satisfaction with my experience in regards to this OJT Program.', 'I suggest for this whole  OJT program from  Frontline Business Solutions to maintain it\'s high quality experience.', 'None, other than I would like to show my gratitude and thank the trainers and staff involved for this OJT Program.', '2026-03-06 13:27:39', '2026-03-06 13:27:39'),
(333, 1, 449, 100, 'they\'re coffe hehe, and the teachers are so kind and respectful and they have a lot of patience', 'its so cold when you sit on your chair for 2 to 3 hours and nakatutok sayo yung aircon huhuhu', 'pag dating sa loob ayusin lng ng konti chair arrangement para di natututukan ng aircon mga students or workers po nakakanginig ng kamay and yeah hirap mag type AAHHAHA, nakaka tae din po huhuhu, and sa labas naman po, super init po pag dating sa tanghali, kahit konting bubong poor something na makakapag less init po hehe, kasi baka po mag kasakit ibang bata from lamig then init agad po, yun lang po hehehe, FREE TINAPAY WITH COFFEEEEE SANAAAAA', 'im going to miss frontlines, at mga naging prof namin, pero KAPE PADIN CHAKA TINAPAYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYYY', '2026-03-06 13:27:57', '2026-03-06 13:27:57'),
(334, 1, 453, 92, 'The trainers are so professional and very discipline. Also one thing I like is they have free coffee.', 'Nothing', 'I don\'t think there is nothing to improve though', 'Thanks  you for Everything FBS!!', '2026-03-06 13:29:34', '2026-03-06 13:29:34'),
(335, 1, 448, 96, 'The environment is good, and people too.', 'If you are late, you go home.', 'More details on how to use Figma, not just do this do that.', 'Frontline is good 8/10', '2026-03-06 13:29:55', '2026-03-06 13:29:55'),
(336, 1, 372, 96, 'yung nagustuhan ko dito sa frontline business solutions kung pano nila ihandle ang bawat trainee and napaka professional ng bawat isa at talagang tutok sila para na din sa mga trainees para maiready sa kanilang real-world career.', 'none', 'none', 'none', '2026-04-10 08:45:39', '2026-04-10 08:45:39'),
(337, 1, 374, 96, 'The apparent expertise and patience of the trainers. It took me a while to absorb most of the fundamentals because it\'s my first time coding in HTML and CSS but the trainers were able to get me started and going.', 'I don\'t have any in mind.', 'I think the program is already great 😅', 'None for now.', '2026-04-10 08:50:46', '2026-04-10 08:50:46'),
(338, 1, 441, 96, 'As a computer engineering student who has little knowledge on web development. I am thankful for all the knowledge shared by our trainers and for having a welcoming establishment.', 'I just liked least the deadlines of some projects since I think some need more time. But most of the time the given deadline is very fair.', 'I have no suggestions to give. I think the program is great as it is .', 'I am thankful for the opportunity given to me to be part of this program. Our trainers did a great job on guiding us and giving the knowledge that we need for the future.', '2026-04-10 09:23:58', '2026-04-10 09:23:58'),
(339, 1, 394, 92, 'the program itself, since it is a great start for a student to learn skills that will be needed in the industry.', 'None. The offered program is well suitable for students who will pursue  a career in IT industry', 'only the minimal things like some of the keyboards and mouse are not working. But overall the facility is well maintained, well equipped, and everything that the students need is provided', 'I would like to thank FBS OJT program for the new skills that they have taught, I can use this skills for a better job offers and for my personal growth.', '2026-04-10 09:37:24', '2026-04-10 09:37:24'),
(340, 1, 393, 100, 'very light lang di pressured and industry grade ang mga courses and projects', 'wala naman', 'just continue what you do', 'wala naman', '2026-04-10 11:40:41', '2026-04-10 11:40:41'),
(341, 1, 379, 100, 'I liked that the OJT program challenged me with tasks that were not easy. It helped me improve my skills and learn more. The instructors were also helpful and guided us when needed. It made me more confident in doing real work.', 'what I liked least was that some tasks were difficult and sometimes hard to understand at first. It could be a bit overwhelming, but I still learned from it in the end.', 'I don’t have many suggestions because the training is really good and gives real-world experience. The trainers are also very skilled and helpful. Maybe the only thing to improve is the computers, since some units have damaged screens and defective peripherals.', 'none', '2026-04-14 00:01:26', '2026-04-14 00:01:26'),
(342, 1, 373, 100, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the hands-on experience and the opportunity to work on real-world projects. It helped me improve both my technical and communication skills, especially in web development and collaborating with clients and team members. I also appreciated the supportive and chill work environment because it made learning more comfortable and less stressful while still being productive. Through the program, I was able to learn new tools, gain practical industry experience, and become more confident in handling tasks independently.', 'None so far', 'One suggestion I would like to make for improving the future Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program is to provide more structured training or short workshops for interns at the beginning of the program. This could help trainees adjust faster to the workflow, tools, and expectations. It would also be helpful to have more regular feedback sessions so interns can better track their progress and continue improving their skills throughout the training. Overall, the program was already a great learning experience with a supportive and chill environment.', 'None so far', '2026-05-13 09:21:26', '2026-05-13 09:21:26'),
(343, 1, 459, 96, 'I like the healthy and welcoming environment the most. it makes me glad and happy na such environments exist  (unlike LC. :))', 'medyo mabilis po ung turo.. pero nung una po un sonow po maganda po hehe', 'ano po uhhh, sana may bootcamp po kau na total introduction to IT and coding for atleast a few days po hehe', 'wala naman po', '2026-05-14 15:50:15', '2026-05-14 15:50:15'),
(344, 1, 456, 100, 'The learnings', 'none', 'the equipments', 'none', '2026-05-15 14:35:26', '2026-05-15 14:35:26');
INSERT INTO `lcssv2_trainee_evaluation` (`trainee_evaluation_aid`, `trainee_evaluation_is_active`, `trainee_evaluation_trainee_id`, `trainee_evaluation_ratings`, `trainee_evaluation_like_most`, `trainee_evaluation_like_least`, `trainee_evaluation_to_improve`, `trainee_evaluation_other_comments`, `trainee_evaluation_created`, `trainee_evaluation_datetime`) VALUES
(345, 1, 437, 100, 'the opportunity to gain real-world experience in web development and backend programming. The program allowed me to apply the knowledge I learned in school to actual company projects such as HRIS and FTC systems. I also appreciated the guidance and support from the trainer', 'none', 'I would like to suggest adding cybersecurity training and network training to the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program.', 'I am thankful for the opportunity to be part of the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program. The experience helped me improve my technical skills, communication, teamwork, and confidence in handling real-world projects and now i know that standard in web development. I also appreciate the guidance and support from the trainers and staff, and I hope the company continues helping future trainees gain valuable industry experience.', '2026-05-15 14:39:48', '2026-05-15 14:39:48'),
(346, 1, 432, 100, 'what i like the most was the techniques and the way of thinking that they show to us', 'I can’t think of anything because there wasn’t anything I didn’t like.', 'i think i would like to suggest the upgrade of the PCs and CPUs', 'none', '2026-05-15 14:42:17', '2026-05-15 14:42:17'),
(347, 1, 431, 100, 'As a student, it helped me understand how actual work environments function beyond classroom discussions. I also liked how the tasks were related to my field, especially in web development and system implementation, because I was able to improve both my technical and problem-solving skills. The environment was also very approachable and student-friendly. The IT trainers was supportive, patient, and willing to guide interns whenever we had questions or encountered problems. Overall, the program felt very productive and helped me gain confidence, experience, and a better understanding of the industry.', 'What I liked least about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was that some tasks could become repetitive at times, especially during long hours of debugging or testing. There were also moments when workloads suddenly became heavy, which could feel a bit overwhelming as a student intern adjusting to real industry pacing.', 'At the moment, I do not have any major suggestions for improvement because the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program provided a good learning experience overall.', 'NA', '2026-05-15 14:59:44', '2026-05-15 14:59:44'),
(348, 1, 427, 100, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the opportunity to gain real-world experience in a professional work environment. The program helped me improve my technical and communication skills, especially in full-stack development, while working on actual projects and collaborating with experienced developers. I also appreciated the supportive mentors and hands-on learning experience, which helped me become more confident, responsible, and prepared for my future career in the IT industry.', 'What I liked least about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was that some tasks and deadlines could become challenging and fast-paced at times, especially when balancing multiple responsibilities. There were also moments when instructions changed quickly, which required extra adjustment and adaptability. However, these challenges also helped me improve my time management, problem-solving, and ability to work under pressure.', 'I suggest that Frontline Business Solutions give clearer instructions and more hands-on tasks for interns. More guidance and teamwork activities would also help interns learn and improve their skills better.', 'I’m thankful for the opportunity given by Frontline Business Solutions. The OJT helped me improve my skills in full-stack development and gave me real experience in working on projects. I learned a lot and it really helped me prepare for my future job.', '2026-05-17 01:45:33', '2026-05-17 01:45:33'),
(349, 1, 425, 88, 'I like the program syllabus as the learnings are up to date. The culture of the company is great. The trainers bring out the best in trainees.', 'Based on my experience, some lessons are not focused on as much as the others.', 'Some trainers need to improve their teaching styles to cater each trainees needs based on their own preferred learning methods.', 'The OJT Program made my OJT journey  remarkable by providing me the necessary skills as a developer, be it soft or technical skills. I would like to thank the people that I\'ve met for this experience. I hope we still cross paths someday.', '2026-05-18 00:55:03', '2026-05-18 00:55:03'),
(350, 1, 426, 100, 'The part of the OJT Program that I like the most in Frontline Business Solutions, Inc. is the first part of the training which highlights doing from scratch in the field of UI/UX Designing and Frontend Development.', 'I think what I least like about the OJT Program is the backend part of the training, not because I do not prefer backend, but more of I find the time is not long enough to learn the basics of backend, but I look forward to mastering that part as well when there is more time opportunity.', 'I would suggest to focus on deploying trainers for backend that is efficient as our trainer in frontend (Ma\'am Herlyn), as her teaching style became my standard, where she was able to determine each corner of UI/UX Designing and Frontend Development, that is necessary for the interns to understand. Under her training, I was able to learn a lot about frontend, and it eventually made me realize that despite doubting myself from my capability in the future on pursuing this on the industry.', 'With the overall experience, I highly recommend FBS as training ground for people who wanted to experience an \"industry-ready\" type of training.', '2026-05-18 00:58:07', '2026-05-18 00:58:07'),
(351, 1, 429, 96, 'What I liked most about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was the hands-on experience in web development. The program gave me the opportunity to apply what I learned in school to real projects, which helped improve my technical skills and problem-solving abilities. I also appreciated the supportive environment, where mentors and team members were willing to guide and share their knowledge. Overall, the experience helped me become more confident, responsible, and prepared for a future career in the IT industry.', 'One thing I liked least about the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program was that we were not able to fully complete our final project because our required 486 training hours ended before it could be finalized. However, the experience was still very valuable because it allowed us to apply our web development skills, collaborate with the team, and gain real-world industry experience within the given timeframe.', 'I suggest continuing the hands-on approach and real-world web development tasks because they are very helpful for trainees. It would also be nice to have more opportunities for trainees to collaborate on projects and learn from different team members.', 'I am grateful for the opportunity to be part of the Frontline Business Solutions OJT Program. The experience helped me improve my web development knowledge, communication skills, and confidence in working in a professional environment.', '2026-05-18 06:13:13', '2026-05-18 06:13:13'),
(352, 1, 377, 100, 'The facility and trainers', 'The parking space for the OJT trainees', 'Find ways to make the backend lessons get easier', 'Overall, it was good having FBS as our OJT partner', '2026-05-21 20:45:21', '2026-05-21 20:45:21'),
(353, 1, 458, 100, 'What I appreciate most about FBS is the practical learning outcomes; the curriculum genuinely aligns with industry standards, allowing me to seamlessly apply my skills to real-world scenarios. Additionally, the team here treats you like one of their own, providing incredible guidance and support throughout the entire training process.', 'None', 'I do not have any suggestions for improvement, as the program is already exceptional. The curriculum is fully aligned with current technology and industry standards, making the learning outcomes directly applicable to real-world scenarios. Furthermore, the supportive environment created by the employees—who treat you like a teammate and offer constant guidance—ensures that the training is both effective and highly rewarding.', 'Thank You Very much for the guidance and support :)', '2026-06-15 13:05:16', '2026-06-15 13:05:16');
